{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "90",
 "name": "Ratha",
 "file": "Map90_Ratha.xml",
 "includes": [
  "Map90a_Sand_Sprites_Ochre_La'heke.xml",
  "Map90d_Taisgath.xml"
 ],
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":-22,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Neh Dock, Port of Ratha","descriptions":["Yells and shouts fill the surroundings as dock workers communicate in the only way that is fitting for this noisy, hectic environment.  A couple young boys watch the work anxiously, planning their future and their torment.","Though night turns the sea to black and turns the majority of Rathan citizens inside, work on the dock never seems to cease entirely as workers continue to ply their trade."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":307,"exit":"go","move":"go night sky"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":2,"x":-22,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Neh Dock, Port of Ratha","descriptions":["Supporting the largest vessels from far-away lands, the dock has greeted both smuggler and prince, murderer and king.  It continues to perform its duty flawlessly though, without prejudice or regret."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":123,"exit":"go","move":"go skirr'lolasu"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Neh Dock","Crossing"]},
  {"id":3,"x":-22,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Neh Dock, Port of Ratha","descriptions":["Wide and well-built, this dock was made to accommodate the heavy caravans that pass over it daily.  Workers load and unload ships in an almost endless flurry of activity.","Wide and well-built, this dock was made to accommodate the heavy caravans that pass over it daily.  A few workers continue loading and unloading rush shipments into the night."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":306,"exit":"go","move":"go kree'la"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":4,"x":-22,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The eastern end of the Ratha warehouses stands like a wall at the side of the Port Walk.  Some very shady-looking characters pass by, maybe an uneasy blend of pirate and trader, legal when they have to be, otherwise when opportunity offers."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":87,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go neh dock"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":-2,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Though seamy, dirty, and noisy, the Port Walk hums with life.  People from all the provinces, from all the races, stride past, each with his own goal and purpose.  They charge the air with a kind of energy and put on a dazzling show of the colors, the customs, the food, the dress, and the languages of every city and island under the triple moons."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":18,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The harbor at this end of the walk is crowded with small craft -- rowboats mostly -- in which the fishermen of the city bring their catch to shore.  The pungent smell of the fish lingers long after they've been unloaded, and the discarded bait and offal in the water is much enjoyed by the gulls."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go bait shop"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":38,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The main road, broad and bumpy with ruts from thousands of wagon wheels, proceeds east and west between several large temporary storage areas.  Boxes, bales, barrels, chests and trunks of every kind are organized by lot and assigned their piece of ground.  Private guards stand watch, gazing suspiciously at every passerby."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":259,"exit":"go","move":"go carousel"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":58,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The shattered remains of a fluted alabaster fountain squat immobile and unmourned in the middle of this busy square.  Well-to-do merchants dressed in fur and silk step lively around beggars missing assorted limbs.  Dingy, ramshackle houses line both sides of the road, furnishing cheap and seedy quarters for the unsqueamish."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":7,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":321,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden structure"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":78,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Road","descriptions":["The bustling dock areas provide a constant stream of traffic along the quays and up into the town proper along the main road.  Local militia, resplendent in plumed helms, their scales buffed and tinted with the town livery, keep a wary eye on foreign traveler and resident citizen alike."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":10,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":98,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["A sharp breeze whips a stinging fan of icy spray through the air over this short promontory that rises above the sea.  The smell of rotting vegetation clings close and heavy.  A few mold-covered, surf-worn benches lay alongside the path in shadows."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":836,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Premium Portal","Portal"]},
  {"id":11,"x":118,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["A low, sprawling building made of grey sandstone and blue mortar dominates the square.  A pair of roaring griffons carved in granite flank its arching entranceway.  Thrusting forward from its faded, white tiled roof is a banner portraying the movement of coins from hand to open hand, on a field of silver: the Bank of the Port.  Despite the splendor the bank is boarded up, a victim of poor times and stiff competition."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":138,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["A high lectern, reachable by a narrow set of steep steps, stands squeezed between two long-disused buildings to the north.  Several men take turns shouting out destinations, cargoes, quantities and prices to the jostling crowd, as messenger runners constantly whisper information in their ears.  Passing merchants stop, listen intently for a while, then continue swiftly on their way."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":158,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Groups of urchins clothed in filthy rags scramble about the badly pitted street, screaming with delight as they pelt passersby with small, hard stones.  Occassionally a rock connects with a target, drawing blood and howls of anger.  But when a guard shows up the children melt away, running swiftly through the alleyways they know better than anyone else."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":122,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":12,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":245,"exit":"go","move":"go tavern"}],"aliases":["Bawdy Swains"]},
  {"id":14,"x":178,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The evil smells emanating from a series of long brown huts made out of wattled stucco proclaim their allegiance to the leather trade.  A dozen Humans in grimy linen smear brown ointment on skins stretched tautly over wooden frames.  Others tend fires, fanning flames and feeding them chips of wood.  Dogs roam about the area, barking excitedly and occasionally yelping as a worker casually kicks one out of the way."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":13,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":178,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Frowning warehouses, several stories high with projecting cranes, front the winding road.  Covered with pale, peeling blue paint and caked white in places with encrusted salt, these shuttered buildings are barred and triple-locked against poachers.  Each lock bears the seal of the municipal guard, in some cases vigorously defaced with a knife by some previously frustrated burglar."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":16,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":871,"exit":"go","move":"go dock","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":16,"x":198,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["A freshly scrubbed edifice of white brick lies to the north.  Above its stately teakwood gate is a sapphire blue shield bearing crossed yellow keys, the symbol of the Traders' Guild.  Many citizens of substance regularly enter and leave its premises, glancing around proudly at the well-trimmed hedge of peregan trees.  A stone statue poses majestically before the guildhall's entrance, gazing out over the open ocean."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["Traders' Guild"]},
  {"id":17,"x":218,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["To the south looms a wooden building, painted a leering red.  Its gaudy, golden window shutters are closed, but the door has been jammed open.  Raucous screams of rage and pain and laughter, shouts for drink, and scraps of music flow unceasingly from inside the doss-house.  Guards glance away self-consciously as they pass by, and merchants perceptibly quicken their pace on the road northeast or west."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":805,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy structure"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":258,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["To both sides of the path, tall, narrow houses with dark slits for windows lean precariously against one another, like old people gathering strength from close company in a blustering wind.  Their red-shingled roofs have rotted to brown, and their windows are boarded shut.  From somewhere to the southwest a ragged scar of jumbled music and laughter rises incoherently, then falls away to nothing."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":17,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":238,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Sturdy longshoremen use hooked poles of iron and thick gorse ropes to lever ship cargoes onto and across this dock.  The constant wash of brine scrubs the pier and posts like a rough razor.  Tax assessment officers regularly appear, checking off arrivals and departures, blandly ignoring the stares and poorly hidden curses of passengers and crew alike."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":262,"exit":"go","move":"go dock"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":278,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The road skirts its winding way between the roaring turquoise-colored surf to the south, and the weatherbeaten cliffs and scrag-oaks to the north.  A few piles of wooden debris would pass unnoticed if not for the tiny vegetable gardens outlined with small, irregular stones that adjoin each. "],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":298,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["The Port Walk's fractured cobblestone paving gives way to a broad sand path strewn with broken shells, strands of seaweed, and driftwood drying in the breeze.  A small trail heads north toward the cliffs that hem the narrow band between true earth and salt sea.  The ocean's voice, ranging from soft whisper to beast's roar, sounds across the beach."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":20,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":800,"exit":"go","move":"go wood shack"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":318,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["Shrill cries from ospreys nesting in the cliffs mix with the slap of the surf on the beach.  The huge nests, woven from driftwood, seaweed and assorted debris, are clearly visible against the light color of the cliff's face.  Every so often, one of the great birds launches itself into the breeze to soar over the waves.  Oceanward, pinnacles of rock carved by the sea's touch rise from the water."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":338,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["Sweeping between the ocean and cliffs, the serpentine curves of the beach reach toward a towering cliff in the distance.  Wind-sculpted dunes parallel the beach, but the tide prevents them from encroaching past the highwater level.  Burrows in the dunes and nests wedged in the tough grass provide homes for a variety of creatures."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":358,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["Small groups of sandpipers play tag with the waves as they dash along the beach.  The little birds occasionally pause in their game to investigate bits of seaweed or gobble up sand lice.  The waves, forced to travel around an offshore jumble of rocks, hit the beach at an angle."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":834,"exit":"go","move":"go offshore rocks"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":378,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["Delicate red and yellow sandflowers nestle among clumps of hardy dune grass.  Several stone slabs have been arranged, either by nature or landsmen, to form a table and seating.  Trash near one of the stone seats suggests that someone has dined here recently.  The beach narrows as it curves north toward the cliffs."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":24,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":378,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Beach","descriptions":["The beach deadends at the cliff's face -- not even a thin ribbon of sand separates the water from the massive rock slabs that tumble against each other and into the ocean.  Spume washes the formations of stacked rocks as each wave strikes on their endless roll landward."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":322,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":325,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt slabs"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":178,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Quartermasters carrying bills of lading make their way to a dilapidated wooden shop set back from the road.  Though the shop itself is small, Captain Namazzi's Chandlery is well known for its extensive variety of preserved meats and other food for long voyages, as well as barrels, ropes and other supplies needed by any working ship that wishes to make ready for a voyage."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":327,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":178,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["The road widens to the south to support the wagons and carts from the chandler's shop.  A warehouse beside the shop sees heavy traffic as burly Gor'Tog stevedores assemble orders placed by the quartermasters of ships in the harbor.  Each customer is sure that their order is most important, and their vociferous demands reflect that belief."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":27,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":178,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Young children play beside a cozy whitewashed cottage nestled between two larger homes.  The smell of cooking wafts through the air from an opened window.  Lacy white curtains and window boxes filled with bright red geraniums complete the picturesque scene."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":28,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":178,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Small homes line the street as it wends its way along the base of the eastern cliffs.  The black basalt escarpment towers high above, sheltering the town from the ravages of wind and sea.  Faint white lines of dried salt mar the solid black rock walls of the cliff, a grim reminder that their shelter is tenuous, at best."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":31,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":158,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["The road bends to the southeast as it wends its way toward the docks.  A knot of pedestrians cluster around a pushcart laden with fresh fruit and juice for thirsty travelers.  Burly Gor'Tog porters jostle their way through the crowd, carrying heavy boxes and chests slung over their backs as they make their way from the harbor to the nearby inn."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":30,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["pushcart"]},
  {"id":32,"x":158,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["A small shrine stands in a shallow niche in the cliff wall.  The concave floor of the niche acts as a basin, currently empty, but streaked with rust-colored stains and bits of feathers.  Strands of shark's teeth dangle from an iron pole, clattering against each other in the wind.  Passersby hurry past, averting their faces from anyone gathered here.  At the back of the niche, a dark hole offers a faint glimpse of scattered bones, silent offerings to propitiate the sea."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":33,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Drogor"]},
  {"id":33,"x":138,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["A cat darts down a narrow alley which runs along the back of the inn, between the building and the cliff face.  As the road meanders southwards toward the sea, the carvings on the cliff face change from flowers and vines to images of merfolk.  A vein of quartz in the rocky surface gives an illusion of cresting waves, enhanced by the clever chisel of the sculptor."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":32,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow alley"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":138,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Built against the rocky cliff wall is the local inn, Jack Tarr's Rest, set back from the busy road.  The aroma of baking fish wafts through the air from the kitchens, while local traders relax as they recount tales of their voyages -- daring escapes from local pirates, successful bargains with the craftsmen of Mer'Kresh, the beauties of Aesry Surlaenis'a -- all these and more may be heard during the course of the day."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":35,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":118,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Over the years, sculptors have exercised their talents and their chisels upon the rocky escarpment which shelters the town from the elements, covering the black rock wall with an intricate design of intertwined flowers and vines.  An opening in the wall leads to a cavern which houses a prosperous family of carpet weavers, one of whom evidently practices her trade on a loom outside the shop."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":328,"exit":"go","move":"go carpet shop"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":98,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["The walls of the cliff abut the road as it runs along the eastern end of the tier.  Birds build nests in the black rock surface, their raucous cries echoing about the area.  The buildings sport weathered grey wood shutters to keep out the wind and storms, while many roofs are designed with a narrow walkway around a cupola where women may stand to watch the sea, hoping for the return of loved ones."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":78,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Young traders bustle by with self-important expressions as they run errands for their masters.  A Halfling woman occupies her time berating a Gor'Tog laborer as he attempts to right an overturned tumbril before the local street rats can filch the delivery.  Though the cart is covered by a tarpaulin, the air is redolent with the aroma of dried ambergris and other less immediately recognizeable fragrances."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":863,"exit":"go","move":"go alchemy society"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":58,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["An elderly S'Kra Mur woman, her features half-hidden by her voluminous black robe, sweeps the street outside a white stucco house.  As she works, she mutters under her breath and clicks her tongue, each syllable a sibilant imprecation against the dust or the ingratitude of her children.  Noticing you watching, she hisses angrily, before returning to her soliloquy to her broom."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":38,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["A strong scent of burning food wafts through a wrought iron gate in a red brick wall.  Behind the wall, a brick courtyard leads to a rather neglected old house -- the mullions of its windows are stained with soot, and the door hangs half-off its hinges, while the plants in the terracotta urns beside the entry have long since withered in the heat."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":18,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Reddish dust lies in a thin layer over the awnings which shade the walkway along the side of the street.  The dust dulls the colorful canvas, giving the scene an odd, monochromatic quality in the bright sunlight.  Nearby, a young S'Kra Mur woman saunters past carrying a terracotta waterjar balanced atop her head.  From the simple patterns of her face-paint, she seems to be a minor servant rather than the daughter of the house.","Reddish dust lies in a thin layer over the awnings which shade the walkway along the side of the street.  The dust colors the canvas, giving the scene a golden tinge in the cool silvery moonlight.  Nearby, a young S'Kra Mur man staggers past, evidently somewhat worse for the wear.  From the somewhat atonal quality of his singing, he won't face the morning with any sense of joy or pleasure."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":41,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":797,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":-2,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["Clouds of dust rise from the street as burly Gor'Togs wearing the liveries of well-to-do merchant families trot past.  Some work in pairs to loft thick bamboo poles bearing silk-shrouded wicker or rattan sedan chairs, while others pull at humble tumbrels filled with rare goods for the House vaults.  The spicy aroma of k'dira leaves pervades the air as the sun beats down on the drying racks carefully arranged outside a tiny shop.  A canvas awning shades the interior from the sun.","Terra cotta jars filled with rose-scented oil stand on either side of the entrance to a tiny shop.  A canvas awning is rolled back for the evening to allow the cool night breezes to flow into the dimly-lit interior of the building."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":53,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":257,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":-22,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["A network of roads converge from six directions, leaving traffic in a chaotic swirl not seen since the universe was formed.  Carters argue with sedan-chair bearers and small children and animals dart in and out amongst scurrying porters as they struggle to make sense of the maelstrom.  A harried civil official stands atop a small pillar in the center of it all, trying, and failing, to bring some order to the near-mob."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":45,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":43,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":118,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":119,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":-42,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Blind Alley","descriptions":["Littered and dirty, this alley looks little used.  Getting caught in this alley in the wee hours of the morning is not a pleasant thought, though there seem to be few places for mischievous miscreants to hide."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":-62,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Blind Alley","descriptions":["A wall of refuse brings an end to travel along this alley.  Rats, mice and neighborhood cats frequent the area in search of pungent victuals.  A broken door lies against the remains of a crumbling fence that partially covers a broken sewer grating."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":732,"exit":"go","move":"go grating","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["First Tier"]},
  {"id":45,"x":-2,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["Cheap perfume and over-loud laughter wafts from behind deep-shaded windows hung with heavy curtains that line the upper story of a whitewashed stone building.  An almost exclusively male patronage seems intent on avoiding notice as they hurry into and out of the interior."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":42,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":-2,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["A row of tumbledown shacks and low buildings marks one edge of the seedier quarters in this section of town.  The click of dice and low voices echo among the shanties as the occasional furtive figure darts out of one doorway and vanishes into another."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":47,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":38,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The wide road swings in a gentle curve, avoiding the dark stone bulk of the Merchant's Bank.  Lesser stone buildings rise on either side, like attendants on a noble lord."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":78,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The traffic swirls and forms small tangled knots as the road splits, one path leading to the solid facade of the Merchant's Bank, while the other roads lead down to the docks and up into the center of town and the higher tiers.  A brace of heavily armed guards watches over the roadway leading to the bank, keeping a wary eye out for trouble.  The throng of pedestrians mingles with the occasional dray or laden caravan in an ever-changing kaleidoscope of colors and textures."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":47,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":78,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["Curious spires of rock, whether native to the spot or carved by some forgotten artist, form a bottleneck to the busy streams of traffic flowing up and down the roadway.  Over the years, passersby have carved names, initials and colorful (and sometimes off-color) slogans on every aspect of the rocks."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":50,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":78,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["Traffic, both wheeled and on foot, wends its way up from the busy docklands and down from the commercial heart of the town.  Here and there, brightly colored awnings have been strung across the road to provide the occasional bit of shade.  Several children, S'Kra and Human, Elf and Gor'Tog, play a hearty game of ball with no discernable rules, discernable to the passing adult at least.","Traffic, both wheeled and on foot, wends its way up from the busy docklands and down from the commercial heart of the town.  Here and there, brightly colored awnings have been strung across the road to provide the occasional bit of shade during the day."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":9,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go high guardhouse"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":98,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bank Street","descriptions":["A short stretch of road winds from Greater Cobra Road towards the gilded entrance to the Bank of Ratha.  Beggars and mountebanks and peddlers wheedle or proclaim or grasp at the hems of passersby, each trying to gain attention (and some coins) from the hurrying throng.","Guttering lanterns set high on poles shed a watery glow along the steep road leading to the Bank of Ratha.  In a land where business never sleeps, the bank keeps late hours for the convenience of all.  The wise traveler keeps well away from the deeper shadows along the wayside though, for legitimate business is not all that never sleeps."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":252,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":-22,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["This pleasant square marks the center of social life for the down and out of Ratha.  Despite the noise and confusion and occasional screams from the great intersection to the south, a certain calmness pervades this spot.  A tiny park forms a rare green space in this cramped city of stone."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":-22,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["This busy intersection swarms with trade and traffic of all manner and description.  To the north, small shops for the lower classes vie with run-down hovels and the occasional soup kitchen.  The main road splits into three parts as it winds its way down to the docks.  A small park is visible amongst the stark stonework of the city to the south as well."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":-22,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The wide road leading from the docks to the lift makes a sharp bend as it passes a ruined pile of stones that was once a building.  Apparently ravaged by fire or some other disaster, the occupants have deserted the shell.  The remaining stones are cracked and blackened, the good ones having been removed by the local denizens to build their own houses."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":55,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":-42,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["Dull faces peer out with vacant curiosity from scattered shacks and generally ill-favored dwellings.  A few gap-toothed children stare openly and jeer and hoot at richly dressed travelers or non-S'kra Mur before their harried mothers drag them back behind tattered door hangings.","Dim candles flicker behind ill-fitting shutters on the few windows to be found on the squatter's shacks and run-down houses along the road.  The occasional burst of coarse, sibilant laughter, or the sleepy whine of a child rises into the night air as other travelers, cloaked or hooded against the sea damp, hasten past on their own errands."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":56,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":-62,"y":161,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The heavy stone slabs used to pave the road as it winds its way along the curving shoulder of a small rise have been painted in patterns of color meant to resemble the scales of a giant serpent.  The pavement, though faded and dusty, still shows a glimmer of brightness here and there.  This part of town once knew a better life it seems."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":55,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":-62,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["A small shrine in the shape of a cobra, its hood flared wide, sits to one side.  Bits of feathers and fragments of skin show the remains of small animals sacrificed for one reason or another -- to gain favor perhaps, or to give thanks for some minor success in life."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":56,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Hav'roth"]},
  {"id":58,"x":-62,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["From the east, the stink of death wafts on the air.  The smoke of a funeral pyre drifts upwards where the ever-present sea winds tear it to tatters.","From the east, the stink of death floats on the cool damp air.  The faint strains of a dirge echo among the stone walls of the nearby buildings.  Death comes to all, high and low, rich and poor, and all will end the same."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":59,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":-82,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The road rises to the northeast, where the great lifts bring people up and down between the tiers.  One sees richer robes and decorated tail-bands on many folks here, mingled with the poorer classes that inhabit the lowest level."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":-102,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Dne Cut","descriptions":["This short, narrow alleyway is used by the merchants coming to the bazaar from the shipyards.  Just a step or two from the larger avenue, wheeled carts with heavy loads can avoid the long arduous trek up Mission street.  Children often gather at the intersection to wait for stray goodies to fall off the wagons."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":-102,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Dne Cut","descriptions":["Muffled sounds erupt into clamoring furor as the alley reaches the level of the bazaar's lower entrance.  The crowds that gather here are mostly visitors from other ports, and merchants who do business on this tier.  Among the throngs lurk the young pickpockets eagerly learning their craft."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":60,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":-102,"y":61,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bazaar","descriptions":["Tall iron standards mark the entrance to the Bazaar, the slightly tattered penants flapping in the occasional breeze.  Traffic is heavy here as carts pull up to load provisions and unload wares.  Shoppers find themselves milling about the entrance, pondering their purchases."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":61,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":63,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":-122,"y":61,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bazaar","descriptions":["Bedraggled peddlers make their way to this spot daily, as bargain hunters from every corner of Elanthia converge here at the entrance to the great Bazaar.  Deeply recessed into the cliff face, a large dark opening looms to the east.  A smoky haze swirls playfully, eluding the wisp of a breeze threatening to blow it away."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":62,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":64,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":-142,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["Sandy and loose, ancient cobbles amble past a white mud and stone house that sits back a few paces from the road.  Bleached by the sun and in stark contrast with other buildings in the vicinity, the old house and manicured gardens surrounding it appear orderly and well cared for."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":65,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":-162,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["Steep cliffs rise high above, directing ones gaze toward the heavens.  Cliffside dwellings with dramatic ocean views can be seen from this vantage point.  Scanning the meager surroundings at this elevation, one can only imagine what it would be like to live the blessed lifestyle of Ratha's privileged class.  A rickety fence marks the northern boundary of this section of town."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":66,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":229,"exit":"climb","move":"climb fence"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":-182,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["Wretched poverty, brazen and offensive, assaults visitors to this small plateau.  Wanderers head past toward the bazaar, as the homeless find rest under any number of trees.  The slums of the city loom larger than life, just a few hundred yards below."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":67,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":-202,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["As the incline steepens further, solid granite cliffs loom larger than life just beyond the northern fenceline.  Removed from the rotting stench of the streets below, the breezes here are fresh and futures seem bright.  A stone wall provides a nice place to rest and enjoy the magnificent view."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":68,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":268,"exit":"go","move":"go clinic"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":-222,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["Old women with bundles and buckets labor up the hill toward the dwellings that lie below the cliff face.  Row upon row, these makeshift shelters taunt the ocean into challenging their worthiness.  The sweeping vistas here simply take the breath away, and many find the cares of the day diminished by the awesome power and beauty of the ocean."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":69,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":-242,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Mission Street","descriptions":["Along the oceanside avenue, the gentle incline gives way to a more dramatic rise in elevation.  From this part of Upper Mission street one has a commanding view of the towering cliffs to the north.  An interesting little shop wraps itself around the trunk of an enormous ironwood tree, just this side of a large open field."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":70,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":-262,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Mission Street","descriptions":["Long lines of indigent and hungry await a warming morsel outside Nadamian's Mission.  A thin gruel the usual fare, the delicious smells and promise of a meal are half the experience for many of them.  Of course, along with the meal comes a helping of the Nadamian family's tenets and teachings."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":71,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":-262,"y":161,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Mission Street","descriptions":["A low wall and a space between buildings here, offer the onlooker a view of the rugged shore and the crystal blue ocean beyond.  A few diligent souls comb the rocks for edible gifts from the mother sea.  Delicious smells coming from somewhere nearby are a welcome relief to the rotting stench to the south."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":72,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":-282,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Mission Street","descriptions":["The sharp stench of putrefaction and raw sewage assails the nostrils, sending all but the comatose into fits of retching.  Making its way across the road, a deep trench lays claim to the awful smell.  Rats and flies abound while children frolic and naked babies toddle at their mother's sides."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":-282,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Mission Street","descriptions":["Hiding in the shadows, under awnings and in darkened doorways, the wretched and aimless seek shelter from the elements.  Broken and strewn about, the ancient trappings of a bustling market district paint a ghostly reminder of more prosperous times in Ratha's history."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":74,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":-262,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Mission Street","descriptions":["Children race madly back and forth, a game of stickball the current joyous past-time.  Impervious to the meager estate of their surroundings, they ignore the screaming victim of some unnamed crime not two doors away.  The starving and homeless wander past, a hint of mirth in their eyes as they watch the innocent children at play.","The homeless shuffle toward the soup kitchen and the warmth of the doorways along the street.  Children play joyously here in the daytime, but come nightfall the area is once again filled with the harsh reality of poverty."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":-242,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Redthorne Square","descriptions":["Stepping through an elaborately carved archway, one is transported from the filth and decay of the city streets to a simple but elegant square.  Giant pots of festive flowers and lush greenery dot inlaid brick walkways and low walls.  The square is kept meticulous, courtesy of the Redthorne Shipping Co.  A busy thoroughfare in the daytime, the company also uses the space to hold recruiting fairs every spring and autumn.","Stepping through an elaborately carved archway, one is transported from the filth and decay of the city streets to a simple but elegant square.  Tall iron lanterns illuminate the brick walkways and low walls.  Giant pots of greenery and flowers dot the square and cast long shadows on the meticulous brickwork.  The quiet of evening lends the square a serenity rarely found in the hectic bustle of the day."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":110,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":74,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":-222,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cutthroat Alley","descriptions":["Shadowy beings disappear into the recesses of a large abandoned building.  A favorite hideaway for thieves, this area is no place for the full of pockets to linger.  Echoing footsteps assail passersby from all directions, making safety no better than a vaguely familiar philosophy."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":75,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":-202,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cutthroat Alley","descriptions":["Feet and legs are a common sight, seen poking out of doorways, under bushes or benches, as the fallen drunk sleep off their revelry.  From somewhere in the vicinity, a heart wrenching wail can be heard, likely coming from a newly abandoned wife as her husband heads out to sea."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":76,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":-202,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cutthroat Alley","descriptions":["Shards of glass litter the street and boardwalk outside the Bosun's Whistle Tavern.  The favorite gathering spot for Ratha's rough dockworkers, this tavern on the edge of Tog town is center stage for the tawdry wenches who entertain the clientele as well as the heated arguments and fights that usually spill out into the street."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":79,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":-202,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cutthroat Alley","descriptions":["Sounds of a bawdy song, raucous applause and catcalls waft through the air, a neighborhood tavern the likely culprit.  High above, linens and clothing hang on lines originating from upper story windows, set to catch the occasional drying breeze.","Clinking glasses, raunchy music and catcalls invade the otherwise peaceful night, the nightly activities at the local tavern in full swing.  The more sedate of the street's inhabitants stay inside with shutters closed to keep out the sound of revelry."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":80,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":-182,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cutthroat Alley","descriptions":["Away from the hustle and bustle of the dockside district, shadows begin to lengthen.  On all sides, the buildings seem to close in, their shabby state lending to an already heightened state of apprehension.  Broken slats on a fence surrounding a large vacant lot invite the kind of mischief the tittering of hidden voices betrays.","Darkness prevails as the shadows reach out from behind a broken fence.  Some unseen being lurks just ahead, waiting to prey on an innocent passerby, hence the name of this alley."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":79,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":308,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":-162,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Vendible Road","descriptions":["Rats skitter across the cobblestones, darting from one rundown warehouse to another.  At one with the rest of the beings in this section of the city, they seek the food and shelter they need to survive.  Ripped to shreds, the tattered awning of a long abandoned market flaps rhythmically in the breeze.  The faint smell of fish and putrid decay make it hard to do anything but move along quickly.","Long shadows wrap the facade of an abandoned market, and a quiet tenseness pervades the area.  The otherwise peaceful night is often disturbed by a muffled cry or a rift of drunken laughter, as those partaking in the quarter's night life wander towards home."],"exits":[{"to":82,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":80,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":243,"exit":"go","move":"go abandoned market"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":-162,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Vendible Road","descriptions":["Chaotic and clamorous best describes the sights and sounds in and around the numerous warehouses that skirt the road.  The busy shipyard to the south supplies the ancient structures, burgeoning with goods, the supplies and food that support the sprawling city.  A pair of burly S'Kra guards laugh raucously, unaware of the hungry, bedraggled children plotting entry into the food-laden storehouses.","Softly, a lone streetlamp lends a feeling of security to the occasional passerby, its glow illuminating the loosely cobbled street.  A single guard dozes lightly outside the larger of several warehouses, weapon at the ready, though easily circumventable by the stealthiest of prowlers."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":83,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":-142,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Vendible Road","descriptions":["Wooden crates are stacked several high along the rutted road.  Ratha's busy port is the lifeblood of this community, keeping the townsfolk busy all throughout the day and night.  The warehouse district to the north is full of goods and perishables, either making their way to Ratha, or being exported to other islands in the area."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden building"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":-142,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Vendible Road","descriptions":["Salt air and the smell of fish and decaying sealife fill your nostrils.  A large fenced lot is full of fishing nets, floats and other paraphernalia useful in the pursuit of a tasty morsel."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":85,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":-142,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Vendors of meat pies, tarts, and flavored ices stroll the crowded walk, calling out their wares in a sing-song rhythm that sticks in the memory.  Their cries blend with the splash of oars and the voice of the ocean wind to make a melody that identifies Ratha as clearly as a map or the high rock that juts from the harbor to the west.","A flickering torch high on a post gives a bit of light to the walk.  A giant and misshapen shadow cast on the warehouse wall mimics the infrequent visitor to the docks at this time of night, and footsteps echo as if the shadow walked alongside."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":86,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":88,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":86,"x":-102,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Some very bored but talented sailor must have waited here a long time.  One of the pilings has been carved into a very creditable likeness of a well-endowed mermaid, from flowing hair to fishy tail.  She's an alluring sight, despite the occasional seagull who uses her head to sit on."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":85,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":87,"x":-62,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The Port Walk continues along at the rear of the warehouses.  In all sizes, all materials, and all stages of repair, they are the center of the hive of activity in the harbor.  In and out of their portals pass the merchants that channel the life-blood of commerce into the veins that branch and spread until the riches of Elanthia are delivered to the customer's door."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":86,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":88,"x":-162,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The Port Walk curves inward, avoiding a galley-sized rock that rises from the water just over the side of the walkway railing.  A squadron of harbor seagulls has made the rock their home.  They perch on it, observing the goings-on around them with the keenest interest.  Now and then, one flies off on an avian errand, or lands with some scaly treasure stolen from a fishing boat."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":89,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":89,"x":-182,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["At this eastern end of the port drydock, heaps of naval stores stand stacked behind a sturdy fence.  Timber for spars, decking, or planking, barrels of tar and oakum, sailcloth wrapped in oiled sheets, kegs of nails -- the hundred-and-one items that keep a ship afloat are arranged in orderly rows ready for use."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":90,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":90,"x":-202,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["In the shelter of Ratha's drydock, water-worn or storm-shattered vessels find the craftsmen and material they need to make them seaworthy again.  High cranes stand at both sides of the drydock, ready to step a new mast, or lift a heavy spar into place.","The drydock is almost deserted, except for the occasional watchman.  The cranes, now still, stand black against the harbor lights like the trunks and branches of giant trees.  A wind sets their tackle rattling and whines in their ropes."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":91,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":91,"x":-222,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The west end of Ratha's drydock commands the area, reaching out into the harbor with the machines to overhaul even the largest vessels.  At this end, a portly schooner is supported by beams while its bottom is being scraped of barnacles and worm-eaten planking is replaced.  On board, someone, probably its captain, is arguing with a carpenter.  Although their voices cannot be heard over the harbor din, their gesticulations make the disagreement clear."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":92,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":-242,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The walk broadens into a wide platform lined with strong, iron mooring posts at wide intervals.  A vessel fills every slip, and others wait in the harbor, anchored until it's their turn to dock.  Somewhere a harbormaster must be issuing orders, because gangs of stevedores roll rumbling barrels along or shoulder sacks to and from the ships moored to the wharf.","The walk broadens into a wide platform lined with strong, iron mooring posts at wide intervals.  A vessel fills every slip, and others wait in the harbor, anchored until it's their turn to dock.  The day-time bustle of the port has subsided now, and even the lap of the water can be heard."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":93,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging door"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":-262,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The Port Walk skirts a small building jutting onto the path.  The traveler who moves to the water side of the walk to avoid it has a good view of the entire harbor, crowded with vessels small and large -- fishing smacks, the schooners of traders, galleys from far off -- an ever-changing, ever-moving testament of the wealth and power of Ratha."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":94,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":234,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"}]},
  {"id":94,"x":-302,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The walk passes behind a small wooden building, either a vendor's booth or a storage shed for a company with very little inventory.  The blank wall fronting the water offers no further clues of its purpose.  On the harbor side, the hulk of a sunken fishing boat can be made out through the murky water."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":95,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":95,"x":-342,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["An alley heads north from the walk, toward the streets where one needn't watch where one steps.  Here, the holes in the plank walk, the raised boards, and the slippery but unidentifiable patches along the way all demand attention."],"exits":[{"to":97,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":94,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":96,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":96,"x":-362,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["The walk comes to an abrupt end in an angle between the water and the blank wall of a warehouse.  Rags and trash slowly molder against the board wall, which itself seems in little better repair.  Fruit rinds and a dead fish or two float in the water below."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":881,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow gap"}]},
  {"id":97,"x":-342,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The strong odor of seawater drowns out any other smells at this end of the street.  The road slopes down to the south, passing between two warehouses of moderate size before joining the Port Walk.  Lazy seagulls float effortlessly on the heavy air.","The strong odor of seawater drowns out any other smells at this end of the street.  The road slopes down to the south, passing between two warehouses of moderate size before joining the Port Walk."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":95,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":98,"x":-342,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["This section of the street is nearly barren of people.  The backs of buildings and shops create a jagged, windowless alley.  A lone S'Kra Mur hurries away, looking over his shoulder.","The backs of numerous buildings create shadows of sufficient blackness to hide any number of activities.  Muted scraping and scratching from all directions encourages wanderers to quicken their pace."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":97,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":99,"x":-342,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["Shabby buildings pack the street here, though it doesn't appear that there is a single shop among them.  The structures stand out away from the sheer cliff face that confines the city to the west.  A few of the beaten up old buildings look to have been recently painted.","The close, tall buildings paint the street in deep shadow, barely affected by a single lit streetlamp.  A few dark figures scurry away sensing a stranger's approach."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":98,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":100,"x":-322,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["Gor'Togs fill this section of the street, wandering from run-down shop to run-down shop.  Nobody appears to be happy, though everyone is busy.  A Gor'Tog woman carrying a crying young baby smiles apologetically and hurries away.","The darkened street provides a haven for those that are more comfortable among the shadows.  Shops closed for the night leave the street in even darker shadows.  A tiny movement to the west proves to be a huge Gor'Tog man striding home through the dense blackness."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":99,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":818,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":101,"x":-322,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The Gor'Togs here are poorly dressed but still appear somewhat dignified.  Some shoeless children chase each other around the legs of their elders, managing to have fun despite the poverty they live in.","Poorly kept houses line the street, shuttered and closed for the night.  An apparently homeless Gor'Tog is curled up under a broken-down wagon, asleep.  No lamps brighten the area, leaving everything in shadows."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":100,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":102,"x":-322,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["A mostly-intact fence completely severs the north and south sides of this area.  The gate has long since been torn down, and the well-traveled road passes directly through."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":101,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":-302,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The road narrows sharply as it delves between several close-standing buildings.  Piles of discarded items fill all available space, and trash is strewn freely across the road.  The few people in sight are dirty and sad-faced, many simply sitting down, others wandering aimlessly.","Buildings that were constructed too close together force the road into a narrow pathway.  Only the light of the stars and moons allow one to avoid tripping over the rubble and trash strewn haphazardly about the area."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":102,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":104,"x":-302,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The street splits around a large statue placed directly in the center of this run-down square.  Old and worn out buildings line the streets, and the few Gor'Togs here are dressed very poorly.  Even other 'Togs seem to be avoiding this area.","A statue stands in the center of the street, dark with shadows.  Dim light falls on the street from the windows of several ramshackle houses.  An old Gor'Tog shuffles slowly across the street."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":105,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":238,"exit":"go","move":"go dilapidated building"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":-322,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["Old houses and buildings line the streets, though the quality seems to rise to the north.  A long line of cut-off fence posts stretches east to west."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":104,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":-322,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The houses here are of a markedly better quality than those visible to the south, though even some of these are built against the high cliff to the west.  Noisy people shout across the street to each other, some bargaining, some chatting, and some commenting loudly on passers-by.","Run-down houses are built against the tall cliff behind them, but still manage to look of superior quality to the houses south from here.  The street is empty of people, though signs of daytime activity indicate they'll be back with the sun."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":105,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":-322,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["The passers-by on this block are mainly young women and men dressed in work clothes.  The row-houses are small, the people look poor, but many young couples smile as they pass.  This spot is a good balance for a young Gor'Tog - away from the parents, but close enough to home for comfort.","The decent houses and fairly well lit street indicate that this is a step above the slums.  A few couples and lone Gor'Togs are out and about, though the couples don't seem too interested in anything but each other."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":106,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":108,"x":-302,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["Someone has taken this section of the street under special care.  The street curves around a large, well-kept grassy area, lined with flowers.  People here appear happy and content, and the lawn is well used by the young and old alike.","The street curves around a large flower-lined grassy area.  The locals stay mostly inside at night, though, leaving the lawn unused until morning.  Open windows in several buildings allow light to shine on the street, while sounds of laughter float in the air."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":107,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go lush lawn"}]},
  {"id":109,"x":-282,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["Clusters of young Gor'Togs loiter on the street, listening to buskers perform the latest compositions.  Some nod their head in time with the music, while others talk earnestly in low tones about matters of history and politics.  All are shabbily dressed in the latest fashions.","Dark shadows on the street reveal only two people, who both appear to be hurrying to their destinations.  Cracks of light around a shuttered window do nothing to ward off the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":110,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":108,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":-262,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Deadman's Run","descriptions":["This end of the street is a riot of activity.  Gold-toothed Gor'Togs hawk gaudy wares from streetcarts, blocking entrance to more legitimate storefronts.  Women shout to passersby, hawking goods of another kind.  With all of the bustle, it seems as if everyone here lives on the street.","Stores of various purpose line the street, most closed for the night.  An abandoned streetcart leans against an available wall.  There are quite a few people on the street, huddled in the glow provided by the pawnshop's storefront lanterns, while others conspicuously avoid the light."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":242,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden building"}]},
  {"id":111,"x":-222,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Redthorne Way","descriptions":["The artful brickwork of Redthorne Square is carried through in the design of this avenue.  Neither elegant nor stately, the street is clean and well maintained as part of an agreement made between area shopkeepers and the Redthorne family."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":75,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":853,"exit":"go","move":"go engineering society"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":-202,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Redthorne Way","descriptions":["Spicy, tantalizing smells emanate from a nearby doorway, a pleasant respite from the typical olfactory offerings in this part of town.  Skulking in the shadows, woebegotten strays wait for the occasional scrap to be thrown their way.  Provisioners often make their way to this street selling wares to green young mariners preparing for their first voyage.  The pounding of metal from a decrepit building, betrays the presence of Imble's Iron works, home to the famous anchor that bears his name.","Imble the famous anchor merchant has gone home for the evening, but the iron works and foundry remain a busy place.  All else in the neighborhood is quiet, as a gentle breeze makes it's way from the ocean beyond the seawall.","Imble, the famous anchor merchant, has gone home for the evening, but the ironworks and foundry remain a busy place.  All else in the neighborhood is quiet, as a gentle breeze makes it's way from the ocean beyond the seawall.","Spicy, tantalizing smells emanate from a nearby doorway, a pleasant respite from the typical olfactory offerings in this part of town.  Skulking in the shadows, woebegone strays wait for the occasional scrap to be thrown their way.  Provisioners often make their way to this street, selling wares to green young mariners preparing for their first voyage.  The pounding of metal from a decrepit building betrays the presence of Imble's Ironworks, home to the famous anchor that bears his name."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":111,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go ironworks"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":-182,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Redthorne Way","descriptions":["Throngs of people mill about.  Young and old alike come to witness the transformation of the city's youth into the smarmy brigands that take to the decks of the largest merchant shipping fleet in Elanthia.  Properly trained and outfitted, these young men are readied each year to take on the rigors of the everchanging ocean.","Awnings are rolled up and soft lamplight illuminates the storefronts on the brickwork drive.  Echos of the day's activities still ring from the masonry shops and ancient lampposts.  The gentle lull of the ocean is barely audible above the muffled sounds of the sleeping city."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":112,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":114,"x":-162,"y":201,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Redthorne Way","descriptions":["Not lavish by any standards, the patterned brickwork of this byway contrast sharply with the fetid decay of the surrounding neighborhoods.  A regular stream of customers can be seen darting furtively into the small shanty, set back unobtrusively from the road, that is home to the much adored fortune teller Magdha."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":113,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":115,"x":-122,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Middington Run","descriptions":["Barely passable, the deeply rutted road is one of the most frequented and favorite short cuts.  Carts loaded with goods and their ambitious drivers often race through the narrow lane in hopes of avoiding the giant potholes that threaten their equilibrium."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":114,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":116,"x":-102,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Middington Run","descriptions":["There is very little room to walk here, when traffic is at its peak.  The narrow road adjoins a vacant lot to the south and frequently passersby are seen nearly climbing the ramshackle fence to avoid the deadly wheels of the giant wagons.","Mostly abandoned during the evening hours, the narrow lane is disturbingly quiet.  Passersby tread carefully, as there is never any assurance that the ramshackle fence does not hide some less than virtuous creature."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":115,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":369,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ramshackle fence"}]},
  {"id":117,"x":-82,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Middington Run","descriptions":["Wedged between buildings, the road seems impossibly narrow here.  Deeply rutted, it is truly a wonder that any wheeled vehicle is able to traverse the precarious passage."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":116,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":118,"x":-62,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Middington Run","descriptions":["The sky is nearly blocked from view by the closeness of the buildings bordering the road.  A popular fable tells of townfolk running frantically down the lane in order to avoid the buildings closing in and crushing them in their folly."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":117,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":119,"x":-42,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Middington Run","descriptions":["An abandoned store front serves as the residence for many a homeless traveller.  Several ragged looking men huddle around an open fire, exchanging muffled commentary on the plight of their comrades."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":118,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":120,"x":-62,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The crowds are thick here, near the lift which leads higher into the city.  Street vendors ply their wares while jugglers and musicians collide with people in a hurry in the eternal dance of life that is a crowded city.  To one side a crippled beggar shakes a leather cup, seeking alms with a certain air of quiet dignity."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":59,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":121,"x":-42,"y":61,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greater Cobra Road","descriptions":["The great lift to the second tier rises from the humble beginnings of the first to the loftier levels above.  People of all classes and habits mingle, each intent on his or her own affairs.  A militia guard keeps an eye on the surroundings and occasionally dissuades some disreputable looking person or another from ascending without some proof of honest business above."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":122,"x":138,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Port Walk","descriptions":["Musclebound cargomen haul freight to and from the ships at this pier, using rusty chains suspended from twin poles of oak, stitched with sword moss.  They work under the watchful and none-too-friendly eyes of port overseers, who are quick to administer a warning lash when the cargo lists to one side.  Gangplanks creak, and the dock itself shudders beneath the onslaught of never-ceasing breakers."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["fish buyer"]},
  {"id":123,"x":-22,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"The Skirr'lolasu, Main Deck","descriptions":["In anticipation of the sudden influx of passengers, makeshift benches have been hastily constructed from kegs, driftwood, and nets stretched tight between boards, then have been cleverly placed so that they are as out of the way as possible.  Some coiled ropes and other rigging lie scattered around, pushed out of the way so no one will trip over them."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":"go neh dock"},{"to":0,"exit":"up","move":""}],"aliases":["Skirr'lolasu"]},
  {"id":124,"x":-142,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bazaar","descriptions":["Scintillating aromas waft through the air.  Meats roasting, spicy concoctions brewing in some merchants stall, the scent of freshly cured tobacco and a thousand other olfactory offerings beckon even the weariest of shoppers to turn around and have another look."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":125,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":128,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":135,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Bazaar"]},
  {"id":125,"x":-122,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Malk Staho","descriptions":["Worn out shoppers lounge about on wooden benches, taking a short rest before diving once again into the maelstrom.  Children play ball on the side of the road under the watchful eyes of their parents.  A shimmering green banner to the north directs citizens into the bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":128,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":124,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":126,"x":-102,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Malk Staho","descriptions":["The road is crowded with people making their way into the bazaar.  A community fountain at one intersection is a very popular spot for friends to meet before going off to shop.  Over the north road is a large blue banner that directs citizens into the bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":127,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":129,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":125,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":127,"x":-82,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["Out of the west, sounds from the bazaar fade to a faint thrum.  Traffic is heavy as people travel the road to reach their favorite merchant."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":225,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":126,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":128,"x":-142,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Malk Staho","descriptions":["Guardsmen stand watch at every intersection, keeping a wary eye on all who pass in and out of the bazaar.  The mouth-watering scent of pastries and sweetmeats dazzles even the most finicky of palates.  A bright yellow banner hangs over the street to the north, pointing the way deeper into the bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":125,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":140,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":135,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":129,"x":-122,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Bazaar, Grand Pavilion","descriptions":["Fabulous marble colonnades line a regal plaza of tremendous proportions.  Elegant fountains flow in a series down the exact center of the pavilion and provide a sparkling backdrop for enormous pots of ornamental palms and brilliant flowers.  Throngs of merchants and visitors mill about in the grand foyer of the Ratha Bazaar, waiting to reconcile bills of lading or gain entrance into the festive marketplace."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":724,"exit":"go","move":"go drain","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Second Tier"]},
  {"id":130,"x":-62,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["Buildings press in on both sides of the road.  Shoots of dark grass poke their way through the cracks of the cobblestone street.  A number of wealthy citizens stride along this thoroughfare, keeping a wary eye out for pickpockets."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":127,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":839,"exit":"go","move":"go outfitting society"},{"to":330,"exit":"go","move":"go painted shop"}]},
  {"id":131,"x":-42,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["Tired laborers, craftsmen and merchants make their way towards some of the city's best inns that have their custom in this part of Ratha.  Some lean wearily against street lamps, resting in the pools of light, before continuing onward.","Tired laborers, craftsmen and merchants make their way towards some of the city's best inns that have their establishments in this part of Ratha.  Some lean wearily against street lamps before continuing onward while others sit down in the nearest shade, resting their feet."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":130,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":-22,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["Pedestrians must keep a sharp eye out for supply caravans as they move down the road with little regard for those on foot.  The occasional braying of a donkey shatters the otherwise quiet street."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":131,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":133,"x":-2,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["The gravel road is tightly packed with citizens as they make their way through Ratha's merchant district.  Tall stone buildings line the thoroughfare.  A stone bench provides the weary a place to sit down amid the hustle of the city."],"exits":[{"to":134,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":132,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":331,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"}]},
  {"id":134,"x":18,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Eslan Street","descriptions":["From here, looking over the tops of the far buildings, one can see the eastern lift that travels between Ratha's second and third tier.  Most of the road's traffic is heading westerly towards the city's bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":133,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":135,"x":-162,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Malk Staho","descriptions":["The air is abuzz with the sounds of the bazaar.  Merchants of every description scream out the virtues of their wares while citizens try to dodge the more aggressive salesmen.  Scarlet-colored banners on the north side of the road point the way deeper into the bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":128,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":140,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":136,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":136,"x":-182,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Malk Staho","descriptions":["Street lamps along the road illuminate small sections of the road.  Travellers move from one pool of light to the next.  Trees in large ceramic urns are spaced evenly along the street.","Colorful streamers decorate every street lamp and overhang as the bazaar comes into view.  The road transforms from common gravel to dark red brick as one nears the market area.  Trees, planted in large ceramic urns, are spaced evenly along the street, each providing a fair amount of shade on even the warmest of days."],"exits":[{"to":135,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":140,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":137,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":137,"x":-202,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["The sounds of the bazaar, though faint, can be heard even this far away.  Citizens from all walks of life make their way to and from the merchant center of the city."],"exits":[{"to":136,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":138,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":138,"x":-222,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["Guardsmen patrol this area heavily since many of the city's wealthy frequent the shops along this road.  Nearby stone benches provide a place for weary shoppers to take a moment's rest."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":139,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":304,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":139,"x":-242,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["Children run up and down the sidewalks of this street, following parents that slowly make their way to the bazaar.  Whitewashed buildings line the cobblestone road like soldiers on parade while storekeepers stare out of their windows at travelers on the road."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":141,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":140,"x":-162,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zsikiel Monument","descriptions":["The sounds of the nearby bazaar buzz in the background.  A gigantic memorial arch towers over the surrounding buildings.  The road continues south under this archway, which is supported by marble columns that line the sides of the street."],"exits":[{"to":135,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":128,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":136,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":312,"exit":"go","move":"go mon"}]},
  {"id":141,"x":-262,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["The road narrows here, but luckily the number of supply caravans has also dwindled, making the traffic easier to navigate.  The pavement itself looks to be of a much better condition, too, as it has seen little abuse from iron-shod wheels."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":139,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":142,"x":-262,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["The dark street is quiet except for a few Dwarves that are sitting around a cart, standing guard and warning off the curious.  Travelers avoid eye contact with one another as they swiftly move past.","The sounds of metal striking metal fill the air in this part of town.  Cartloads of iron ore line the roadside, making the already congested street almost impossible to navigate.  A group of Dwarves continuously survey the carts, checking the contents and warning off curious pedestrians."],"exits":[{"to":141,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":143,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":143,"x":-282,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["Many craftsmen gather on the stoops of their various shops to watch the passing citizens.  Others sit on nearby benches discussing the day's labor or just gossiping with their friends."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":144,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":329,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":144,"x":-302,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["The street is free of all but a few people, making it easy to get from place to place.  Most of the buildings that line the road are dark.  Travelers avoid eye contact as they swiftly move past.","The street traffic can only be described as congested while all types, merchants, craftsmen, and even the occasional Gor'tog dock worker, enter and exit the many buildings that line the paved thoroughfare.  At times it takes a well-placed elbow or a slightly zealous nudge to make one's way through the crowd."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":143,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":275,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":145,"x":-262,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Street","descriptions":["Over the top of the surrounding buildings there is a fairly decent view of the western lifts that ascend to Ratha's temple district.  The acrid scent of a tanner and the faint sound of a hammer striking metal comes from the south."],"exits":[{"to":144,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":146,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":146,"x":-282,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Eslan Square","descriptions":["A solitary light glows from behind a sheer curtain in the upper story window of a neat townhouse offset from the street by a small sidewalk.  An occasional figure, indistinguishable in the darkness of the boulevard, passes on its way to or from the third tier.","A swirl of people mill and dance around one another as an influx of foot traffic from the third tier mixes with the crowds spreading outwards from the Bazaar.  Modest townhouses painted a reserved mocha or cream are offset from the street by a small sidewalk."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":145,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":147,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":147,"x":-302,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Amakra Close","descriptions":["The road forks here, southeast toward the Ratha bazaar, still open at this late hour and southwest toward the quaint homes of Amakra close.  Weary townsfolk make their way toward the comfort of home.","The road forks here, southeast toward the bustling Ratha bazaar and southwest toward the splendor of Selridge road and the cliffside views.  Boisterous townsfolk wave and call out to comrades and neighbors passing along this busy byway.  Stalwart pilgrims make their way toward the lifts and the temples above."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":146,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":148,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":148,"x":-322,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Amakra Close","descriptions":["Ornate fencelines, white-washed trellises replete with meandering rose vines and fragrant lily blossoms adorn the walkways.  Spectres of the day's traffic seem to hang in the still night air, ready to descend once more onto the streets below.","Sounds of squeaking wheels and clamoring hooves on the cobbled roadway herald the passing of a cart laden with goods as it heads toward the lift to the north.  Along this tree-lined street, homes, adorned with sculptured forecourts, allow one to escape the bustling traffic of the street beyond.  Ornate fencelines, white-washed trellises replete with meandering rose vines and fragrant lily blossoms brighten the walkways, their expectant faces turned in the direction of the sun."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":149,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":149,"x":-322,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Amakra Close","descriptions":["Sparkling water commands the horizon beyond the cliffs to the west.  From these homes along the bluff, ships lanterns can be seen tracing a line toward the safety of the harbor below.  Fragrant jadsem blossoms lend a dream-like quality to the cool night air.","Crystal water and a distant shore can be seen beyond the cliffs to the west.  From these homes along the bluff, tall ships can be seen sailing toward the port in a line that extends well beyond the horizon.  Fragrant jadsem blossoms offer the passerby an additional treat, as the air is replete with sweet scents."],"exits":[{"to":148,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":150,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":303,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":150,"x":-322,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Amakra Close","descriptions":["Whispers of a breeze linger in the trees that line the roadway, a stone archway leads to a dramatic overlook at the cliff's edge.  Elegant stone benches are placed on either side of the quaint roadway providing a pleasant place to sit and enjoy.  Enormous hanging baskets filled with weeping blood-red iera flowers and bright blue violets complete the picturesque walk."],"exits":[{"to":149,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":199,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":151,"x":-302,"y":-299,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Amakra Close","descriptions":["A pair of stone nagas rise to either side of the great lifts that lead to the upper tiers.  The constant drone of the lift is only intermittent now during the quiet hours of night, and guards in nearby posts doze sporadically.  Sailors and merchants frequent the bazaar at this time of night, seeking trinkets for the lovely ladies that catch their fancy.","A pair of stone nagas rise to either side of the great lifts that lead to the upper tiers.  Gnashing of iron teeth and a low pitched hum accentuate the constant movement of counterweights which allow the great lift to move between the tiers.  Amidst the crowds of tired shoppers and eager travellers heading north from the ports, city officials and clergy can be spotted awaiting the short ride to the next level, home to the government offices and temples."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":152,"x":-202,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["A lissome S'kra Mur man stumbles up a short walkway leading to one of the townhouses built here.  Judging from his unsteady walk and the amount of trouble the latch causes, he's returning from more than a hard day's work.  No lights are visible in any of the windows facing the street and a cool wind blows in from the bay bringing with it the quiet susurration of the surf.","The incessant noise of the Bazaar is somewhat muted next to the sheer cliff face rising up to the most prosperous section of the city.  Tasteful etchings adorn the lintels of cozy townhouses built back from the street.  A steady flow of commercial traffic forces pedestrians to keep to the edges of the thoroughfare in order to keep life and limb intact."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":146,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0080"},
  {"id":153,"x":-162,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Still predominantly residential at this point, Zeh'ra Boulevard curves languidly around a gigantic bulge of stone thrust out from the towering cliff to the north.  Without the distraction of the thick crowds found here during the day, the stench of refuse collecting in gutters is overpowering.  Fresh droppings from yaks, mules, ponies and other more exotic beasts of burden lend the odor an immediacy that quickens the step and makes deep breathing a thing best avoided.","Still predominantly residential at this point, Zeh'ra Boulevard curves languidly around a gigantic bulge of stone thrust out from the towering cliff to the north.  Heavy traffic clogs the roadway and various shouts and indistinguishable curses clutter the air.  A faint whiff of smoke tickles the nose as it curls from a nearby chimney, but does nothing to dispel the thick stench of refuse collecting in the gutters."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":152,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":154,"x":-102,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Looming buildings built close to the cliff cast this narrow stretch of road into profound darkness.  Eerie echoes cascade down from above while furtive figures move quickly along the edges of the boulevard, giving each other a wide berth.  A sense of being watched is impossible to ignore.","Caught in perpetual shadow, the boulevard narrows to such a degree that cart traffic can pass in only one direction at a time.  The close proximity of unmovable stone to the north and the more common homes directly south preclude any future attempt to widen the roadway.  Raised voices echo back and forth as caravan and cart drivers argue heatedly about who will make way for whom and be on their way to market before the competition."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":153,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":-82,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Used primarily as a means to transport goods from one side of Ratha to the other without braving the mire of the Bazaar itself, the boulevard is an important link for the merchants located at either side of the city.  The heavy traffic of daylight is gone, leaving behind a more subtle rhythm of business and dealings ripe to catch the unwary and incautious.","Used primarily as a means to transport goods from one side of Ratha to the other without braving the mire of the Bazaar itself, the boulevard is an important link for the merchants located at either side of the city.  Scores of people intent on their business pack the street from one side to the other.  The homes found closer to the lifts connecting the tiers give way to sedate shops and humdrum storage facilities."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":154,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":156,"x":-62,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["A lengthy stretch of road running directly westwards is cast into perpetual shadow by the massive wall of rock to the north.  No light filters in from above, making passage precarious at best.  Heavy gloom collects under overhanging eaves, offering ideal concealment for those whose trade is best conducted in the strictest confidence -- and where shouts might go unheard.","A lengthy stretch of road running directly westwards is cast into perpetual shadow by the massive wall of rock to the north.  A short jog in the boulevard veers around a corner, constricting the flow of traffic terribly.  Forward progress is frustrating at best and most likely impossible.  The din from the Bazaar somewhere to the south mixes with the general tumult of voices and sounds clogging the roadway to produce a nerve-bending racket."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":155,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":157,"x":-62,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Two rows of small warehouses crowd the boulevard as it curves southwards to avoid an impressive slab of stone slanting outward from the base of the cliff.  Three figures standing in front of a brightly lit doorway are cast into silhouette.  While it is impossible to make out their features, the shadowy outlines of weapons and armor coupled with their alert stances serve to discourage casual interest.","Two rows of small warehouses crowd the boulevard as it curves southwards to avoid an impressive slab of stone slanting outward from the base of the cliff.  A large S'kra Mur leans lethargically against the doorframe of the only warehouse to offer direct access to the street, regarding the steady stream of new faces with the same level of indifference they show her."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":156,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":158,"x":-42,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["The boulevard is nearly choked off between the ever-present stone to the north and a solid line of large warehouses to the south.  The high warehouse walls lend the street the look of a dark, narrow canyon, leaving any trace of moon or starlight far beyond reach.  A brisk wind howls from above, carrying the distinctive tang of salt along with the mournful cry of a solitary gull.","The crowd thickens as the boulevard is nearly choked off between the ever-present stone to the north and a solid line of large warehouses to the south.  The high warehouse walls give the street the look of a narrow canyon, leaving the sky and sunlight far overhead.  A brisk wind blows from above, carrying the distinctive tang of salt along with the faint squawking of seagulls."],"exits":[{"to":159,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":157,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":159,"x":-22,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Bits of broken shell crunch underfoot, the sound reverberating hollowly between the stark line of buildings and the cliff face.  An eldritch glow filters down from above, limning the outlines of tightly locked windows and doors in a sickly yellow light.  A momentary inspection of the rock reveals the source of the glow to be thick encrustations of lichen that blanket the stone.","A group of S'kra Mur children dart through the morass of wagons, pack animals and pedestrians, yelling out to one another while playing a risky game of tag that brings them perilously close to death.  The rock to the north plays host to a startling variety of red, green and golden yellow lichen.  Bits of broken shell litter the boulevard, leftovers from the meals of gulls flying landward from the bay."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":158,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":-2,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["The overpowering reek of rotting flesh wafts from a battered gull carcass kicked to the side of the boulevard in front of an abandoned looking warehouse liberally stained with streaks of white.  Several dozen gulls have gone to roost on the building's sagging rooftop.  The ill-fated gull apparently chose the wrong person to anoint during the hectic crush of the daytime.","An abandoned looking warehouse is liberally stained with streaks of white, most likely the work of the several dozen gulls resting on the rooftop.  Shattered and discarded seashells litter the street in front of the warehouse, testament that the gulls find this area of the city to be the height of fine dining.  Passersby cast wary glances in the gulls' direction, hoping to avoid any sudden gifts from above."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":159,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":161,"x":18,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Barrels and crates line both sides of the boulevard, stacked haphazardly in front of narrow doorways and windows.  Mounds of used packing straw and sawdust spill from broken containers, muffling any sound of passage.  The distinctive odor of urine emanates from one particularly large pile of sawdust.  Utter silence reigns among the deep shadows that crisscross the road.","Barrels and crates line both sides of the boulevard, stacked haphazardly in front of narrow doorways and windows.  Mounds of used packing straw and sawdust spill from broken containers, muffling the tread of feet and wagon wheels.  Those familiar with the boulevard hold kerchiefs or other bits of cloth to their faces in order to fend off the thick dust stirred up by the heavy traffic."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":160,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":162,"x":38,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["A small cluster of stones juts above the boulevard's surface, which would make maneuvering through this area difficult in heavy traffic.  A slamming door can be heard off in the distance, which only serves to reinforce the complete absence of noise or light in this area.  The scent of seaweed is oddly intense for a location this deep in the city.","A small cluster of stones juts above the boulevard's surface, making maneuvering through this area difficult.  Merchants carefully work their carts and wagons around the stones, mindful of the hazard and the potential for a broken wheel and forfeited profit.  The noise of the Bazaar carries faintly over the rooftops from the west."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":161,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":163,"x":58,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zeh'ra Boulevard","descriptions":["Normally a quagmire of people, wagons and carriages, Zeh'ra Boulevard is uncomfortably empty.  A light dusting of ash on the ground reveals no other footprints or wheel tracks.  The surrounding stillness and an odd scent in the air makes loitering an unpleasant prospect and relaxation unattainable.  Long shadows reach from the cliff above to shroud the street in uneasy murkiness.","Just off of Upper Cobra Road, which offers access to the great lifts connecting the second and third tiers, Zeh'ra Boulevard swirls with people of all classes and statures.  Elegantly clad men and women jostle for position among dock workers and common tradesmen in a vain attempt to speed their progress.  A trio of hawkers face off in a contest of lung power to lure in prospective clientele.  They seem blissfully unaware that they drive off far more potential business than they draw in."],"exits":[{"to":164,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":162,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":164,"x":78,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["From the east, the stink of death floats on the cool damp air.  The stink of ash as well, perhaps from a crematorium.  Death comes to all, high and low, rich and poor, and all will end the same.","All that is good rises upward and all that is bad flows downward, it is said.  This would seem to be true as the rich and powerful mingle with the poor and unwashed where two busy roads intersect just south of the great lifts to the uppermost tier.  Few would gainsay that this nexus of roads comprises a cross-section of every strata of Rathan society.  Those with polished scales and jewelled tail bands predominate, but many a denizen has seen better days, with missing scutes and tattered clothing."],"exits":[{"to":226,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":220,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":165,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":163,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":165,"x":78,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["A pair of buildings appear to have been torn down, making a wide spot in the road just south of a busy intersection.  Some few stalls remain open despite the hour in what is a busy bazaar during the day, eager merchants hoping perhaps for a few more coppers before they turn in.  Then there are those whose primary business is best done in the dark of night or shadow.  Those hooded and cloaked figures that skirt the few guttering lanterns or grease-soaked rushlights, for example.","A pair of buildings appear to have been torn down, making a wide spot in the road just south of a busy intersection.  The space created has been turned into an informal bazaar with many brightly-colored awnings stretched above piles of unguessable and curious items.  Hawkers vie with each other trying to lure customers, and the noise and scents combine into a heady mix that fills one with the zest of life."],"exits":[{"to":164,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":166,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":166,"x":78,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["A small grove of trees has been planted here, in soil carried at great expense from more fertile lands.  They have done well despite the salt winds off the sea.  Some enterprising vendors have set up stands beneath their branches, selling cool drinks and roasted meats and boiled candies."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":167,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":167,"x":58,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Two roads meet between rough-hewn stone buildings.  The obvious debris of a crowded roadway full of horses and mules have been swept to one side in untidy piles, awaiting the nightwagon's arrival.  The few pedestrians keep to the center of the way to avoid rude accidents to their footgear.","Two roads meet between rough-hewn stone buildings.  Several heavy-laden wagons are parked to one side as their drivers take a short break while one adjusts the harness on his team.  This bottleneck in an already narrow street causes many inconveniences as people try to force their way past without stepping in that which mules are wont to do when opportunity permits."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":168,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":134,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":168,"x":58,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["A few houses, set back from the road, seem to brood in silence.  They are shuttered and look unkempt, their gardens gone to seed and their paint is peeling.  The damp night air thickens into fog and swirls about the dim wooden shapes.  There is evidence of a fire not too recently, to judge from the rain-streaked soot around the windows and doors and the smoke-stained walls of one house.","A few houses, set back from the road, seem to brood in silence.  They are shuttered and look unkempt, their gardens gone to seed and their paint is peeling.  Even the laughter and shouting of children playing nearby seems oddly muted and listless.  There is evidence of a fire not too recently, to judge from the smoke-stained walls of one house."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":169,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":169,"x":38,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["The road winds a bit between tidy cottages set between neat stone hedges.  One or two appear to be shuttered and empty, but most show signs of being occupied and maintained.  Each has a small brass or bronze night lantern set over the door.","The road winds a bit between tidy cottages set between neat stone hedges.  One or two appear to be shuttered and empty, but most show signs of being occupied and maintained.  A large group of children of several races are engaged in some game for which the rules are seemingly random, but no doubt they make sense to the players.  Much of it seems to entail raucous shouting and laughter from all involved."],"exits":[{"to":168,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":170,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":170,"x":18,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["One and two-story houses press close along the avenue.  Through shuttered windows, one can hear people going about their night-time activities.  A small lantern hangs over each door, as required by local custom.  Somewhere, the heavy tread of a watchman on his rounds echoes in the night air.","One and two-story houses press close along the busy avenue.  Through open windows, one can see people going about their everyday lives, untroubled by the passing parade of travelers."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":171,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":171,"x":-2,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Tall houses crowd together along both sides of the road, their half-timbered second stories leaning towards each other until they almost meet overhead.  The sky is nearly blocked, giving a gloomy feel to the passage between them that is offset by the cheery color schemes and sprays of greenery set in vases along the window ledges.  Somewhere, a sibilant voice is singing, accompanied by a less-than-skilled ocarina player."],"exits":[{"to":170,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":172,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":172,"x":-22,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["The road widens as it meets two others coming in at odd angles.  The resulting tangle of streets is set about with a curious variety of tiny shops mingled with somewhat ramshackle cottages and small storage yards for bulk goods."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":171,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":223,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":173,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":173,"x":-22,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Several small gardens, each with a tidy stone border, line the road along the edge of a genteel residential area.  Several tall stakes control long strands of curling vines, laden with pea-pods.","Several small gardens, each with a tidy stone border, line the road along the edge of a genteel residential area.  Several tall stakes control long strands of curling vines, laden with pea-pods.  A brace of geese wander about, pecking at half-buried seeds in the dirt."],"exits":[{"to":172,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":174,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":174,"x":-42,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["The smells of cooking and the sound of cheerful laughter emanate from a rambling tavern on the west side of the road.  The otherwise drab stone of its roof has been worked along the edge into a series of brightly-painted cameos depicting comically absurd portraits."],"exits":[{"to":173,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":175,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":175,"x":-42,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["The backs of several large warehouses present a blank facade along the road.  Rough grey stone rises on both sides, cutting off any breeze and fencing in the noise and smells of a crowded town.  Faded chalk outlines on one wall are all that remain of some forgotten children's game or picture."],"exits":[{"to":174,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":176,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":176,"x":-42,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Traffic is quite heavy, despite the hour.  A few lanterns placed on rocky perches cast a feeble light on the crossroads.  A sleepy-looking guardsman leans on a pike, keeping half an eye on the road.","Two roads meet in a busy intersection.  It seems as if every person in the tier is trying to pass through the same crossing all at one time.  Several cracked and broken paving stones in the center of the roadway force traffic to veer around the area, creating a tiny island of empty space."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":200,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":177,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":177,"x":-62,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Mastik Mews","descriptions":["As the throng of citizens heads north from the lifts, this delightful little road heads west over the ridge toward some of the most beautiful scenery Ratha has to offer.  Weeping bloodwood trees form a graceful arch over the roadway, while neat white pickets surround a cluster of tidy homes."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":178,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":178,"x":-82,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Mastik Mews","descriptions":["Sweet scents float through the calm night air.  Glowing embers from the cooking fires die slowly, the residents long taken to their beds, and slumbering peacefully.","All around, the signs of a thriving community abound.  Young children, actively play in the streets and yards of the well kept homes, while women hang laundry out on lines to dry.  Conspicuously missing are the men, likely away at sea, the craft-halls or out hunting to stock the family larder.  On both sides of the lane, bright jadsem blossoms and freesia lend a pleasant sweet scent to the air."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":179,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":179,"x":-122,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Mastik Mews","descriptions":["Spectres of the afternoon hustle and bustle are called forth by the soft whinny of a horse nearby.  The sparkling night view of the city below and the roiling ocean beyond is a joy to behold.","Horse drawn carts amble past, laden with goods from the marketplace to the north.  A driver stops to water his horse at one of the many troughs along the tree-lined route.  Toward the southwest, a beautiful unobstructed view of the ocean awaits the passerby, eager for a break from their daily chores."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":180,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF","aliases":["Water Trough"]},
  {"id":180,"x":-142,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Mastik Mews","descriptions":["The neighborhood garden is silent, resting after a busy day of cultivation and activity.  A bustling center of activity by day, the garden lends quiet comfort to this quaint community in the long evening hours.","Bees buzz happily, finding a wealth of pollen in the neat rows of flowers and vegetables of a community garden.  Neighbors chat casually as they share in the toils of tending the plot.  Covered and protected against the elements, the more delicate of the fruits and flowers flourish under the added attention."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":181,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":181,"x":-162,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Mastik Mews","descriptions":["Several people gather around a large brick firepit outside a neatly trimmed cottage.  Billowing smoke wraps around the stone chimney as a wild boar turns slowly over the coals, fat dripping into the flames.  On smaller spits, a number of plump birds roast slowly, and large pots of bubbling liquids add their steam and delicious smells to the atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":180,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":182,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":182,"x":-182,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["The well worn stone wall nearly rings with the day's conversations.  Now quiet and peaceful, this delightful lane wends its way through the slumbering community.","Delicious smells permeate the air, creating an atmosphere of comfort and home.  All who stroll down this delightful lane are pulled aside to visit or partake in a sip of grog or cold spring water.  A trio of old women, leaning across a stone wall, are enrapt in a story telling session, oblivious to the world around them."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":183,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":183,"x":-202,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Fingers of starlight filter through the lush canopy of bloodwood and sana'ati trees as the avenue broadens.  Protected from the frequent wind and rain sweeping off the ocean, the drive takes on an almost dream-like quality.  On the north side of the reach, gentle rolling knolls are host to a variety of well kept homes with dramatic views of the sparkling sea beyond the cliffs.","Fingers of light filter through the lush canopy of bloodwood and sana'ati trees as the avenue broadens.  Protected from the afternoon sun or the wind and rain sweeping off the ocean, the drive takes on an almost dream-like quality.  On the north side of the reach, gentle rolling knolls are host to a variety of well kept homes with dramatic views of the crystal sea beyond the cliffs."],"exits":[{"to":182,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":184,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":184,"x":-222,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["The denseness of the arboreal adit gives way briefly, allowing an unobstructed view of the shipyards far below, and the jetty beyond.  From this vantage point one can clearly observe the traffic in and out of the harbor.  It is said that the Odalva family purchased property on this bluff to keep track of the vast Redthorne fleet."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":185,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":185,"x":-262,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Veering close to the precipice, the avenue broadens slightly to form a small viewpoint.  The sights, sounds and even the smells of the city below can be experienced when the wind is blowing just right.  Scuffing and footprints can be seen just over the sturdy retaining wall, not two feet from a very obvious warning sign."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":186,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":232,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}]},
  {"id":186,"x":-282,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Enveloping the avenue, spreading masses of lush greenery play about the gnarled wood and sinewy branches.  Long, protective arms reach downward, toward the decorative stones along the fenceline.  Just ahead, a rolling meadow unfolds, hugging the north side of the road."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":187,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":296,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":187,"x":-302,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["The softly rolling hillside whispers with the hushed sounds of grasses and flowers blowing in the gentle evening breeze.  Worn down by many a footfall, a trail meanders away from the road towards the quiet meadows.","Thousands of pale purple shalyria blossoms blanket the hillside in soft waves, complementing the deep tones of the taffelberries, ripe and tasty, that abound in the meadow.  Worn and winding, a trail meanders away from the road toward the sound of laughter and music."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":188,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":297,"exit":"climb","move":"climb driftwood fence"},{"to":298,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}]},
  {"id":188,"x":-322,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Skirting along the meadow, the road ambles toward the cliff's edge and two large homes, perched precariously close to the precipice.  On the opposite side of the road, stables and gardens make best use of the grassy knoll and ample acreage."],"exits":[{"to":187,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":189,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF","aliases":["Garthic NEW"]},
  {"id":189,"x":-342,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Subtle fragrances waft through the air, hibiscus, cherry blossom, something else not quite identifiable.  Carstens, the florist, has gardens nearby and often roams the neighborhood selling his delicate and fresh-picked wares to the eager locals."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":190,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF","aliases":["Ssarkhl NEW"]},
  {"id":190,"x":-362,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Odalva Reach","descriptions":["Breezes blow stronger here, as the road approaches the western overlook and the windward side of the bluff.  The thick stand of sana'ati gives way to smaller, sculpted pine trees.  Though still ornamental and pleasant to look upon, the plants and flowers here have adapted to the elements, taking on a distinctly squat and sturdy posture."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":191,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":191,"x":-382,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Cliffside Viewpoint","descriptions":["Diamonds of light sparkle off the surface of the ocean.  A stiff breeze blows constantly here, whipping the salt air against the side of the cliff in playful whorls.  Far out in the harbor, various ships lay at anchor, awaiting their turn in the busy port of Ratha.  Below, one needs only spy the griminess of the lower tier of the city to be reminded that all is not as unspoiled as this panorama proclaims."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":190,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":192,"x":-382,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Couples from all over Ratha frequent the overlook, making it a favorite spot for a romantic afternoon or evening stroll.  Slowly and happily, most that visit here soon wander north toward the merchant district and the ever popular bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":191,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":193,"x":-362,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Windblown grasses cling to sandy cracks in the walkways that bypass several tidy homes along the road.  Iron gates and covered porticos offer security and protection from the evening elements.  Tall and stately street lamps perform their nightly ritual, offering a ray or two of warm light to the evening stroller.","Windblown grasses cling to sandy cracks in the walkways that bypass several tidy homes along the road.  Iron gates and shaded porticos offer privacy and shelter from the afternoon sun while tall and stately street lamps await a nightly ritual, offering a ray or two of warm light to the evening stroller."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":192,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":194,"x":-362,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Tempests and whorls of salty air whip past, sending sand and dust flying inland.  Gnarled and deformed by the constant wind, a stand of dwarf pine hum as if goading the spirits of the wind into a battle of wits."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":193,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":195,"x":-342,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Spicy and aromatic, the scents of a growing herb garden drift past.  Rich and loamy, the soil and climate here are perfect for growing everything from brilliant flowers to flavorful vegetables.  Just ahead the welcoming lights of the Carstens farmhouse can be seen towering over darkened gardens.","Spicy and aromatic, the scents of a growing herb garden drift past.  Rich and loamy, the soil and climate here are perfect for growing everything from brilliant flowers to flavorful vegetables.  Just ahead the white gables of the Carstens farmhouse can be seen towering over neat rows of blooming finery."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":194,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":196,"x":-342,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Wild grapevines along a rickety fence cast strange shadows from the lamplight in the dark.  Sweet smells from the gardens beyond lend to the intoxicating environment along the tree-lined road.","Vibrant lavender and wild grape vines adorn a rickety fence along the western edge of the Carstens place.  Folks amble past, stopping to smell the sweet flowers and admire the upcoming crop of unusual floral varieties that Carstens is famous for.  Dwarf pine and an occasional silverwood tree line the inlaid walkways along the road, a rich mosaic nearly lost in the sand from the cliff."],"exits":[{"to":197,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":195,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":197,"x":-322,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["A high stone wall, meant to protect the street from wind and erosion, blends with the outer walls of an impressive home at the cliff's edge.  For several hundred paces along the roadway the old fortress towers, appearing abandoned, yet ever watchful.  Folks say that the Odalva family owns the property and that sometimes, late at night, strange activities can be observed in and around the mysterious manse."],"exits":[{"to":198,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":196,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":198,"x":-322,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Selridge Road","descriptions":["Continuing the inlaid stone motif, a high wall protects the street here from the whipping winds that frequent this side of the bluff.  In the distance, the tinkle of chimes plays an erratic melody in harmony with the constant drone of the city, and the crashing surf beyond the cliffs."],"exits":[{"to":197,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":199,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":199,"x":-342,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Amakra Close, Windward Overlook","descriptions":["Hand quarried stone, inlaid with onyx tiles, form a handsome pattern on the floor of the overlook.  This delightful viewpoint is enclosed with sturdy matching walls and the ancient stone archway to the east.  Benches line the walls, and an ancient telescope, atop a small raised dais, offers the viewer a chance to observe the heavens."],"exits":[{"to":198,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Telescope"]},
  {"id":200,"x":-22,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["The road leading into the town from the great lift crosses a large east-west road that serves the merchant quarters that make up the bulk of the inhabitants of this level.  A continual rush of traffic scurries about in all directions, taking little heed of anyone foolish enough to stand and gape at the hubbub.  A tall flagpost rises in the center of the crossroad, pennon snapping in the sea-breeze."],"exits":[{"to":201,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":227,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":176,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":201,"x":-2,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["A row of small storage yards are neatly filled with crates and bales stacked two and three high.  Traffic in and out of the area suggests that it is used by merchants as a clearing house for goods sold at the famous Ratha bazaar."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":200,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":202,"x":38,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Traffic along this section of the busy road is typically limited to carriages and supply wagons destined for the homes on the tier.  The larger section of the road to the west and north, takes travelers toward the great lifts of the palace level or the portside district below."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":203,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":201,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":203,"x":78,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["A few steps off the road, atop a slight rise, a bevy of small cottages beckon the weary home for the evening.  Clean and well cared for, the homes in this area are neither shabby nor elegant.","A few steps off the road, atop a slight rise, a bevy of small cottages are oriented toward the remarkable view of the ocean beyond.  Clean and well cared for, the homes in this area are neither shabby nor elegant.  Bescarved housewives are often seen traversing the walkways and crossing the street to chat with passing salesman."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":202,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":204,"x":98,"y":1,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["The avenue sweeps toward the south and east and a lovely view of the city below.  The sparkling ocean, ever present from nearly every spot in Ratha is a constant reminder of the hard working way of life the town has to offer."],"exits":[{"to":205,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":203,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":205,"x":118,"y":1,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A small monument rests here, overlooking the busy port district of the city below.  To this day the Tierskel family, long involved in the development of seafaring trade in this region, controls the docks and shipyards."],"exits":[{"to":206,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":204,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":206,"x":138,"y":21,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Interesting serpentine patterns adorn a low stone wall on the cliff side of the avenue.  With access to goods from distant ports of call, it's not surprising to find foreign art and cultures influencing much of the Rathan architecture."],"exits":[{"to":207,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":205,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":207,"x":158,"y":21,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Beyond the safety of a low stone retaining wall, a cliff divides this level of the city from the lower warehouse district below.  With a slight adjustment of the eyes, the onlooker can forget the toil and chaos of the city below, and become lost in the depths of the crystal sea beyond."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":206,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":208,"x":178,"y":1,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["The smell of straw and the occasional whinny of a horse heralds the presence of a livery service someplace closeby.  Hired out for pleasure or in service to specific delivery services, horses play an important part in the transportation of people and goods around town."],"exits":[{"to":209,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":207,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":209,"x":198,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A cluster of homes is set back away from the traffic of the avenue, taking advantage of the view from atop a slight rise.  A dirt lane serves as a drive connecting the homes to the road, forming what could be construed as a cul-de-sac."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":208,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":210,"x":198,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Both spectacular and dangerous, the view at this point is nonetheless exhilarating.  The stone wall protects the average traveler from the perilous cliffs, but too eager a spectator could easily find themselves awash in the churning surf and the rocks below."],"exits":[{"to":211,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":209,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":211,"x":198,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Fields and walkways are quiet and settled for another night's slumber.  Come morning, the eager voices of children at play will once again carry aloft on the gentle breezes.","Gentle breezes blow on this side of the island.  Beyond the low fence of a large field children are often seen at play, hiding behind large boulders or stone walls, they frequently imitate hunters who range far beyond the limits of the city."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":212,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":212,"x":178,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A wide brick walkway commands the eastern side of the bluff, as the drive takes a turn toward the most beautiful of scenic finery on Ratha.  Stretching as far as the eye can see, a sparkling crystal ocean lays like a blanket surrounding the island."],"exits":[{"to":213,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":211,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":213,"x":178,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A quiet, tree-lined lane meanders off toward the west.  Unable to wander past the confines of a locked gate, the passerby is left to wonder what manner of mystery lays beyond the iron scrollwork.  Birdsong and laughter are carried aloft on a soft breeze, reminders of a carefree existence somewhere closeby."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":214,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":214,"x":158,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Charming cottages and small homes sit close together, tiled walkways and neat gardens setting one apart from the other.  Residents can often be seen sitting on porches late into the night, puffing on pipes, drinking cider or just watching the stars play upon the ocean.","Charming cottages and small homes sit close together, tiled walkways and neat gardens setting one apart from the other.  Women gather in the largest of several yards, discussing the events of the day."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":213,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":215,"x":158,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["The avenue is broad and decidedly residential.  The homes are not overly large or elegant, but well kept and nicely appointed.  The children who often play in the gardens and along the walkways, are tucked into their beds slumbering now as the stars come out to play.","The avenue is broad and decidedly residential.  The homes are not overly large or elegant, but well kept and nicely appointed.  A group of children can often be seen playing in the gardens and along the walkways, shouting happily to one another."],"exits":[{"to":216,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":214,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":216,"x":158,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Broad ironwoods grow tall on this side of the island protecting many small homes nestled under their protective foliage.  Like giants standing guard on this ocean-side knoll, they weave an eerie atmosphere as the shadows of moonlight play hide and seek.","Broad ironwoods grow tall on this side of the island protecting many small homes nestled under their protective foliage.  Like giants standing guard on this ocean-side knoll, they weave an eerie atmosphere as the shadows of the day grow long."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":217,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":217,"x":138,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A darkened home sits back from the road, surrounded by a high iron fence.  The gate is bolted shut as if the owner had been away for a long while.","An odd looking home sits back from the road, surrounded by a high iron fence.  The gate is bolted shut as if the owner had been away for a long while."],"exits":[{"to":216,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":218,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":218,"x":118,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A row of neatly trimmed buildings sits back off the road, warm lamplight radiating from the windows.  Most businesses, which are closed for the night, leave a lamp or candle burning to inform townsfolk that the owners are in residence and available for emergencies.","Neat and well kept buildings are set back from the road here.  Townsfolk scurry by, engaged in animated conversation, on their way to perform one errand or another."],"exits":[{"to":219,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":217,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":219,"x":118,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["A young family makes their way along the stone walkway toward the south and the beautiful views of the ocean.  A sturdy stone wall abuts the walkway and provides a safe barrier from the treachery of the sheer cliff beyond."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":220,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":220,"x":98,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Tierskel Way","descriptions":["Carriage traffic is very sporadic during the quiet hours of the evening and early morning.  On occasion a group of drunken sailors ambles through, lost from the main thoroughfare and creating a disturbance in the quiet neighborhood awaking angry residents from their slumber.","Carriages trundle in both directions, barely enough time is had to avoid the hooves of the great equines as they prance at a feverish pace."],"exits":[{"to":219,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":164,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":221,"x":38,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["A brick and timber building rises three floors above the avenue, small paned windows taking advantage of the southwest exposure.  The muted clang of a ship's bell, belies the presence of the busy port somewhere in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":222,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go forge"}]},
  {"id":222,"x":18,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["Several lovely homes find themselves ensconced amid neatly clipped shrubbery and tidy walkways.  Serviceable if not attractive fencing provides a bit of security to the urban neighborhood."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":223,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":221,"exit":"go","move":"go forge"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":223,"x":-2,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["A tiny shed sits at quite a peculiar angle just off the avenue, adjoined to an equally peculiar little cottage.  Sumptuous smells often linger in the air here, making the cottage the frequent subject of local prattle."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":172,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":224,"x":-22,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["Bright awnings and colorful pennants adorn the facade of a neat mud and brick building.  A lovely portico dotted with delightful iron chairs and matching tables offer weary shoppers a place to stop and catch their breath."],"exits":[{"to":172,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":225,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":225,"x":-42,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Kor'adu Avenue","descriptions":["The darkened facade of a large building casts a shadow on the street below.  A wall of wooden crates blocks passage along the walkway, forcing pedestrians into the street and the path of trotting hoofbeats."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":127,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":226,"x":78,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["A pair of stone nagas rise to either side of the great lifts that lead to the third tier and the seat of power.  Liveried messengers hurry past, bearing important documents for the traders and merchants who do business on this level.  A nearby barracks holds a complement of guards, ready day and night to secure the approaches if rioting or rebellion should break out among the lower classes and threaten the island's trade."],"exits":[{"to":164,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go lift"}]},
  {"id":227,"x":-22,"y":1,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upper Cobra Road","descriptions":["Cool sea-breezes sweep across the rocky precipice that divides lower Ratha from the higher class districts.  The massive lifts work day and night, hauling people and goods up and down between the levels.  The view from here is considerable, with many ships in the harbor below displaying all manner of construction and decoration, hailing from a dozen different ports of call."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":381,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden lift"}]},
  {"id":229,"x":-222,"y":41,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Sandy Path","descriptions":["Strewn with sandstone and driftwood, the path heads off towards the base of the cliff.  Footprints in the sand appear recent."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":65,"exit":"climb","move":"climb fence"}]},
  {"id":230,"x":-202,"y":21,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Base of the Cliff","descriptions":["Abruptly, the short path comes to an end at the base of a sheer cliff.  Sand and rock crumble with each step as scattered debris, rocks and, what appears to be crushed bone, lay strewn about.  From this vantage point, the cliff appears unclimbable, with barely a hint of a hand or foot-hold discernable."],"exits":[{"to":229,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":231,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cliff"}]},
  {"id":231,"x":-222,"y":1,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Narrow Ledge","descriptions":["With a start you find yourself standing on the lip of the narrowest ledge imaginable.  The face of the cliff rises before you, disappearing as quickly under your feet.  The slightest movement causes a cascade of small stones to plummet the remaining distance to the rock strewn ground below."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"},{"to":232,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cliff"}]},
  {"id":232,"x":-242,"y":-19,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Edge of Cliff","descriptions":["Despite the warning sign posted plainly at the cliff's edge, there are signs that a few foolhardy individuals have tested their climbing skills.  Peering over the edge of the cliff, one can imagine that a number of those fools have perished in the attempt.  Bypassers linger just over a sturdy retaining wall, taking in the view.","Despite the warning sign posted plainly at the cliff's edge, there are signs that a few foolhardy individuals have tested their climbing skills.  Peering over the edge of the cliff, one can imagine that a number of those fools have perished in the attempt.  Passersby linger just over a sturdy retaining wall, taking in the view."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cliff"},{"to":185,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}]},
  {"id":233,"x":78,"y":-299,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["The fine polished oak floor is scarred by the travel of cloven hooves and careless weaponmasters.  Despite the brutishness of some travelers the lift is well-maintained and operates near flawlessly."],"exits":[{"to":226,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":234,"x":-242,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Uaro Dock, Port of Ratha","descriptions":["Crates of all sizes and shapes, labeled and stamped, pile to make haphazard pyramids upon the long planks.  Heavy fishing nets are strung across the crates to the dock cleats to dry in the wind and a strong odor of salt and fish rises in the warm, humid air."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Uaro Dock","Aesry Surlaenis'a"]},
  {"id":235,"x":-242,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Kygar's Pub, Common Room","descriptions":["Long tables lined with matching benches fill the roomy pub, standing over a sawdust-covered floor swept clean every day.  Bunches of drying herbs hanging from rafters add spicy scents that mingle with the aromas of meats roasting on spits and the freshly-popped corn kernels that fill wooden bowls.  A small stage has been set up in one corner for minstrels, storytellers and other entertainers.  Contrasting shouts of glee and groans of dismay come from rooms set off to the east and the west."],"exits":[{"to":236,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":92,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Kygar's Pub"]},
  {"id":236,"x":-242,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Kygar's Pub, Courtyard","descriptions":["Feathery ferns and seasonal flowers grow abundantly in beds that circle the courtyard, surrounding numerous tables, each with its own canvas umbrella to shelter customers from inclement weather.  A half dozen tall torchieres are imbedded in the ground giving off light and warmth.  Bowls of crunchy popped corn, a longtime tradition of Kygar's Pub, sit on each table."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":237,"x":-298,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Supplies and Rental Office","descriptions":["The shop is filled with the smell of raw metals, a smell so sharp that it clings to the teeth.  A large iron door stands at the back of the room, acting as a barricade between the forge and the front shop.  Leaning on the door eyeing the patrons is Grimbly herself, a handsome 'Tog in full chain armor and custom forged jewelry.  Sitting at a ticket counter is an elderly Elothean sales clerk, keeping Grimbly's affairs in order.  A battered rack and an ingot table display forging supplies."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":357,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Grimbly's Forge"]},
  {"id":238,"x":-262,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Great Hall","descriptions":["A musty dampness pervades this cavernous room, and a faint salt breeze flutters down from a gaping hole in the roof where decades of neglect have caused the weathered beams to collapse.  Faint smudges of paint on the peeling plaster walls evidence the prior existence of proud frescoes, but all that now remains is the occasional hint of a sword arm raised in combat, and the grimace of a dying warrior disembodied from his once-glorious likeness.","The benighted city's low murmur drifts down from a ragged aperture in the roof of this vast chamber, and shadows shudder from torches ranged around the peeling plaster walls.  Water drips persistently from some unseen source, forming shallow pools on the worn flagstone floor before seeping silently through the cracks into the porous rock beneath."],"exits":[{"to":239,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":104,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Barbarian","Anhh'shre","RS Barbarian"]},
  {"id":239,"x":-242,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory","descriptions":["Numerous poky cells line one wall of this dim hallway.  A half-hearted attempt at decorating the place has been made at some stage -- probably many years ago, judging by the greyish tone of the paint and the chipped and peeling plaster.  Underfoot, the flagstones are worn into a smooth groove where many feet have trodden."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":352,"exit":"go","move":"go stone steps"}]},
  {"id":240,"x":-262,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Pit Gallery","descriptions":["Descending some fifteen feet into semi-darkness, a circular pit rimmed by low iron railings commands much of the room's floorspace  --  little more than a narrow ledge of standing room remains around the edge of the sunken arena.  Scrawled in faded chalk across the chipped plaster on the far wall, a crude sign declares the Pit Rules."],"exits":[{"to":241,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":238,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":241,"x":-282,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Death Slab","descriptions":["A single slab of chiseled black granite forms a low dais spanning the breadth of this forlorn anteroom.  Glistening treacherously underfoot, the blood of the vanquished coagulates in blackish pools across the stone's cragged expanse, while the rhythmic drip of chilly water echoes forlornly in the gloom."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":242,"x":-282,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Paedraig's Pawn","descriptions":["Cracked glass doors block access to the cluttered shelves which line the walls of the shop.  A thin film of oily dirt covers everything in the room, leaving a repulsively tacky finish which clings to boots and sandals with each step across the grimy floor.  The burly figure of the owner stands behind the counter, half-hidden by the shadows which fill the area."],"exits":[{"to":110,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Pawnshop"]},
  {"id":243,"x":-142,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Mother Magpie's Gems and Metals","descriptions":["A thin film of grease and dust vies with the cobwebs to cover the floor and counter in the tiny shop.  Old Mother Magpie is a familiar character to residents of the area commonly known as 'Tog Town.  Dealing in gems and precious metals, rumor has it she also sponsors a band of street rats who bring her some of her... rarer items."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mother Magpie's Gems and Metals","gems"]},
  {"id":244,"x":-118,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"MAMAS Company, Ratha Branch","descriptions":["Small, dark, and dust-filled, the room is lit only by one ceiling-hung lantern that seems not to have been cleaned in some time.  Piles of rocks lie scattered in corners and on the scratched and stained counter, sorted by color or weight, or in some cases, by whim.  A frayed map is mounted on the wall behind a hanging set of curiously dust-free scales."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["MAMAS Company","weight","scales"]},
  {"id":245,"x":138,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["This open air porch looks to have been constructed by drunken Halflings.  Every plank of the deck creaks loudly.  The stoop sags low, making many a customer duck their head.  Benches on either side of the tavern's swinging doors give people a place to sit when it gets too hot inside."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Old Rat's Tavern"]},
  {"id":246,"x":138,"y":391,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["The bar's taproom has sawdust covered floors and dirty wood planks for walls.  Flies swarm around open ale casks and piles of trash.  A dirty counter is piled with unwashed ceramic mugs and tin cups.  Stools are set up around a few beat-up tables."],"exits":[{"to":251,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":247,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":245,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":249,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"}]},
  {"id":247,"x":128,"y":391,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern, Back Room","descriptions":["The back room is falling apart along with the rest of the tavern.  Dirty wooden planks atop battered crates are the only seats, besides the floor.  A group of ragged S'Kra Mur throw daggers at the vermin which infest the shadows of the room."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":246,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Reflex training"]},
  {"id":248,"x":128,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["A lone table, propped under one leg with a wad of paper, sits under a hanging black iron lantern.  Rough wooden chairs with unidentifiable stains on the seats are scattered about, most of them covered in half-empty glasses and the knocked-out ashes from pipes."],"exits":[{"to":249,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":247,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":249,"x":138,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["This room is full of empty crates and barrels.  A number of dead rats lay among the other refuse.  The sour smell of ale gone bad fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":250,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":248,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":246,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":798,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rotting ladder"}]},
  {"id":250,"x":148,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["Boxes and crates are stacked up solidly against the walls, and it appears that in places, they may be all that stands between you and the harbor.  The rough planks and logs from which the room was built seem to be random driftwood that has washed ashore and been scavenged for use as building materials."],"exits":[{"to":249,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":251,"x":148,"y":391,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern","descriptions":["The roof slants down sharply, almost reaching to the floor on one side, showing that this room has been created by the simple expedient of leaning planks against the building and knocking out the wall leading to the tap room.  The ever-present breeze off the harbor whistles through the gaps in the walls, creating background music for the more raucous cries of the patrons."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":252,"x":78,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Lower Bank of Ratha, Portico","descriptions":["The massive slate roof of the bank overhangs the wide entrance, forming a welcome pool of shade on hot days.  A pair of well-armed guards lean on wicked-looking tridents, while cold ophidian eyes watch every person carefully.","The massive slate roof of the bank overhangs the wide entrance, forming a deep pool of shade relieved by a pair of bronze and crystal flambeaux half again as tall as an Elothean.  A quartet of well-armed guards lean on wicked-looking tridents, while their cold ophidian eyes watch every person carefully.  The doors are open to the night and the energetic sounds of commerce waft out from within."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"}]},
  {"id":253,"x":78,"y":311,"z":0,"title":"Lower Bank of Ratha, Atrium","descriptions":["A wide expanse of cool sea-foam green marble stretches across this noble room.  Far overhead, crystal panes set within a spidery framework of gilded wrought-iron provide ample light that seems to intensify every color.  Lofty arches on three sides lead to the various banking departments:  The Bursar for foreign currency exchange, the Cashiers for regular banking transactions and the Bourse for private sales.","A wide expanse of cool sea-foam green marble stretches across this noble room.  Far overhead, crystal panes set within a spidery framework of gilded wrought iron provide ample light that in daytime, will flood the room with brightness.  Lofty arches on three sides lead to the various banking departments:  The Bursar for foreign currency exchange, the Cashiers for regular banking transactions and the Bourse for private sales."],"exits":[{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go bursar"},{"to":255,"exit":"go","move":"go bourse"},{"to":256,"exit":"go","move":"go cashiers"},{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"}],"aliases":["1bank"]},
  {"id":254,"x":88,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Lower Bank of Ratha, Currency Exchange","descriptions":["The soft jingle of coins mixes with the sharp click of an abacus being rapidly worked.  A low counter separates customers from the moneychangers and a brisk business ensues at all hours.  Cool efficiency suffuses each transaction and there is little or no exchange of courtesies or bonhomie beyond the minimum necesary to complete the task at hand."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go atrium"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Exchange"]},
  {"id":255,"x":78,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Lower Bank of Ratha, Auction Bourse","descriptions":["This large room has been set aside by the bank for those wishing to do business among themselves and to prevent the regular transactions from being disrupted.  Heavy velvet drapes line the walls and a thick carpet covers the normally bare marble floor to muffle the sound of buying and selling and the not-infrequent disputes that arise over same."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go atrium"}],"aliases":["Auction Bourse"]},
  {"id":256,"x":88,"y":311,"z":0,"title":"Lower Bank of Ratha, Cashier","descriptions":["Pale buff marble walls frame an equally bland beige counter where cold-eyed tellers process transactions with a plentitude of speed and accuracy but a notable lack of warmth or attempts at false friendship common to other such institutions.  Business is the order of the day and that which interferes has no place in these cool and efficient chambers of commerce."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go atrium"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Teller"]},
  {"id":257,"x":-2,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Sisters-in-Lore, Herbal and Alchemical Supplies","descriptions":["A fire crackles merrily in a cast iron stove mounted in an alcove along the rear wall of the shop.  The remaining walls are covered with shelves lined with colorful glass bottles and vials.  Dozens of cloth bags hang from hooks attached to the rafters, each of which gives off a distinctive fragrance.  Two elderly S'Kra Mur women dressed in identical enveloping black robes potter about the shop, occupied with their daily routine."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":258,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Sisters-in-Lore","herbalist","alchemist"]},
  {"id":258,"x":8,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Sisters-in-Lore, Shallow Nook","descriptions":["This comfortable nook is located off to one side of the main shop.  A stained-glass lamp burns atop an old-fashioned ball and claw foot table, and a comfortable (though rather tattered) chair sits beside it.  Shelves line the walls of the nook, filled with books on healing and alchemy."],"exits":[{"to":257,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Herbal Library"]},
  {"id":259,"x":-3,"y":369,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Carousel Square","descriptions":["A massive conical building rises from the cobbles at the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly.  A sparkling mosaic of coral and turquoise set above an oval doorway reads \"THE CAROUSEL.\"  "],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":260,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":875,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":260,"x":7,"y":369,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, The Carousel","descriptions":["Exotic tapestries of every possible description drape the wall ringing the Carousel's core.  A circular roof supports a vast framework of iron and timbers rising to the building's apex.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights within the structure form the strikingly complex and beautiful mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":261,"exit":"go","move":"go desk"},{"to":350,"exit":"go","move":"go second arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Vault","Carousel"]},
  {"id":261,"x":17,"y":369,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Carousel Desk","descriptions":["A long wooden desk spans the width of the western wall.  Brass lanterns hang from the ceiling, and the floor behind the desk is covered in spotless red tile."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Carousel Desk"]},
  {"id":262,"x":238,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Uasin Dock, Port of Ratha","descriptions":["This dock is as sturdy and well-made as the others in the city, but has been painted a garish peacock blue, oddly out of place against the stark canvas and weathered wood of the rest of the area.","This dock, as well made as the others in the city, is painted a garish peacock blue.  Workers, dressed in dark clothing, rush about loading and unloading ships."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Uasin Dock","Hara'jaal"]},
  {"id":263,"x":218,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Reception","descriptions":["A jewel-toned carpet covers the floor of this cozy office, giving it a cheerful quality despite its cramped quarters.  Teak paneling surrounds the room, supporting a rich exhibit of wall displays by local artists.  A curved corner desk dominates the room, manned by the guild secretary, and directly across from it sits a brocade-cushioned bench.  Just to the side of the desk is an arch that leads to the hallway, the faint noise of workers beyond."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":783,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Trader"]},
  {"id":264,"x":238,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Trader Market, Port of Call","descriptions":["Murals depicting busy ports cover each of the walls, while arches artistically painted as the entrances to shops lead to the other rooms.  Brightly lit silver-plated lanterns hang from the ceiling.  Four tables are set corner to corner resulting in a diamond shape in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":265,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":265,"x":218,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Trader Market, Country Faire","descriptions":["Vibrantly-colored silk swatches drape from a center point in the ceiling out to its edges like the inside of a festive tent.  Murals of crowds visiting country faires cover each of the walls.  Tall torches in each corner provide light to the tables that line the floor."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":264,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":266,"x":238,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Trader Market, Market Day","descriptions":["A busy marketplace with brightly festooned stalls is depicted in a running mural that spans from wall to wall.  The ceiling has been painted in shades of blue with fluffy, white clouds.  Brass-plated lanterns set in each corner shine brightly on the tables set towards each wall."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":265,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":267,"x":258,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Trader Market, City Streets","descriptions":["Painted onto each wall is a running mural of a bustling city street, complete with hawkers on the corners, pushcarts, and children playing with hoops and balls.  Lanterns hang on bronze hooks as part of the scene and throw a constant light on the tables that are pushed into the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":266,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":268,"x":-202,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Foyer","descriptions":["A pair of benches flank the white-tiled hallway that feeds patients into and out of the tidy clinic.  A stringent odor fills the air and triggers painful memories of other visits to similar places and the associated pain (and expense).  The few people waiting on the benches seem indisposed to chat, some being busy bleeding all over the tile floor or engaged in other matters of a similarly upsetting nature."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":67,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":269,"x":-192,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Dispensary","descriptions":["Moans, groans, screams and the keening of still-conscious beings undergoing excruciating pain and terror emanate from three treatment rooms that open off this rotunda.  The air is cold and heavy with nervous tension overlaid with the stench of blood and the sharp, astringent odors of medicines.  Several coldly efficient S'Kra direct the entire facility, dispensing minor first aid, directing people to treatment rooms and arranging supplies for the harried surgeons."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":270,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":272,"exit":"go","move":"go one"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go two"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go three"}],"aliases":["Dispensary"]},
  {"id":270,"x":-192,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Empath's Lounge","descriptions":["Set on the roof of the clinic, this comfortable room is meant as a retreat for the staff and for visiting Healers.  One side opens out onto a small but well-tended roof garden where many herbs and useful plants are grown.  Inside, several comfortable chairs and sofas await the weary and work-worn."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":271,"exit":"go","move":"go garden"}],"aliases":["Empath's Lounge"]},
  {"id":271,"x":-192,"y":111,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Roof Garden","descriptions":["An oasis of green in a city of barren stone and rock, this garden holds a concentrated subset of the many herbs and plants needed to refresh the working Empath.  Built by a master, the small space mimics a wild environment, with plants growing in a seeming haphazard fashion amongst their natural brethren.  Tall plantings hide the view of the town and mitigate the chill, damp sea winds."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go lounge"}],"aliases":["Roof Garden"]},
  {"id":272,"x":-202,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Treatment Room One","descriptions":["Several cots and pallets await the sick and wounded.  Cold white tile and chill stone floors make the environment clean but lacking in warmth.  Even the cots are a bleached white.  The only trace of color in the room is a thick spray of blood on the wall, each drop sparkling in the glaring light like a ruby.  The sight is less than reassuring."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go dispensary"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Onsuwayo's Clinic","Treatment Room One","auto-Empath","autopath","Healer"]},
  {"id":273,"x":-192,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Treatment Room Two","descriptions":["Someone has recently died a messy death here.  The walls and even the ceiling are festooned with thick streamers of drying blood.  One cot is soaked with the crimson spew and everyone else awaiting treatment edges away from it as if it were a leper at a wedding feast.  A harried looking drudge is mopping ineffectually at a coagulating puddle of grue in the middle of the room."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go dispensary"}],"aliases":["Treatment Room Two"]},
  {"id":274,"x":-182,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Onsuwayo's Clinic, Treatment Room Three","descriptions":["This room appears to hold the failures of the clinic's work.  Several shrouded forms lie stacked on metal shelves along the back wall next to a stone table that angles down to a large drain.  One dim sconce is the only light source, and the changing, flickering light makes the shrouded forms seem to waver or move."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go dispensary"}],"aliases":["Treatment Room Three"]},
  {"id":275,"x":-302,"y":-149,"z":0,"title":"Furrier's Shop","descriptions":["Untanned skins lie piled atop each other on the floor, while cured leather stretches in wooden frames hung upon the walls.  Surly Gor'Tog laborers toil away, using large paddles to turn the skins soaking in the vats.  The proprieter of the tannery looks on from his spot behind the counter."],"exits":[{"to":144,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Furrier's Shop","Bundles","Bundle"]},
  {"id":276,"x":-202,"y":191,"z":0,"title":"Imble's Ironworks, Receiving Docks","descriptions":["Stepping through the large doorway, you enter a cavernous building.  Rife with smoke and heat, the thought occurs to turn and seek the freshness of the air outside the door.  Three crumbling stone steps lead into a room, illuminated brightly by the blazing foundry.  Enormous carts filled with rocks and dirt are queued, waiting to be transported along the tracks toward the inferno beyond."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":277,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":277,"x":-202,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Imble's Ironworks, Foundry","descriptions":["Burning every moment of every day, the great fires of the foundry generate enormous heat.  Giant bellows and cooling fans, operated by the teams of burly slaves, assist the smiths in creating the famous anchors.  Though master craftsman abound in this shop, Imble himself is always willing to give the interested visitor a sound lesson in taming the molten iron ore."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Imble's Ironworks","Strength training"]},
  {"id":278,"x":158,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley off Kssintlee Way","descriptions":["A narrow alley runs along the back of Jack Tarr's Rest, passing by a peeling wooden door.  From the fragrant aromas, this must lead to the kitchens.  Chittering noises echo through the area as red-eyed rats dart out of sight.  At the end of the alley, a wooden bin stands before a ramshackle old wall, overflowing with trash awaiting disposal."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":279,"x":188,"y":231,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Porch","descriptions":["Traders gather on the porch of the inn, sipping mugs of ale and puffing at carved bone pipes as they discuss their latest successes or bemoan the loss of a venture.  A bench swing rocks back and forth with a creaking noise as the chains rub against the hooks in the ceiling, and a pleasant breeze from the sea carries with it the sharp tang of saltwater."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":280,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Jack Tarr"]},
  {"id":280,"x":188,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Front Hall","descriptions":["The walls of the foyer are covered with stippled whitewashed plaster and polished teak wainscotting.  A brass bell sits atop the front desk.  From the dents and scratches in the metal, it sees much use as patrons demand service from a harried-looking clerk.  A hallway leads east toward the stairs, while sounds of merriment echo from the nearby common room where guests can enjoy a snack or meal at any time of the day."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":279,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":282,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":294,"exit":"go","move":"go common room"}]},
  {"id":281,"x":198,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Back Hall","descriptions":["Exposed oak beams, darkened with smoke and age, crisscross the whitewashed plaster ceiling of the hallway.  The scent of fish wafts from the door of the nearby kitchen, where a cook can be heard berating a hapless assistant.  Seascapes and pictures of sailing ships line the walls, while dark oak stairs lead up to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":283,"exit":"go","move":"go kitchen"},{"to":284,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":282,"x":178,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Private Parlor","descriptions":["The private parlor is quieter than the common room, providing the more fastidious guests a place to retreat from the noise and jostling of the crowd.  A polished mahogany table nearly fills the room, surrounded by captain's chairs pulled neatly under the edge of the varnished surface.  A fire crackling in the hearth makes this a cozy place for guests to relax.  Seascapes and pictures of various ships are scattered along the paneled walls."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":283,"x":208,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Kitchen","descriptions":["Copper kettles and cast iron pans hang from hooks embedded in the exposed oak beams which run along the ceiling.  Minyi Barberry, a portly Halfling woman, manages the kitchens of the inn, her wooden ladle sending fear into the hearts of the scullery maids as they scamper to do her bidding.  Brick ovens built into the walls give off an aroma of baked breads, and fish grills over an open fire on the stove."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":284,"x":198,"y":251,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Upstairs Hall","descriptions":["A narrow table stands at the northern end of the long upstairs hallway.  Above the table, vases filled with creamy white starflowers hang on either side of a painting of the late Josiah Jack Tarr.  Black gauze draped above the painting trails down to pool in soft heaps upon the floor.  Nearby, darkened oak stairs spiral down to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":292,"exit":"go","move":"go burlwood door"},{"to":293,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"},{"to":281,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":285,"x":198,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Upstairs Hall","descriptions":["A red and gold runner covers the dark oak floorboards of the hallway, the colors vivid against the polished wood.  The gilded frames of the paintings which hang on the whitewashed walls gleam dully in the light.  Each painting depicts a ship on which Captain Josiah Tarr had served before his unfortunate death at sea.  A trapdoor in the ceiling leads up to the widow's walk on the top of the inn."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":286,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":290,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"},{"to":291,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":286,"x":198,"y":271,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Upstairs Hall","descriptions":["A painting of Magda Tarr, the wife of Captain Josiah Tarr, hangs above a narrow table at the southern end of the hallway.  A sour-faced Halfling woman, the painter has captured her expression perfectly, frozen in a perpetual glare at her husband's picture to the north.  Rumor has it that one of the incentives behind Captain Jack's many sea voyages was the lengthy time it gave him away from his wife."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":287,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"},{"to":288,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"},{"to":289,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":287,"x":188,"y":271,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Sandpiper's Chamber","descriptions":["Carved wooden figures of seabirds are scattered on shelves mounted on the pale green walls of the room.  A carved maple bed is covered with a vibrant yellow and white quilt in the tall ships pattern, and a few brightly colored throw rugs are scattered across the floor.  Leather chairs stand on either side of an open window, providing a comfortable place to sit and talk after a long journey."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"}]},
  {"id":288,"x":198,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Oceancaller's Chambers","descriptions":["Pale shades of color, identical to those seen in the fairest of sunsets, are lavishly painted on the walls.  In the center of this illusory twilight is a large couch, flanked by two nightstands, each covered with brilliantly tinted bottles.  It is within the bottle's glassy surfaces that light is reflected, sending a shower of prismatic spots across the heavy iron tub that rests in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}]},
  {"id":289,"x":208,"y":271,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Surfskimmer's Chamber","descriptions":["Comfortable blue chairs stand on either side of a smoke-stained brick fireplace.  Above the mantle is a picture of a swept-masted coaster.  The name on the bow identifies the vessel as the Surfskimmer.  In the corner of the room is a polished oak bed covered by a colorful velvet and silk crazy quilt."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":290,"x":188,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Seasinger's Chamber","descriptions":["Lace curtains move gently in the breeze from an open window overlooking the street below.  The walls of the room are painted a pale shade of amber with a soft gold glaze sponged on to give it a dappled effect.  A captain's bed stands on one side of the room, with a cheerful blue and green sister's choice quilt spread across the mattress.  On the other side of the room, a pair of leather chairs stand on either side of a low table."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}]},
  {"id":291,"x":208,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Mistwalker's Chamber","descriptions":["The sea blue walls of the tiny chamber have been sponge-painted with a lighter color, making them appear to shift like the mist rising over the harbor on an autumn morning.  A wide four-poster bed covered with a mariner's compass quilt and piled high with cushions nearly fills the room, leaving just enough space for a comfortable reading chair beside the nightstand."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":292,"x":188,"y":251,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Windrunner's Chamber","descriptions":["A wide brass bed with a lace coverlet and frilly pillows nearly fills the tiny chamber.  Beside the bed, a crystal vase filled with an arrangement of rosebuds stands atop a nightstand.  An intricately woven carpet covers the floor, muffling the sounds from the common room below."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"go","move":"go burlwood door"}]},
  {"id":293,"x":208,"y":251,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Wavedancer's Chamber","descriptions":["A vibrant floral carpet covers the polished oak floorboards of the tiny chamber.  The colors of the carpet are echoed in the quilted coverlet atop the dark oak sleigh bed.  The quilt, a traditional storm at sea pattern, was at one time believed to be a binding spell to protect those it sheltered from Drogor's anger."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"}]},
  {"id":294,"x":178,"y":231,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Common Room","descriptions":["Waitresses carrying trays laden with food and drink make their way through the closely packed tables which fill the darkened common room.  The floor is sticky from spills, and the candles' illumination is fitful at best, yet none of that seems to affect the patrons' enjoyment.  A group of rowdies give catcalls and whistles of appreciation as a bard performs a slightly bawdy song in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":295,"exit":"go","move":"go corner"}]},
  {"id":295,"x":168,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Jack Tarr's Rest, Darkened Corner","descriptions":["A wooden booth dominates this corner of the common room, its surface scarred by hundreds of brawls and warped by spilled ale.  A seedy Halfling sits at the booth, clutching a mug of some dark liquid in his hand."],"exits":[{"to":294,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Jack Tarr's Rest","Intelligence training"]},
  {"id":296,"x":-282,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"Antellius' Weapons Training","descriptions":["The scents of old sweat and dried blood have been worked into the wooden floor of the salle with the passage of time.  Hundreds of students have walked these polished boards, their skills ranging from inept to masterful.  Blademaster Antellius, the school's patron and head teacher, stands in one corner of the room, appraising his students."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Antellius' Weapons Training","Agility training"]},
  {"id":297,"x":-312,"y":-69,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Meadow Park","descriptions":["Hidden from the traffic of the road and the trail, this spot is a favorite for just enjoying the sun and the quiet of the meadow.  A little brook works its way through grass and stone. "],"exits":[{"to":187,"exit":"climb","move":"climb driftwood fence"},{"to":342,"exit":"go","move":"go small brook"}]},
  {"id":298,"x":-302,"y":-69,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Meadow Park","descriptions":["Birdsong and sweets smells highlight the lovely trail into the urban meadow.  Amidst the turmoil and chaos of the city, this meadow affords the average citizen a chance to enjoy the beauty and peacefulness of the outdoors without the long journey to the outskirts of town."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":187,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":299,"x":-302,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Meadow Park","descriptions":["The trail winds haphazardly here, through the gentle dale and along a low driftwood fence.  Sounds of splashing and laughter echo from just beyond a gentle hummock to the west.  A large, draping Sana'ati tree blocks the path as if awaiting a visit from a much loved companion."],"exits":[{"to":298,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":300,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sana'ati tree"}]},
  {"id":300,"x":-302,"y":-89,"z":0,"title":"Sana'ati Tree, Low Hanging Branch","descriptions":["The large branch here is broad and flat, well worn by many hours of comfortable repose.  Enveloping the branch, a canopy of leaves forms the walls of a large room.  Overhead, a sturdy limb leads out toward equally intriguing cubby holes."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large limb"},{"to":299,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large branch"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":-302,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Sana'ati Tree, Upper Limb","descriptions":["Refreshing breezes blow through the upper limbs of the great tree.  A well worn crook tells of many happy hours sitting and enjoying the arboreal hideaway.  Just above, a frayed rope descends from some upper reach of the tree, disappearing through a gap in the foliage."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"climb","move":"climb frayed rope"},{"to":300,"exit":"climb","move":"climb upper limb"}]},
  {"id":302,"x":-302,"y":-109,"z":0,"title":"Sana'ati Tree, Bird's Nest Lookout","descriptions":["A panoramic view from this spot takes the breath away.  The meadow, lush and rolling appears as a soft blanket, the pond just beyond the tree shimmers with reflected light.  The most dramatic, however, is the view of the sparkling crystal ocean, as far as the eye can see.  Through the curtain of leaves and branches a deep pool sparkles an invitation, a giant rope swing can be seen just below, hanging from an outstretched branch."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"climb","move":"climb frayed rope"},{"to":347,"exit":"go","move":"go deep pool"}]},
  {"id":303,"x":-342,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Elepaio's Luthierre","descriptions":["Birds twitter from wicker cages hung about the interior of the tiny music shop.  Their cheerful song fills the air with a perpetual melody, accompanying the singing of the Master Luthier, Elepaio, as she toils over her work."],"exits":[{"to":149,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Elepaio's Luthierre","instrument shop","music shop"]},
  {"id":304,"x":-222,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Mask and Leatherworks, Sales Room","descriptions":["Display cases holding leather armor and masks fill much of this tiny shop, but one corner is set up as a comfortable nook beside the stove.  An overstuffed chair sits beside the fire, occupied by a brightly garbed young Halfling man.  The noise of a hammer on metal may be heard from the nearby work room, along with an occasional muffled curse."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go work room"},{"to":837,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Raven's Mask and Leatherworks","leather shop"]},
  {"id":305,"x":58,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Krrikt'k's Forge, Salesroom","descriptions":["Deep red silk hangings fall in graceful folds along the walls, softening the stark lines of the tiny shop.  Mounted along the walls are samples of Mastersmith Krrikt'k's work, the polished steel reflecting the deep red glow of the fabric.  A dark oak counter stands at the center of the lamp-lit display room, bearing a brass-trimmed leather catalog with a list of the items available for sale."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":319,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Krrikt'k's Forge","Ssthin'lao","weapons"]},
  {"id":306,"x":18,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[]},
  {"id":307,"x":-62,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[]},
  {"id":308,"x":-162,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Vacant Lot","descriptions":["A decrepit fence surrounds the bare earth inside this vacant plot, its weathered slats often rotten or missing entirely.  Deeply worn into the otherwise featureless earth, a wide rut leads westward to disappear between two buildings on the other side of the lot."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":309,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":309,"x":-172,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bosun's Lane","descriptions":["The bumpy street stretches north and west, while to the east the cobblestones have been upturned by the roots of a pair of bloodwood trees, leaving only dirt marred by the occasional cracked stone.  Rotten wooden shutters hang precariously from the panes of ramshackle houses lining the road, and the faint sound of moving water can be heard to the west."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":308,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":310,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":310,"x":-182,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Upturned Ironwood","descriptions":["The cobbled street ends abruptly at a hole left by the fall of a massive ironwood.  The thick trunk has been chopped off, leaving only an upturned root ball extending from the recess.  Thick mud has filled the hole and now fosters dense growths of marsh plants."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":309,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":311,"x":-172,"y":291,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bosun's Lane","descriptions":["Abandoned houses line the broken street, shutters and doors hanging precariously from rusted hinges.  Round stones, stacked in a pyramid formation, sit in the doorway of one of the ruined buildings.  A large wooden barricade spans the width of the street, blocking further passage north."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":310,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":368,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden barricade"},{"to":368,"exit":"climb","move":"climb barr"}]},
  {"id":312,"x":-162,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zsikiel Monument","descriptions":["Tourists lounge under the monument's marble arches, enjoying the shade and the marvelous carvings on the memorial's columns.  The artwork depicts many points of Ratha's military history, particularly battles in which members of the Zsikiel family played an important role."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":313,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":313,"x":-162,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Zsikiel Monument","descriptions":["An immense memorial arch looms high across the alleyway.  Built by the merchant guilds of Ratha, the monument is a testament to the military achievements and patriotic sacrifices of the Zsikiel family.  The street does not bypass this feat of architecture but actually runs under its sweeping columns."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":312,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":314,"x":-182,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Puudu Alley","descriptions":["This part of the alley must run adjacent to some craft hall, because a number of barrels, filled with an assortment of scrap materials, line the side of the street.  Cured leather, pulped wood, and heated iron are the most prevalent scents that fill the air, all with the underlying aroma of mold and rust that comes from sitting out in the weather too long."],"exits":[{"to":313,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":315,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":315,"x":-182,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Puudu Alley","descriptions":["Many owners of the nearby buildings seem to use the alley as an open trash barrel.  Piles of refuse further impede those that travel this route, and few fail to leave the area without smelling a bit worse than when they entered."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":316,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":316,"x":-202,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Puudu Alley","descriptions":["The backsides of a number of shops and homes close in this road from both sides, throwing everything into shadows.  Traffic is thin, as most prefer the wide thoroughfares to the claustrophobic and perhaps more dangerous alleyway.  A few citizens still brave the passage, keeping a wary eye on all who pass near."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":317,"x":-82,"y":41,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bazaar","descriptions":["Roiling with festive chaos, the walkways of this multicultural bazaar are lined with colorful pennants, and crowded with milling shoppers from every corner of Elanthia.  Music, laughter, strange dialects and foreign tongues fill the air as merchants strike deals on everything from the finest raiment and precious gems to the most mundane of household staples.  Packs of impatient children stop to gaze hungrily at the latest in edible delicacies on display."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":318,"x":-222,"y":-189,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Mask and Leatherworks, Workroom","descriptions":["Fragrant piles of cured leather lie stacked about the tiny workroom, the aroma mingling with the scent of melted beeswax used to stiffen the leather for armor.  An almost half-finished leather mask sits upon the workbench, and several pieces of armor in various states of repair are heaped upon a table.  In the center of the room, a young Halfling woman perches upon a wooden stool, her nimble fingers flying as she puts the finishing touches on her current project."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"go","move":"go sales room"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Repair Leather"]},
  {"id":319,"x":78,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"Krrikt'k's Forge","descriptions":["No wood lines the walls of the forge, just massive stone blocks to reduce the risk of fire.  In the center, coals glow within a beehive-shaped furnace, the flames fanned by a leather bellows.  Apprentices work at their craft -- a tall dark-scaled youth hammers out a dent in greaves, a younger lass works on steel rings for chainmail, yet another smoothes nicks in the edge of a broadsword.  Overseeing them all, the Mastersmith works at his own anvil."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go salesroom"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Repair Metal"]},
  {"id":320,"x":-2,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Bait and Tackle","descriptions":["Built from pieces of wood scavenged from shipwrecks, the bait shop creaks and groans in time to the gentle waves of the harbor.  Three relatively flat boards placed across two barrels form a rough counter, and other barrels, old hogsheads, and rough boxes are scattered haphazardly around the room.  Judging by the smell, the shop handles a wide variety of baits and fishing supplies."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ratha Bait and Tackle","bait","tackle"]},
  {"id":321,"x":58,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Magical Art, Thuyza's Tattoo Place","descriptions":["The incessant droning of the crowds outside is hardly dulled by the rickety structure.  Attempts to mend the numerous rotted holes in the wood are evident, and many of the attempted fixes display signs of being patched as well.  From time to time, an errant beggar will peek through the door, only to have Thuyza hurl the nearest empty ink bottle in his or her face."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Thuyza's Tattoo Place","tattoo shop"]},
  {"id":322,"x":378,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Rubble","descriptions":["The crevice widens to become a long channel of high-walled stone.  Stalks of dune grass push through the broken shells and splintered rock which clutter the sandy floor.  Faint impressions, barely recognizable as footprints, head off to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"go","move":"go faint trail"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":378,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Shack","descriptions":["A tiny shack shoulders against the rocky wall at the back of the channel.  Thatched with sea oats, and constructed of vine-lashed driftwood embedded in mounds of stone and shells, the structure looks too frail to withstand the weather or offer much shelter.  A piece of scrap canvas hanging crookedly from a break in the driftwood serves as a door."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas door"},{"to":322,"exit":"go","move":"go faint trail"}]},
  {"id":324,"x":378,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Hermit's Shack","descriptions":["Ocean debris and the remains of ill-fated vessels washed ashore furnish the shack.  There are signs of recent occupancy, but nobody is currently home.  Whoever the resident is, his needs are simple: a table, a chair, and a set of shelves to display his homemade treasures."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Hermit's Shack"]},
  {"id":325,"x":398,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Cliffs","descriptions":["Seaweed and algae coating the rocks make footing on the uneven surfaces even more treacherous.  Cracked shells lie scattered about, seemingly out of place, at this height above the tide line.  The stone mounds offshore reach toward the high slab ridges, further confusing where land ends and ocean begins."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt slabs"}]},
  {"id":326,"x":418,"y":381,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Cliffs","descriptions":["The cliff edge drops abruptly, plunging vertically into the ocean far below.  Frothy waves crash against the rocky footings.  Farther downshore, a thin band of sand reappears, hugging the cliffs as they wind northward.  The sea stretches east, unbroken to the curved blue-grey horizon."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":198,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Captain Namazzi's Ship Goods","descriptions":["The scent of sea air drifts through the gaps of the wooden plank walls of this dilapidated shop.  The windows have become covered with a dark grimy film from years of neglect giving everything within a shade of brown.  Heavily laden shelves crowded with goods for the seafaring adventurer hang precariously from their mounts along the walls.  Disorganized tables crammed together create a maze of aisles."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Captain Namazzi's Ship Goods","general store"]},
  {"id":328,"x":138,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Paganell's Carpets","descriptions":["Barely visible rays of moonlight filter through mirrored tubes to bathe the sandy floor of the tiny cavern.  Colorful carpets hang along the walls, softening the black stone surfaces.  In the center of the room, a young weaver works at a loom, creating an oval carpet in a jewel toned medallion design."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Paganell's Carpets","carpets"]},
  {"id":329,"x":-242,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Dennats Baya","descriptions":["Black laquered cabinets line the walls of the shop, their open fronts displaying an assortment of hair care items ranging from razors to combs.  A small catalog rests on a marble counter that stretches from one end of the room to another.  Tiny iron smoke pots, perched on brass tripods in the corners, are giving off a strong odor from the incense burning within."],"exits":[{"to":143,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Dennats Baya","hair salon"]},
  {"id":330,"x":-62,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Amorand the Tailor","descriptions":["Clothing in the traditional colors of Ratha's ruling families is displayed on mannequins atop the counters scattered about the shop.  An open door in the base of one cabinet reveals bolts of fabric stacked in neat rows beneath the counters."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Amorand the Tailor","tailor","clothing shop"]},
  {"id":331,"x":-2,"y":-189,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Entry Hall","descriptions":["This sparsely decorated room leads into the interior of the inn. Lamps hung on the walls illuminate a dirty carpet."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":133,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Heron"]},
  {"id":332,"x":-2,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Bar","descriptions":["Crystal lamps hang from the ceiling of the bar, illuminating the room with rainbow sparkles of light.  The walls are paneled with varnished oak.  Soft music can be heard coming from the other rooms of the inn.  A long counter is set up in the middle of the room, with an elegantly lettered menu hanging behind it."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":333,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":331,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":334,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":336,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bar"]},
  {"id":333,"x":8,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Dance Hall","descriptions":["The high ceiling has a crystal chandelier hanging from its center.  Tables circle the hall's wood-tiled floor, leaving a large area open for couples to dance.  Soft music is being pumped into the room from some unseen place.  The walls are covered with festive tapestries."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":334,"x":-12,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Dance Stage","descriptions":["This room is dominated by a large stage.  The only illumination for the area are the lights set up along the foot of the stage.  A few chairs are lined up on the floor for the audience's comfort."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":335,"x":-2,"y":-209,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Corridor","descriptions":["The brightly lit hallway ends in a staircase that leads to the second floor.  A beautifully painted portrait hangs on the wood-paneled wall.  Music from other parts of the inn can be heard as soft background noise.  The air smells of freshly cut flowers."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":337,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}]},
  {"id":336,"x":-12,"y":-189,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Parlor","descriptions":["The room is painted a soft indigo and hung with shaded lamps.  A comfortable looking couch rests against one wall.  Thick carpeting, woven with a intricate design, covers the floor."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}]},
  {"id":337,"x":-2,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Upstairs Corridor","descriptions":["Crystal lamps hung from the ceiling illuminate the hallway.  A staircase on one end of the hall leads back down to the main floor of the inn.  An intricately woven tapestry hangs the length of one wall while four doors are spaced evenly along the other."],"exits":[{"to":338,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":339,"exit":"go","move":"go etched door"},{"to":340,"exit":"go","move":"go engraved door"},{"to":341,"exit":"go","move":"go inlaid door"},{"to":335,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}]},
  {"id":338,"x":8,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Common Room","descriptions":["This room smells of unwashed clothes and bedding in need of a good airing out.  A number of pallets are thrown about on the floor, leaving little room to move about.  Shaded lamps provide a small bit of illumination for the chamber.  The walls, once white, have faded to a dingy grey."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":339,"x":-12,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Dragon Room","descriptions":["A black lacquered bed, carved with gold dragons, sits in the center of the room.  The walls, one of which is completely covered by a large tapestry, are painted a dark blue.  Dragon statues stand in every corner of the room with small lamps held in their mouths to illuminate the chamber."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go etched door"}]},
  {"id":340,"x":-12,"y":-209,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Rose Room","descriptions":["The sweet smell of roses fills this room, coming from a number of vases full of freshly cut flowers.  A huge four-poster bed, draped with silken veils, fills up most of the chamber.  The walls are painted a soft pink with a rose-motif design.  All of the room's wood molding is beautifully carved with roses and leafy vines."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":341,"x":8,"y":-209,"z":0,"title":"The Golden Heron Inn, Gold Room","descriptions":["The walls are painted a soft gold and hung with silky drapes.  A great oak bed, varnished a golden brown, takes up the greater portion of the room.  Large vases, veneered with gold leaf, are filled with beautiful yellow tulips that fill the air with a sweet scent."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go inlaid door"}]},
  {"id":342,"x":-312,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"Meadow Park, Babbling Brook","descriptions":["Gurgling happily past, the delightful little brook cuts a path through the rolling meadow.  A small stone bench at the eastern edge of the brook offers the weary a chance to sit and dip their feet in the whirling water."],"exits":[{"to":343,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":297,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":343,"x":-312,"y":-89,"z":0,"title":"Meadow Park, Babbling Brook","descriptions":["Cool and refreshing, the water here runs clear.  Looking closely, small fish can be seen swimming along upstream toward the quiet pools of the pond beyond."],"exits":[{"to":342,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":344,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":344,"x":-322,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Odalva Reach, Meadow Park","descriptions":["In the shadow of the great Sana'ati, the meadow here is cool and fragrant.  The sounds of playful activity at the pond and the babbling of a little brook nearby infuse the area with an atmosphere of carefree innocence."],"exits":[{"to":345,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":343,"exit":"go","move":"go brook"}]},
  {"id":345,"x":-332,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Meadow Park, Shallow Pond","descriptions":["Surrounded by tall grasses, and a sandy embankment, this pond is barely visible from the trail.  Opening out toward the west, the shallow watering hole is perfectly oval and tended to by a motherly weeping willow.  The pond is protected from the wind of the bluff, making a perfect reflection possible on a calm day."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":346,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sandy embankment"}]},
  {"id":346,"x":-332,"y":-109,"z":0,"title":"Shallow Pond, In the Water","descriptions":["Quiet and reflective or wild and splashing, the pond serves many purposes for the inhabitants of the neighborhood.  Clear and surprisingly warm, the water is silky to the touch and about waist high for a human and surrounded by a sandy embankment.  At the eastern end of the pond is a clear, deep pool perfect for diving."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":345,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sandy embankment"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":347,"x":-312,"y":-109,"z":0,"title":"Shallow Pond, Deep Pool","descriptions":["The pool here is very deep, surrounded by large boulders and tall grass along a steep bank.  Warmed by an underground hot spring, the water is soothing and delightful.  Hanging just out of reach, a large rope swing is suspended from the upper branches of the large sana'ati tree in the meadow just beyond the pond."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":348,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep bank"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":348,"x":-312,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Deep Pool, Sandy Shore","descriptions":["Pebbles and smooth sand line the shoreline.  Several old logs have been placed strategically along the edge of the water.  Swimmers stop to rest and watch the divers plummet into the water from the giant tree above or lurch out into the deep pool on the incredible rope swing."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"go","move":"go deep pool"},{"to":302,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rope swing"}]},
  {"id":349,"x":58,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, High Guardhouse","descriptions":["Marked by mud, bread crumbs, and apple peels, this guardhouse is the epitome of filthy.  If the high guard runs inspections, it obviously missed this post."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Guardhouse"]},
  {"id":350,"x":7,"y":359,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Carousel Booth","descriptions":["A polished steel lever protrudes from the eastern wall of the small, ebony-panelled room, flanking a steel door to the north."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"none","move":"pull lever; go door; open vault; look in vault"},{"to":260,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":351,"x":7,"y":349,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Carousel Chamber","descriptions":["A sturdy vault, set in the back wall, stands ready for your use.  The floor is covered by a soft thick carpet of deep red, and the walls are paneled in polished gold pine.  Looking at the back wall, you notice a tiny gap between it and the rest of the room."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"none","move":"close vault;go door"},{"to":350,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":352,"x":-222,"y":321,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory","descriptions":["The uppermost stair on a short flight of stone steps has been worn down so far over the years that it forms a semi-circular well reaching halfway across the corridor.  Along one wall, mismatched doors lead into the private rooms of the Guild's local members, each small cell no larger than a walk-in closet."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":355,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":239,"exit":"go","move":"go stone steps"}]},
  {"id":353,"x":-222,"y":301,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory","descriptions":["The ceiling sags precariously overhead, bulging downward as if bowed by a great weight of water, although the air is dry and dusty.  A warm draft swells inexplicably from beneath the splintered floorboards, which creak and groan in protest at the lack of care shown them by generations of inattentive residents."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":352,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":-222,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory","descriptions":["The corridor ends abruptly beneath a grimy skylight, which contributes little either to the illumination or the view in this stuffy attic.  A breath of hot, dry air buoys particles of choking dust around the dead end, as the strident grind of industry clanks from somewhere below."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":-222,"y":341,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory","descriptions":["A few torches strung unevenly along one wall of the narrow corridor cast little more than a glum flicker of light across the patchy plasterwork and loose floorboards.  Muffled scratches and squeaks issue forth from a deep cavity beneath the greyed oak planks."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":-262,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Savage Pit","descriptions":["The air is thick with the stench of sweat and blood inside this deep, barrel-shaped enclosure.  Underfoot, a cloying layer of sludgy sand carpets the cramped arena and crusts in stinking clumps around the base of the circular wooden wall.  Countless brown stains and splintered pockmarks scar the iron-banded palisade."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}]},
  {"id":357,"x":-298,"y":451,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Entryway","descriptions":["This passage acts as an entryway in and out of the forge.  Stifling heat marches up from a large hall to the south, nearly destroying a subtle cross-breeze heading east and west.  To the north, a thick iron door protects the outside office from the smothering heat."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":360,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":359,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}]},
  {"id":358,"x":-288,"y":451,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, East Passage","descriptions":["A gentle breeze stirs in this passage, adding a bit of relief to the blistering heat.  To the east are two open entryways, leading out to grindstones."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":366,"exit":"go","move":"go drafty entryway"},{"to":367,"exit":"go","move":"go dirty entryway"}]},
  {"id":359,"x":-308,"y":451,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, West Passage","descriptions":["The small side passage offers some protection from the heat, making the temperature tolerable.  Two entrances lead to rooms on the west end, one streaked with oily handprints and one that has been haphazardly scrubbed down.  Beyond the oily entrance, you can hear the high-pitched song of grinding metal."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":364,"exit":"go","move":"go scrubbed entrance"},{"to":365,"exit":"go","move":"go oily entrance"}]},
  {"id":360,"x":-298,"y":471,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Brick Hall","descriptions":["Soot-stained red brick makes up the walls and floor of this large hall.  Other than a scrap bin placed at the south wall, the hall is otherwise unfurnished.  On the west wall are three archways, through which the sound of pounding metal can be heard.  On the east wall are three doorways, blackened with coal dust."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":361,"exit":"go","move":"go smudged doorway"},{"to":362,"exit":"go","move":"go blackened doorway"},{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go sooty doorway"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":-288,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["Eerie shadows dance on the walls across the smudged doorway that leads out of the foundry.  A huge iron crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  Lying in wait within reach of the sparking embers are the arms of the bellows, ready to gulp up air and feed the ravenous flames.  Black dust fills the air, spiraling up in the heat as it blows off a pile of coal.  Molds for ingots, plate and wire line the inner walls."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go smudged doorway"}]},
  {"id":362,"x":-288,"y":471,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["The floor slopes toward a circular firepit fed by a large pile of crushed coal.  A huge iron crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  A leather bellows lies close at hand, while stone molds of various sizes and shapes, waiting to be filled, line the far wall.  The only exit is a blackened doorway to the west."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go blackened doorway"}]},
  {"id":363,"x":-288,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["A huge iron crucible sways from a blackened beam in the center of the foundry.  Molds for ingots, plate and wire lie in wait underneath the far end of the crucible, while the large arms of the bellows and immense coal pile are placed in convenient reach.  A sooty doorway leads back into the hall."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go sooty doorway"}]},
  {"id":364,"x":-318,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Break Room","descriptions":["This is a small, simple room set up to act as a break room for people working in the forge.  Above, a small slitted window lets in some fresh air, helping to take a bite out of the heat.  A rickety table made from salt-stained planks lies in the center of the room, offering a simple snack.  Nearby on the floor is an open barrel with a tin ladle chained to it.  Several crates line the floor as well, acting as chairs."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":365,"x":-318,"y":451,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Grinding Room","descriptions":["This is a small grinding room set apart from the others.  Conveniently located by the break room, it also tends to be the most used.  Young Gor'Tog lads, looking to earn a spare coin for their families, work to sweep up shavings and oil the stones."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":366,"x":-278,"y":451,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Grinding Room","descriptions":["A large grated window set high on the east side of this room provides a steady stream of air from the outside world.  Set back from the rest of the forge, only the whining of grinding metals can be heard.  A large grindstone is here, accompanied by a moderately clean bucket of cool water."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":367,"x":-278,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Grimbly's Forge, Grinding Room","descriptions":["The warm air is filled with the smell of heated metal.  Far from the sound of the hammers, the grindstones have been placed to allow for freedom of movement as journeyman smiths work to perfect their prized blades.  Curious apprentices hover about, hoping to learn a trick or two studying those that take a turn at the wheel."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":368,"x":-162,"y":271,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["The street lies desolate, ruined husks of buildings lining the street like giant skeletons.  Wide claw marks have been gouged into the scattered remains, further shredding the weather-damaged wood.  Massive wooden beams brace a wide barricade to the south."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":370,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":311,"exit":"climb","move":"climb barricade"}],"aliases":["Celps"]},
  {"id":369,"x":-162,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["The road ambles north and south, but a small alley leads west between two crumbling houses.  Broken glass and chunks of worked stone litter the street, surrounding an upturned granite bench in the middle of the road.  A wide smear of dried blood leads from the bench, into the alley, and out of sight."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":368,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":370,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":370,"x":-172,"y":261,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["A large house has collapsed into the street, blocking most of the intersection.  A large skeleton, its huge skull bleached white against the darker wood, lies crushed under one particularly large beam.  The rough ground around the skeleton is scarred deeply, as if scraped by large claws."],"exits":[{"to":371,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":369,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":368,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":371,"x":-172,"y":251,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["Broken cobbles make up the road that surrounds a wide stone fountain.  Rubble lines the bottom edge of the dried-up reservoir, fallen from the exposed lip.  A large plaza, seemingly untouched by the weather, spreads out to the west, and collapsed in one of its corners is the wooden skeleton of a merchant's cart."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":370,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":374,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":-162,"y":251,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["To the east of the street, a small house lies in abject decay.  The face of the structure seems mostly secure and its door and small window still seem functional despite apparent abuse.  Near the roof, the southern wall has been destroyed, revealing another possible entrance to the house's loft.  A dried stone fountain rests in the plaza to the northwest, while the road continues north and west around it."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":369,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":371,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":377,"exit":"go","move":"go decaying house"},{"to":379,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}]},
  {"id":373,"x":-162,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["A rusted iron fence lines the northern perimeter of the street, which continues south and west.  Weeds and briars have taken over what could have once been a viewing garden just through the fence.  A dried and aging fountain dominates the plaza, a cobbled pathway leading southwest through its center."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":374,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":376,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":-182,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["The remains of tall ruined houses line the western side of the street, unable to withstand the constant ravages of the tropical weather.  Wind-worn beams lie crisscrossed amidst the wreckage, nearly obscuring a small hole underneath.  To the east, a dried-up fountain stands as a scarred memory of the former residents."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":371,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":375,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":375,"x":-192,"y":231,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["Two overgrown strips of grass line a small gravel path leading up to a stone statue resembling a muscular Human grasping a shark.  Countless bone fragments contrast sharply against the lush grass and weeds, and a scattering of humanoid skulls serve as a grim suggestion of what may have happened here.  The street continues away from the statue to the northeast and southeast."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":374,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":-182,"y":221,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ruined Neighborhood","descriptions":["An oppressive heaviness weighs on the air here.  The crumbling remains of a white gazebo lean against the rusted iron fence lining the northern side of the street.  Several pieces of the lumber have been dragged about the area, some sporting unsightly crimson blotches or smears.  One particularly long post still bears a skeletal hand loosely wrapped around its base."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":375,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":377,"x":-152,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Decaying Home","descriptions":["A row of four rusted beds lines the back of the room, each covered in a dark red crust.  Two skeletons, sprawled across the pitted frames, are covered in stained crimson sheets.  The east wall bears a faded painting of a proud knight and a small window with a broken pane peers west onto the abandoned street outside.  A shoddy ladder leads to a loft, the entrance obscured by tattered grey curtains."],"exits":[{"to":378,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":372,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":379,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":-152,"y":231,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Decaying Home","descriptions":["A thick oaken table dominates the center of this room and the skeleton of a small dog rests curled up on the middle of it.  Ash and partially burned logs lie scattered about the room but seem more concentrated in front of the open wood-burning stove sitting in a corner.  All of the cabinets have fallen off the walls, leaving shattered dishes and flatware strewn about the floor as well.  A large window looks north onto a garden overgrown with weeds."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":379,"x":-142,"y":241,"z":0,"title":"Decaying Home, Loft","descriptions":["The smell of refuse and molding linen clings to the still air in this loft.  Scattered piles of composting cloth are nested about the room, giving the impression that the space was once inhabitable.  Tattered grey curtains dangle from the west side of the ceiling, ending just above a shoddy ladder leading to the living quarters down below.  The south wall of the loft has collapsed, leaving an opening to the desolate street below.  A collection of rotting wood figurines lies jumbled in a corner."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":372,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}]},
  {"id":380,"x":-282,"y":281,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Well-Manicured Lawn","descriptions":["The darkened street surrounds this grassy area.  The flowers wait patiently in the dark for the sun's arrival, while the cool grass slowly stands up straight, preparing itself for the feet of the people who will surely be here with the sun.","Flowers line the thick, green grass.  A small opening between the flowers provides access to the lawn from the street.  A pleasant breeze stirs the flowers, while bees industriously fly from flower to flower.  The feel of the grass between one's toes brings people trickling in throughout the day."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow street"}]},
  {"id":381,"x":-22,"y":21,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["Various kinds of native and imported wood fill gaps in the lift's floor like a jester's patchwork cloak.  This single lift between the working section of Ratha and the merchant district looks to be the most used, and the least maintained."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":382,"x":38,"y":361,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Jail","descriptions":["A loose scattering of straw cannot conceal the stinking remains of rotten refuse.  By the look of the yellow substance that also stains the floor, someone was not able to handle the smell."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":383,"x":178,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Truffenyi's Green, Western Fields","descriptions":["A large common green stretches out over most of the northeastern section of the tier.  The grassy area is an excellent spot for athletic activities, for a meal on the soft grass, or contemplating the sky above.  Chadatru's temple lies to the south.  A narrow path winds under a row of pine trees on the western border of the field."],"exits":[{"to":384,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":445,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow path"}]},
  {"id":384,"x":198,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Truffenyi's Green","descriptions":["A large common green stretches out over most of the northeastern section of the tier.  The grassy area is an excellent spot for athletic activities, for a meal on the soft grass, or contemplating the sky above.  The western edge of the field backs on to the temples of Chadatru and Glythtide, and a fountain dedicated to Truffenyi stands to the east near the intersection of the eastern-most road and East Palace Drive."],"exits":[{"to":450,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":452,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":385,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":383,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Truffenyi's Green","town green","green"]},
  {"id":385,"x":198,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Palace Drive","descriptions":["In the shadow of the palace, one finds respite from the constant movement of people and horses, carriages and carts in one of many gardens and walkways in and around the various temples.","The great height of the palace looms to the west.  During the quiet of the evening hours, one can ponder the great structure in relative peace and safety."],"exits":[{"to":384,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":386,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":447,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":386,"x":278,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Palace Drive","descriptions":["Wide and expansive, this elegant drive parades west toward Regents Circle and the magnificent Ratha Palace beyond.  Down the center of the avenue, a tree-lined median channels carriage traffic east and west in an orderly flow.  All along the regal boulevard, handsome wrought-iron fencing and sculptured topiaries create a formal garden-like atmosphere, as administrators and clergy mingle with Ratha's upper class citizenry along the wide plazas on either side of the street.","Wide and expansive, this elegant drive parades west toward Regents Circle and the magnificent Ratha Palace beyond.  Down the center of the avenue, a lighted median channels carriage traffic east and west in an orderly flow."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":385,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":387,"x":298,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The road forks as it passes near the Temple district.  High walls protect the estates and offices of the tax gatherers to the south, and heavily-armed guards stalk along the walls, secure behind stone and iron.  The street itself is spotlessly clean, each scale-shaped cobble has been set with consummate skill so that the path resembles the endless coils of some enormous serpent."],"exits":[{"to":390,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":388,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":386,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":388,"x":318,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The wide roadway wends between the blessed realms of the temples and the cursed domains of the tax gatherers.  Like the proverbial rock and a hard place, one must steer a difficult course between two such powerful entities.  To the south, the great lift descends to less heady heights."],"exits":[{"to":389,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":387,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":389,"x":318,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["Golden Scale Road leads from the lifts into the elite heart of Ratha.  The road is paved with stone blocks cleverly carved to resemble large scales, carefully set with gold-tinted mortar.  The effect is one of gaudy elegance.  The motif is reflected in the massive pillars that carry the iron chains that control the great lift."],"exits":[{"to":388,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":630,"exit":"go","move":"go oak lift"}]},
  {"id":390,"x":298,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The Temples of Ratha rise on both sides of this immaculately clean roadway.  The sacred architecture of a dozen different sects and cults vie with each other in what could have been a tasteless clash but somehow has managed to blend itself into a curious harmony.  Even the varied clouds of incense that drift about manage to combine into a strangely invigorating scent."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":387,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":391,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate arch"}]},
  {"id":391,"x":318,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Hodierna, Grand Hallway","descriptions":["The high vaulted ceiling towers above, drawing your gaze upward to its gleaming apex.  The ceiling itself is made of many fragments of clear and frosted crystals that refract the light, showering the walls and marble floor with tiny rainbowed circles.  A detailed statue of a unicorn is the main centerpiece, standing gracefully in the middle of the room.  The arch leading into the main shrine is made of the finest ivory with images of Hodierna carved into it."],"exits":[{"to":394,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":393,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":392,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":390,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":395,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory arch"}]},
  {"id":392,"x":308,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Hodierna, Asketi's Chamber","descriptions":["There is very little light filtering through here.  The walls are made of alternating black and white porcelain tiles, dull and lackluster from years of neglect.  A black ebony statue stands next to the doorway, a forboding image of the goddess Asketi.  An alabaster carving of a slithering adder seems to wrap around the base of the statue and run along the length of the room."],"exits":[{"to":391,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Asketi"]},
  {"id":393,"x":328,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Hodierna, Berengaria's Bridge","descriptions":["The influence of the Pantel family is evident here.  Tapestries dedicated to Berengaria adorn each wall.  One depicts the goddess walking through a desolate field dropping seeds to the ground.  Another shows her watching over farmers as they harvest their abundant crops.  Worshippers of Berengaria have paid tribute to the goddess by offering wheat and other grains at the foot of a statue in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":391,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Berengaria"]},
  {"id":394,"x":318,"y":-469,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Hodierna, Quiet Room","descriptions":["The room is barren except for a few comfortable chairs and a lavishly upholstered divan for worshippers to rest their weary feet.  There are no windows here, but there is a soft glow coming from some small oil lamps in each corner.  A garish portrait of the Pantel family covers the entire wall above the divan.  A small group huddles in the corner, whispering and reading prayers amongst themselves."],"exits":[{"to":391,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":395,"x":318,"y":-449,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Hodierna, Holy Sanctuary","descriptions":["The main part of the temple is dedicated to the goddess herself.  Entering through the arch, the first thing your eyes rest upon is the wall directly opposite the entrance.  An awe-inspiring mural of Hodierna, made out of thousands of tiny colored tiles, covers the entire length of the sanctuary.  Each tile is carefully placed, detailing the goddess' features, giving her an almost life-like appearance.  The altar is made of a pure white marble and polished to a lustrous shine."],"exits":[{"to":391,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory arch"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-02","Hodierna"]},
  {"id":396,"x":298,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The dome of Phelim's Temple rises against the sky in a gentle curve that offsets the harshness of this rock-bound city.  The air is rich with the sea tang from far below and the sound of sonorous chanting from within the sacred precincts blends with the distant wave song of the open ocean."],"exits":[{"to":390,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":399,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":397,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"}]},
  {"id":397,"x":318,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Phelim's Temple, Exterior","descriptions":["The temple to Phelim is a domed building, made of black stone, that overlooks the eastern cliffs of the island.  The sea is visible beyond, where the horizon of ocean stretches far into the distance.  A treeless, open sky arches overhead.","The temple to Phelim is a domed building silhouetted against the night sky.  The sound of the sea beyond rumbles far below nearby cliffs, and the treeless, expansive sky floats overhead."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go domed building"}]},
  {"id":398,"x":338,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Phelim's Temple, Planetarium","descriptions":["The domed roof of the temple is closed and the constellations are projected on the ceiling and walls in a splendid display of the heavens.  The floor stones are black marble and glisten softly in the dim light, and the dark walls are cool and smooth to the touch.","The domed roof of Phelim's temple is open to the night sky with a large telescope pointed towards the heavens."],"exits":[{"to":397,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":972,"exit":"go","move":"go moongate"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["hrine4-03","Phelim","Planetarium"]},
  {"id":399,"x":258,"y":-559,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["Monks and clerics pass one another with nods or bows or barely concealed glares, depending on the relative state of relations amongst their deities and congregations.  Overhead, two grotesque gargoyles, one on each of two otherwise dissimilar buildings, seem to be glaring at each other in mimicry of the unspoken tensions below."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":451,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":400,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":400,"x":238,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["Tucked snugly in among the high and mighty temples is a quaint and curious shop, from which wafts an inviting tendril of incense that tugs at passersby.  Nearby, a lone mystic sits in a curious posture, knees intertwined with legs in what seems an uncomfortable pose.  He seems almost asleep until the twitching of one nostril, as it is tickled by the smoke emanating from the shop, shows that some attention to the mundane world exists within that ascetic shell."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":402,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":401,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":401,"x":258,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Chabalu's Exotics, Showroom","descriptions":["The shop looks to be a hodgepodge of many different cultures.  Beautiful silk tapestries cover many of the walls, at least the ones not being used to display items.  A mind-numbing sweet incense fills the air, making it seem quite natural for someone to empty their pockets of coins."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":809,"exit":"none","move":"room ask chabalu about cellar;go trap door","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Chabalu's Exotics","ring shop"]},
  {"id":402,"x":198,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["Despite the general tone of wealth shown by the nearby Temples, the facade of the Clerics' Guild is modest to the point of being shabby.  Made of humble materials in a modest state of repairs, it sits alone, taking quiet pride in the essence of those it serves rather from the transience of mundane decoration and frippery."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":411,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":403,"exit":"go","move":"go guild"}]},
  {"id":403,"x":208,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Cleric's Guild, Outer Sanctuary","descriptions":["The simple entry into the Guild is barren except for a few alcoves, each holding a lit candle.  Carved along the baked red clay walls are S'kra writings and symbols of the High Priest of Ratha.  Spidery cracks run rampant throughout the room, caused from years of neglect."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":404,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":404,"x":208,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Cleric's Guild, Inner Sanctuary","descriptions":["The inner part of the Guild is a bit more tended to than the outer entrance.  A soft snowbeast rug has been crudely stitched together and placed carefully on the floor, spanning the entire room.  Oil lamps sit on tables in each corner, giving off a warm glow in this otherwise dark and musty room.  An effort has been made to repair the ceiling and walls where water has found a way to seep in.  A broken doorway leads out to the gardens."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":405,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":409,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":405,"x":218,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Garden Retreat","descriptions":["The gardens are the most cared for part of the guild.  Gardenia bushes line the entire perimeter and are in full bloom, giving off a pungent scent that fills the air.  A stone fountain carved into the form of a S'kra Mur figure stands in the middle of the yard.  An ivy-covered lattice arch leads off towards a shrine while a small path leads off towards the guild leader's retreat.","The scent of gardenias fills the night air.  The sound of water trickling from the fountain seems magnified in the darkness.  An arch is barely discernible in the shadows caused by the lighted torches that line the path to the guild leader's retreat."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go path"},{"to":404,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":406,"x":218,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Tamsine's Shrine, Secluded Arbor","descriptions":["A quiet area is made up of hundreds of giant redwood and fir trees grouped together allowing just enough light to filter through.  The chirping of birds and a trickling stream in the distance are the only sounds that fill the air in this otherwise peaceful place.  A small covered gazebo stands at the end of the path with a small shrine dedicated to the goddess Tamsine."],"exits":[{"to":407,"exit":"go","move":"go gazebo"},{"to":405,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":407,"x":228,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Tamsine's Shrine, Inside the Gazebo","descriptions":["A soft breeze flows through the gazebo, bringing with it a fresh scent of flowers.  A long wooden bench sits in one corner, a carved statue of the Goddess Tamsine sitting upon it.  Offerings of flowers have been placed at her feet."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"}]},
  {"id":408,"x":218,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Cleric's Guild, Kor'yvyn's Retreat","descriptions":["A quiet spot off of the garden is where the guild leader Kor'yvyn likes to spend most of his time.  The ground is covered entirely in sand that feels soft against the feet.  Literally a garden of stone, there are sculpted flowers and plants, as well as a topiary of stone animals.  The guild leader himself sits on a sculpture of a majestic king cobra coiled to form a chair."],"exits":[{"to":405,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Cleric","Guildleader Kor'yvyn","Kor'yvyn"]},
  {"id":409,"x":208,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Stairwell","descriptions":["The stairwell is dark and uncared for.  Some of the steps leading down to the first floor are in such disrepair, one has to skip them to avoid tripping or falling through.  A small window that overlooks the gardens provides some light in this otherwise dank stairwell."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":404,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":410,"x":208,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, The Study","descriptions":["The room here is very tidy and well kept compared to the rest of the guild.  A soft and refreshing scent of lilacs lingers in the air.  Books and prayer books sit atop a small desk that is also adorned with holy S'kra icons.  A portrait of the High Priest hangs on the wall behind the desk, concealing cracks that have started to spread on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":409,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":411,"x":158,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The confluence of several disparate roads among the temples has been dubbed the Threefold Path by local wags.  The rich decor of the buildings and the many finely garbed holy workers reminds one that the business of serving the gods is oft a profitable endeavor.  The presence of the lavish Imperial Palm Inn also gives credence to the relative wealth of the Temples."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":412,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":498,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":636,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwork arch"}]},
  {"id":412,"x":158,"y":-559,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Eastern Promenade","descriptions":["The Oracle Veraclese's Cleric shop stands at this, the eastern end of Promenade Way.  More shops and guilds are found to the north on Three Fold Path along with an Inn which eagerly awaits the visit of folks in need of sustenance and sleep.  Journeying westward, the route borders the banking district and the Palace, and finally leads to the temple district."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":415,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":413,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate shop"}]},
  {"id":413,"x":178,"y":-559,"z":0,"title":"Oracle Veraclese, Divine Rialto","descriptions":["This quaint shop run by the Oracle Veraclese specializes in items for the holy and the devout.  Artifacts and other holy items are placed neatly on shelves made of frosted crystal.  The light filtering in through the stained glass windows refracts on the opposite wall into a spectrum of colors forming a rainbow.  A saintly looking Gor'tog woman moves about quietly, neatly stacking items on their appropriate shelves.","This quaint shop run by the Oracle Veraclese specializes in items for the holy and the devout.  Artifacts and other holy items are placed neatly on shelves made of frosted crystal.  A soft glow comes from the candles placed in alcoves on the opposite wall.  The stained glass windows look out onto the street, revealing the night sky.  A saintly looking Gor'tog woman moves about quietly, neatly stacking items onto their appropriate shelves."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Divine Rialto","Oracle Veraclese","Cleric shop"]},
  {"id":414,"x":198,"y":-559,"z":0,"title":"Divine Rialto, Odds and Ends","descriptions":["The back room of the Rialto caters to the fashion tastes of all who have money to spend.  Knick-knacks and other inexpensive items are sold here, as well as some highly fashionable vestments.  Mannequins neatly line the back wall and are adorned with fashions available for immediate purchase."],"exits":[{"to":413,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Odds and Ends"]},
  {"id":415,"x":138,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Eastern Promenade","descriptions":["Bordered by a plethora of trees and bushes, a short walkway is visible that leads to the verandah of the Empath's Guild.  Somehow the dust of the roadway disappears, giving way to a welcome and pleasant spot in which to relax surrounded by the fragrant smells of herbs and potions from both the plants themselves and from their use by the guild members within.  One can usually find a kind member of this guild here to tend to any health problems."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":429,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":416,"exit":"go","move":"go short walkway"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":8,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Verandah","descriptions":["A wide verandah with a canopy of honeysuckle and grape vines runs the full length of the building.  Colorful mosaics celebrating the healing arts cover the walls.  Above the doorway leading into the building, the greeting Welcome to the Empath Guild of Ratha is formed in blue and gold-colored tiles.","A wide verandah with a canopy of honeysuckle and grape vines runs the full length of the building.  Above the doorway leading into the building, the greeting Welcome to the Empath Guild of Ratha is formed in blue and gold-colored tiles.  Overhead, a candle-lit chandelier casts a warm, welcoming glow."],"exits":[{"to":417,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":418,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":419,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":415,"exit":"go","move":"go street"}]},
  {"id":417,"x":18,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, East Verandah","descriptions":["The sweet scent of honeysuckle fills the eastern end of the verandah.  Hummingbirds dart in and out sampling the nectar of crimson and yellow flowers growing the trellises around the outer edge.  Mounds of colorful canvas cushions have been set out as seating.  The light that filters through is barely enough to view the mosaic.","The sweet scent of flowers fills the eastern end of the verandah.  A candle-lit brass chandelier casts a warm glow illuminating the mosaic on the inner wall.  Mounds of colorful canvas cushions have been set out as seating."],"exits":[{"to":416,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":418,"x":-2,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, West Verandah","descriptions":["Lush vines laden with grapes block the sights and sounds of the street outside the guild.  Padded benches, tucked into the corners at this end of the verandah, provide comfortable seating for guild visitors.  The light that filters through is barely enough to view the mosaic.","Lush vines laden with grapes block the sights and sounds of the street outside the guild.  Padded benches, tucked into the corners at this end of the verandah, provide comfortable seating for guild visitors.  A candle-lit chandelier illuminates the room."],"exits":[{"to":416,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":419,"x":8,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Central Corridor","descriptions":["The long corridor serves as little more than a passageway to get from room to room and front to back of the guild hall.  Except for occasional scuff and gouge marks from careless visitors, the plaster walls are undecorated."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":425,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":420,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":416,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":427,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":428,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"aliases":["RS Empath"]},
  {"id":420,"x":-2,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Guild Office","descriptions":["Sketches and drawings of herbs, flowers, and arcane alchemical equipment cover the walls of the guild office.  Bundles of jadice, rosemary, and lavender hang from overhead drying racks.  Pots of yelith and miniature roses sit on a bench in front of a window overlooking the garden."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["GL Empath"]},
  {"id":421,"x":8,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Main Patio","descriptions":["The crest of the Empaths' Guild has been skillfully recreated in broken tiles to pave the patio at the back of the Guild.  Carved limestone benches interspersed with young potted palms line the rim of the circular patio.  Behind them, crimson and orange daylilies dance happily in the breeze.  To the west beyond a wrought iron gate lies the Guild Leader's herb garden."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"go","move":"go back entrance"},{"to":422,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":423,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy clearing"},{"to":424,"exit":"go","move":"go covered patio"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":-2,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Herb Garden","descriptions":["Although a few of the plants seem to be carefully pruned, most have been allowed to grow freely.  Small paths trace through the naturalized herb garden giving limited access to all the plants.  A vine covered wrought iron fence surrounds the garden.","Small paths trace through the naturalized herb garden giving limited access to all the plants.  The sweet, heady perfume of moonflowers fills the air.  Practically invisible during the day, at night they bloom a pale silvery-white on the vine-covered wrought iron fence that surrounds the garden.  In the glow from the patio and the guild house windows, only the vague shapes of the other plants can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":423,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":421,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought gate"}]},
  {"id":423,"x":8,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Grassy Clearing","descriptions":["At first glance the clearing appears to be covered with short grass, but each footstep releases citrus and pineapple scents.  Lemon thyme and low-growing chamomile have been planted along with the grass to form a slightly springy herbal carpet.  Their small yellow and white flowers are strewn among the deep green grass like stars across the sky."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":422,"exit":"go","move":"go fenced garden"},{"to":424,"exit":"go","move":"go covered patio"}]},
  {"id":424,"x":18,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Covered Patio","descriptions":["Although the framework is complete, only part of the slats for the patio cover have been installed.  At the far end of the patio, workmen have carelessly left bundles of the slats and several stacks of tiles uncovered.  A young grapevine has been staked and tied to climb one of the outer support posts.  In a few years, it may cover the patio and provide shade and shelter, but for now it looks abandoned in a forgotten corner of the guild."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":423,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy clearing"}]},
  {"id":425,"x":18,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Store Room","descriptions":["Rows of mostly barren wooden shelves fill the room, the few that are full contain empty jars and glass bottles.  Rounds of hard cheese, several braids of onions, and a string of sausages hang from ceiling hooks."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":426,"x":18,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Work Room","descriptions":["Several long work tables have been pushed against the walls to open up space in the center of the room, where a dozen or so chairs form a loose semi-circle facing the chalkboard on the outer wall.  Life-size drawings of the major races are tacked in front covering most of the chalkboard.  The remaining board space contains a list of the common body parts."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":427,"x":-2,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Library","descriptions":["Mostly empty shelves line the walls of the Empath Library, but there are multiple copies of the books that are here.  Several leather reading chairs and some over-stuffed cloth-covered chairs are scattered about the room, each placed close enough to a window or lamp to give a reader sufficient light."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":428,"x":18,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Meeting Room","descriptions":["The upper floor of the guild consists of a single large room lined with windows.  A motley collection of well-used wooden benches is scattered about the room in loose groups.  At one end, several smaller tables have been pushed together to form a large conference table.  Although painted and furnished, the room still looks vaguely unfinished."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":429,"x":118,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Eastern Promenade","descriptions":["The travel-worn road narrows, and the caravans that frequent it tangle in the crowded way.  Camels snort, donkeys bray and traders curse in the congestion as they all push for a place at the marble watering trough at the side of the road."],"exits":[{"to":415,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":444,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":442,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":430,"exit":"go","move":"go shack"},{"to":723,"exit":"go","move":"go grating","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Third Tier"]},
  {"id":430,"x":48,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Shop","descriptions":["A blast of hellish heat greets every visitor who enters the simple wooden shack, and a thin layer of greyish soot covers every surface.  The air hangs heavy with the acrid scent of melting steel.  A sweating Dwarven attendant leans against the far wall, next to a heavy leather flap through which you can hear a muffled pounding noise."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":431,"exit":"go","move":"go flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ss'ran's Forge"]},
  {"id":431,"x":48,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Lobby","descriptions":["Faint traces of ash and glinting chips of metal add their interesting character to the stonework floor.  The spartan airiness of this space almost overcomes the subtle scent of the working forge that pings and rattles at the other end of the hall, helped no doubt by a row of windows set just beneath the low ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":432,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":433,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":434,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":435,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":436,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":437,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":438,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":432,"x":58,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Grinding Area","descriptions":["Within this somewhat insulated room, the pounding noises that reverberate throughout the forge are muted, replaced by the tooth-rattling shriek of a piece of metal being scoured by one of several grindstones.  Arranged in a rough circle at the center of the room, the grindstones are attended by apprentice smiths in sooty aprons, who wander through periodically, bearing loads of heavy coal and iron."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":433,"x":58,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Grinding Area","descriptions":["Within this somewhat insulated room, the pounding noises that reverberate throughout the forge are muted, replaced by the tooth-rattling shriek of a piece of metal being scoured by one of several grindstones.  Arranged in a rough circle at the center of the room, the grindstones are attended by apprentice smiths in sooty aprons, who wander through periodically, bearing loads of heavy coal and iron."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":434,"x":58,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Grinding Area","descriptions":["Within this somewhat insulated room, the pounding noises that reverberate throughout the forge are muted, replaced by the tooth-rattling shriek of a piece of metal being scoured by one of several grindstones.  Arranged in a rough circle at the center of the room, the grindstones are attended by apprentice smiths in sooty aprons, who wander through periodically, bearing loads of heavy coal and iron."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":435,"x":48,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Hallway","descriptions":["A narrow corridor stretches off from the lobby area, along a row of tiny heat-warped stalls.  The echoing clang of metal on metal rings out from behind the curtained openings like peals of tinny thunder."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":439,"exit":"go","move":"go low opening"},{"to":440,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained opening"},{"to":441,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":436,"x":38,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["The floor slopes toward a circular firepit fed by a large pile of crushed coal.  A huge iron crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  A leather bellows lies close at hand, while stone molds of various sizes and shapes, waiting to be filled, line the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":437,"x":38,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["The floor slopes toward a circular firepit fed by a large pile of crushed coal.  A huge iron crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  A leather bellows lies close at hand, while stone molds of various sizes and shapes, waiting to be filled, line the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":438,"x":38,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Foundry","descriptions":["The floor slopes toward a circular firepit fed by a large pile of crushed coal.  A huge iron crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  A leather bellows lies close at hand, while stone molds of various sizes and shapes, waiting to be filled, line the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":439,"x":38,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Forge","descriptions":["A heavy iron anvil sits atop a piece of scorched, wet leather basking in the heat of the forge like a cat in the sun.  Black burns on the leather tell the story of many a careless moment working the forge, and bring to mind frightening pictures of what happens when clumsiness brings the hot metal in contact with flesh."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go low opening"}]},
  {"id":440,"x":58,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Forge","descriptions":["A tiny breeze carries the grey smoke out through a small opening above, cutting though the oppressive heat with a hint of the wind outside.  Despite the fresh air, the tight walls and low ceiling seem to press inward in the reddish glare from the forge that occupies one entire half of the stall, and the scent of burning metal assaults your sense of smell like acid burning into your brain."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained opening"}]},
  {"id":441,"x":48,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Ss'ran's Forge, Forge","descriptions":["Heat beats against your skin in waves, rising from a bed of white-hot coals resting in a dilapidated forge against the far wall.  The crimson glow outlines a squat iron anvil bolted to the middle of the floor against which metal is pounded and shaped."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":442,"x":58,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Eastern Promenade","descriptions":["At this crossroads, travelers can choose to enjoy the splendor of the Palace to the west and southeast, or head on through the banking district to the northeast.  Guards stand rigid at their posts guarding the Palace grounds day and night.  Government officials and financial experts make their way southeast to the Palace entrance and the tax collectors.  To the west is the beginning of the grand Processional Way and the continuation of Promenade Way with its temples and shops."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":446,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":482,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":443,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate structure"}]},
  {"id":443,"x":78,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Ssivo's Migi Shagamat","descriptions":["This ostentatiously appointed shop is swathed in rich fabric and redolent with the aroma of rare spice.  Suspended from the ceiling, extravagant draperies of heavy brocade hang in rich folds of gold-shot amethyst, amber and cinnabar, while low hassocks and divans provide seating.  Underfoot, opulent jewel-toned carpets cushion your steps.  Lamps of ornately pierced brass rest on tall stands at regular intervals about the room, their soft glow illuminating the contents of display cases and shelves."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ssivo's Migi Shagamat","origami shop"]},
  {"id":444,"x":138,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Glythtide's Shrine","descriptions":["Herbs and roses grow in a tangle along a bordering, low stone wall.  The shrine itself is built in the traditional Halfling style, as adapted to Ratha's rocky terrain.  The squat stone structure resembles a small bump of a hill, and a bright blue door leading inside stands ajar.  Three old island pines shelter and shade the shrine."],"exits":[{"to":445,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":429,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":807,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":445,"x":158,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"By Glythtide's Shrine, A Pine Path","descriptions":["Whispering boughs overhead sway softly, and dried needles underfoot rustle with each step.  The path skirts the southern side of the small building dedicated to the god Glythtide."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"rt east"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"rt northwest"}]},
  {"id":446,"x":78,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Regents Circle","descriptions":["The stately Palace Drive meets Regents Circle in a celebration of wide plazas and decadent appointments.  Tall brass standards bear baskets of hanging flowers and foliage while brass capped fences frame the perfect gardens of the palace to the west."],"exits":[{"to":447,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":448,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":442,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":447,"x":138,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Palace Drive","descriptions":["Pilgrims and clergy alike mingle along this stretch of the drive.  Temples are situated througout this section of Ratha and offer the reverent a peaceful refuge wherein to learn and worship."],"exits":[{"to":385,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":446,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":454,"exit":"go","move":"go temple courtyard"}]},
  {"id":448,"x":78,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Regents Circle","descriptions":["Imposing granite statuary can be seen all along the grand drive.  One in particular, is that of a young S'kra Mur trader.  Dressed in flowing robes and precious gems, he appears remarkably life-like, examining the crates on a waiting caravan."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":449,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":449,"x":58,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Regents Circle","descriptions":["Ornate brass standards fly colorful penants, in tribute to local heroes who have brought honor to the city and province.  Two massive S'kra guards glance about warily, alert to any sign of unwarranted entrance into the palace grounds."],"exits":[{"to":448,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":456,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":450,"x":198,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"A Pine Thicket","descriptions":["The scent of pine resin and decaying wood permeates this dark stand of trees.  The sky is completely blocked from view by the overhanging boughs, and the air is still and suffocating.  There is a sense of being watched, by something."],"exits":[{"to":451,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":384,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-01","Dark Aspects","Pine Thicket"]},
  {"id":451,"x":238,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Urrem'tier's Path, Pine Grove","descriptions":["The air is still and muggy beneath the drooping limbs of tightly meshed pine boughs.  Sounds deaden and echoes die at the approach to a shadowy doorway cut jaggedly into a jumble of black basalt boulders mounded as a solid mass as tall as the surrounding pine trees."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":450,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":664,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowy doorway"}]},
  {"id":452,"x":218,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Truffenyi's Green, Eastern Fields","descriptions":["A large common green stretches out over most of the northeastern section of the tier.  The grassy area is an excellent spot for athletic activities, for a meal on the soft grass, or contemplating the sky above.  To the southeast a large circular fountain sprays water into the air with a hiss and soft patter of falling drops."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":384,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":453,"x":238,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Truffenyi's Fountain","descriptions":["The grassy green surrounds a large, sparkling white marble fountain.  At the fountain's center is a statue of the god Truffenyi, in mortal form, rendered by the carver as a strong muscular human warrior.  The water arcs from the rim of the fountain and rains down from above on the statue which gazes patiently on the mortal world.  Within the pool of the fountain are smaller carvings of the deity's aspects, the weasel and the magpie."],"exits":[{"to":452,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Truffenyi's Fountain","shrine"]},
  {"id":454,"x":138,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Chadatru's Temple, Forecourt","descriptions":["A row of columns frames the tall, broad temple building that rises ahead.  This small courtyard consists of white pebbles, various aloe planted along the low walls, and a small altar placed against the western wall.  A fountain above the altar spills fresh water over its surface, keeping the altar glistening in the bright light.","A row of columns frames the tall, broad temple building that rises ahead.  Hundreds of burning candles rest on the low courtyard walls, illuminating this small forecourt and brightening the white pebbles underfoot.  A fountain above the altar on the western wall spills fresh water over its surface, keeping the altar glistening softly in the candle light."],"exits":[{"to":447,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go temple entrance"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-09","Chadatru"]},
  {"id":455,"x":158,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Chadatru's Temple, Great Hall","descriptions":["A smooth, red tile floor, the color of fresh blood, flows underfoot.  A hewn statue of a lion stands amidst this apparent pool of life -- or death.  The lion is carved in great detail from a creamy marble and stands over seven feet high and spans more than ten feet.  The mane is tinged with dark streaks and its eye sockets are hollow, the eyes missing.  A plaque rests in the floor at the lion's right front foot."],"exits":[{"to":454,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":456,"x":58,"y":-339,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, East Regents Circle","descriptions":["From the well kept stone of the walkways, to the ornate iron fencing surrounding the lush gardens of the palace, the atmosphere is one of utter order and beauty.  The amazing architecture of the palace itself is a joy to behold."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":457,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":457,"x":-62,"y":-339,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Monument Square","descriptions":["Ivy covered iron fencing culminates in an elaborate gate that opens up onto a wide plaza."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":458,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":460,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":458,"x":-162,"y":-339,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Regents Circle","descriptions":["Roaming vendors are often seen along the expansive drive.  Offerings such as rare teas and sugared pastries are among the delicacies enjoyed by all who stroll the luxurious circle.  Birds and other small creatures often dart among the passersby, eager to covet a treasured ort.","The vendors have gone for the evening, the circle is now quiet.  In the morning, they'll be back offering warm drinks and luscious treats to the privileged citizens who travel this route."],"exits":[{"to":459,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":457,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0080"},
  {"id":459,"x":-162,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Regents Circle","descriptions":["Ornate brass standards fly colorful banners, each a different jewel tone, and embroidered with the crest of one of Ratha's ruling families.  Two massive S'kra guards, replete in their official finery, stroll the walkway, monitoring entrance into the palace grounds.","The gardens are lit beyond the elaborate iron fencing, small brass lanterns ablaze along the pathways and courtyards.  Two massive S'kra guards, replete in their offical finery patrol the circle all through the night, monitoring entrance into the palace grounds."],"exits":[{"to":458,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":479,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":460,"x":-62,"y":-349,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Grand Approach","descriptions":["The grand avenue that leads to the Palace is set with elaborate topiaries in the shape of mythical sea-creatures and stately coral formations.  Even the path here glistens like the sea-bed.  Well-manicured lawns sweep away to right and left, surrounding the edifice with a deep green carpet."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":457,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":461,"x":-62,"y":-359,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Avenue of the Heroes","descriptions":["Two lines of statues of famous personages and mythical heroes line a wide carriageway made of crushed stone.  Each statue is twice life-size and formed with cunning skill, so that at any moment, they might step down off their pedestals and join the throngs around the palace."],"exits":[{"to":462,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":460,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":462,"x":-62,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Concourse","descriptions":["A sweeping carriage drive runs up to the very base of a magnificent stairway carved of white stone.  Day and night, grooms stand ready to assist the nobility in alighting and caring for their horses, while sullen guards stand ready to deal with anyone who causes problems."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":463,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}]},
  {"id":463,"x":-62,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Portico","descriptions":["A wide, sweeping stair of gleaming white alabaster carries the eye from the grandeur of the Palace grounds to the equally imposing portico.  Giant guards flank the doors, immobile as if cast from stone.  The portico itself spreads across the front of the palace offering cool shade from the heat of the day.  Several fountains spout from bronze grotesques set into the wall, their streams running down into stone basins where the traveler may quench a thirst or lave dusty feet."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":465,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":466,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"},{"to":462,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}]},
  {"id":464,"x":-52,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Eastern Portico","descriptions":["Gazing out across the city towards the sunrise, the eastern portico offers an inspiring view to the early risers of the town.  From time to time, services are held here to welcome the day.  A low altar with a sunrise carved into the pale yellow stone is set here for that mission."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["shrine","Berengaria"]},
  {"id":465,"x":-72,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-Sson Palace, West Portico","descriptions":["The western portico looks out across the city and ocean to the far horizon.  When the weather is right, spectacular sunsets can be watched from the comfort of stone benches conveniently placed to enhance the view."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":466,"x":-62,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Grand Foyer","descriptions":["The roof rises far overhead to disappear in a glorious chandelier made of hundreds of rows of polished crystals in the shape of fanciful sea-creatures.  The floor is a tesseract of cleverly interlocking tiles of sea-foam green stone alternating with pale alabaster shapes that together form endless rows of breaking waves.  To one side, a hallway leads to the public offices accessible to everyone."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":467,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":470,"exit":"go","move":"go hallway"},{"to":463,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"}]},
  {"id":467,"x":-72,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Public Library","descriptions":["Stained glass in the colors of the ocean is set into crescent-shaped windows high overhead.  Bright light falls on the hushed rows of shelving holding fine matching leather-bound books with embossed gold lettering on the spines.  Dark walnut tables with matching chairs provide places for readers to sit and spread out their research materials.","Hundreds of lamps and candles in bright brass candelabra illuminate stained glass windows in the colors of the ocean set into crescent-shaped windows high overhead.  Bright light falls on the hushed rows of shelving holding fine matching leather-bound books with embossed gold lettering on the spines.  Dark walnut tables with matching chairs provide places for readers to sit and spread out their research materials."],"exits":[{"to":466,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":468,"x":-52,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Provincial Bank Foyer","descriptions":["Understated elegance is the theme of this, the premier bank of the province.  Carpet thicker than the bedding in many a cheap hostel muffles every sound.  A golden light filters down from giant lamps set with stained-glass, while a gentle perfume scents the air.  Deep banquettes, upholstered in richly embroidered fabrics provide a comfortable resting place for those waiting to conduct business."],"exits":[{"to":469,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":466,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["3bank"]},
  {"id":469,"x":-42,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Grand Provincial Bank, Bursarium","descriptions":["Quiet elegance is the theme here, that and the sort of luxury only huge piles of money can buy.  Thick carpet, rare fireflame-patterned silverwood paneling, polished stone counters and trim emphasize the common theme of material wealth and lots of it.  Elegantly liveried tellers quietly handle each transaction with a minimum of fuss and delay."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":808,"exit":"go","move":"go vault"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Grand Provincial Bank","Bursarium","3Teller"]},
  {"id":470,"x":-22,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Public Hallway","descriptions":["Stark white walls and plain grey stone leech all feelings of warmth from the hallway.  Unlike the grand ceremonial parts of the palace, this area is purely functional with no accommodation made for luxuries for the citizenry who must attend to legal matters here.  Offices extend along the hall and are open to assist even those who keep late hours."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":466,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":472,"exit":"go","move":"go collection office"},{"to":476,"exit":"go","move":"go registration office"}]},
  {"id":471,"x":-22,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Public Hallway","descriptions":["The plain but serviceable decor extends along this part of the hallway with not so much as a picture on the wall to distract busy citizens as they go about their day.  A hastily thrown-up barrier prevents further travel down the hall to the south, but the offices all seem open for business."],"exits":[{"to":470,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":477,"exit":"go","move":"go genealogy office"},{"to":478,"exit":"go","move":"go records office"}]},
  {"id":472,"x":-12,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Debtor's Hall","descriptions":["There is a sense of repressed tension and anxiety in the air.  For all the rich decor, this room seems cold and spare.  A few people huddle along a hard narrow bench along the far wall.  A circular counter surrounds several bored-looking clerks who seem to be engaged in almost any activity other than helping those pathetic few who approach them from time to time."],"exits":[{"to":470,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go hallway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Debtor's Hall"]},
  {"id":473,"x":-2,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Narrow Corridor","descriptions":["Stark white walls and dull grey stone floor tiles suck any vestige of warmth from the very air.  Grim-faced folk pass by in both directions, and from behind heavily barred doors comes the sound of clinking coins and the scratching sound of quill on parchment with the staccato clicking of an abacus adding a disjointed rhythm to the sounds, not unlike dry bones clacking in some bizarre parody of a dance."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":474,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":474,"x":-2,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Anteroom","descriptions":["This is quite obviously a waiting room for some high-ranked official's office.  Dark wood paneling covers the the thick stone walls and the furniture, though sparse, is of heavy construction.  A door set with brass studs leads into the inner sanctum while an iron-bound door that would do credit to a bank leads to the hallway outside."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"go","move":"go brass door"},{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-bound door"}]},
  {"id":475,"x":-2,"y":-409,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Office of the Exchequer","descriptions":["Two features dominate the room: a massive safe big enough to hold a Gor'Tog and a desk easily large enough to serve as a small cottage for a pair of Halflings.  The windowless room's only decor is a pair of silk hangings that depict banking scenes."],"exits":[{"to":474,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":476,"x":-22,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Office of Citizenry, Registration","descriptions":["An air of anticipation runs through this room as people shuffle their papers and tiredly smile to one another, a nice change from the cold reception outside these doors.  A yawning clerk slowly waves everyone to the small, comfortable-looking couches lining the walls.  Several sleepy patrons lounge about, nodding off from time to time as they wait their turn."],"exits":[{"to":470,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":477,"x":-22,"y":-409,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Genealogy Office","descriptions":["Sectioning off the room is a long counter, creating a secure space for the elderly clerk whose slow movements have been known to anger citizens in a hurry to get on their way.  Mixing with the smell of old parchment is a lingering scent of stale tobacco coming from the direction of a cluttered, heavy desk tucked safely behind the barrier.  Hung above a wooden bench in the waiting area is a painted sign, lending low budget decoration to the plastered walls."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":478,"x":-12,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Registry Records Office","descriptions":["Not much bigger than a closet, this stark white office is dominated by a government issued desk that is covered in neatly stacked papers.  Secure filing cabinets line the back wall, leaving just enough room for the clerk on duty to move between them.  The cramped waiting area intentionally lacks furniture, encouraging citizens to take care of business as quickly as possible and be on their way."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":479,"x":-182,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Regents Circle","descriptions":["Imposing granite statuary casts eerie shadows along the grand drive.  The exquisite details so pronounced in the daylight are lost, as the inanimate sentinels loom larger than life in the half light."],"exits":[{"to":480,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":459,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":480,"x":-182,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Regents Circle","descriptions":["Handsome brick walkways round the corner from the spaciousness of Palace Drive to the formality of Regents Circle.  Ornately wrought, iron balustrades are capped with gleaming brass and circumscribe the vast gardens that surround the palace.  Perfectly matched and richly appointed, the accoutrements of the palace guards are no less formal, lending a sense of impending royalty to the area."],"exits":[{"to":481,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":479,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":519,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":481,"x":-162,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Western Promenade","descriptions":["At this juncture, a traveler can choose to enjoy the splendor of the Palace to the southeast, or head on through the temple district to the northwest.  Guards stand rigid at their posts guarding the Palace grounds day and night.  Government officials make their way down to Regents Circle and the entrance to the Palace.  To the east is the beginning of the grand Processional Way and the continuation of Promenade Way with its guilds and shops."],"exits":[{"to":482,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":480,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":512,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":482,"x":-62,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["The south end of the great Processional opens onto the Palace grounds where the trees spread their branches as if in greeting.  They beckon one to take the pleasant stroll northward to the Great Waymeet and Angels Flights.  Several stores and guilds can be found down the Promenade to the east.  The west path leads off towards the temple grounds."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":442,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":481,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go paladins' guild"}]},
  {"id":483,"x":-62,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Foyer","descriptions":["The bright and airy Guild foyer is beautifully accented with plants and mosaic tilework.  The floor is dominated by a large woven rug placed directly beneath a domed skylight.  Wide marble steps allow access to the second story and a small archway leads to the guildleader's office.","The bright and airy Guild foyer is beautifully accented with plants and mosaic tilework.  Several burning torches placed in wall sconces fill the room with a warm glow.  The floor is dominated by a large woven rug placed directly beneath a domed skylight.  Wide marble steps allow access to the second story and a small archway leads to the guildleader's office."],"exits":[{"to":482,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":484,"exit":"go","move":"go small archway"},{"to":485,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"},{"to":488,"exit":"go","move":"go marble archway"}]},
  {"id":484,"x":-62,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Eamonn's Office","descriptions":["A black marble desk flanked by two large platinum braziers sits directly in front of a large open window that overlooks the city.  The vaulted four-paneled ceiling is decorated with beautiful images and deep green ivy overflows from gold-leaf planters in the corners of the room and winds its way up the adjacent marble columns.","A black marble desk, flanked by two brightly burning platinum braziers, sits directly in front of a large open window that overlooks the city.  The vaulted four-paneled ceiling is decorated with beautiful images and deep green ivy overflows from gold-leaf planters in the corners of the room and winds its way up the adjacent marble columns."],"exits":[{"to":483,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Paladin","Guildleader Eamonn","Eamonn","RS Paladin"]},
  {"id":485,"x":-52,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["The landing provides access to the second floor rooms of the guild, as well as to the Grand Hall, via a circular staircase.  A heavy bronze bound door leads to the Library, as indicated by the large word LIBRARY engraved on the bronze plate that has been mounted next to it."],"exits":[{"to":486,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"}]},
  {"id":486,"x":-52,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Grand Hall of Light","descriptions":["Crowning the guild, this magnificent chamber of great breadth and height is filled with hundreds of brightly blazing candles and torches, flooding the room with light.  This light shines through the glass windows which comprise the walls of this room, illuminating the guild throughout the entire city.  White stone floors are dotted with various skin throws and accented with gold inlay around the edges.  In the center of the room, a large round table is surrounded by several chairs and benches."],"exits":[{"to":487,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":485,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":487,"x":-52,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Observation Deck","descriptions":["Surrounded by a heavy stone balustrade, the tower commands a three hundred sixty degree view of Ratha and the sparkling sea beyond. A brass standard, supporting an ancient spyglass is mounted on a raised pedestal in the center of the floor."],"exits":[{"to":486,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":488,"x":-72,"y":-429,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Emporium","descriptions":["The smell of recently polished metal pervades the room.  Along the painted walls are decorative shields and crests of various sizes and colors.  A large granite counter sits in the middle of the room with hinged wood partitions on both sides."],"exits":[{"to":489,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":489,"x":-72,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Storage Room","descriptions":["At the bottom of the stone steps is a poorly lit narrow room filled with large wooden crates and boxes.  Packing paper and straw are strewn haphazardly on the floor that is in dire need of sweeping.  Hanging in the far corner of the room is a large lantern, lighting up a makeshift table that is covered with a variety of exotic wares."],"exits":[{"to":488,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}]},
  {"id":490,"x":-62,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["Onlookers from all over the realms gather here to enjoy the spectacle of the Palace as well as all the official activities taking place around the Palace itself.  Even the trees seem to stand at attention, creating the atmosphere of great decorum.  Most people rarely speak over a whisper here so as not to disturb the natural beauty and awesome ambiance of this glorious setting."],"exits":[{"to":491,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":482,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":491,"x":-62,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["During state events, this halfway point down the Processional is the perfect location from which to view the dignitaries and their entourages as they proceed grandly down the boulevard anticipating the great events to follow.  The elegant temple gardens are visible through the ivy covered fence to the west."],"exits":[{"to":492,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":490,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":581,"exit":"go","move":"go malk'smo office"}]},
  {"id":492,"x":-62,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["This is a perfect place to sit and savor the grand splendor of this great processional.  Several benches, surrounded by small, delicate rose bushes giving off a heady, almost heavenly scent, abut the back fences of the temple grounds to the west and the bank to the east."],"exits":[{"to":493,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":491,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":493,"x":-62,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["The wide boulevard is impeccably maintained with clean, almost white cobblestones, bordered on each side with grassy walkways creating the feel of a small park.  Nestled between the ivy covered fences lies a small white house."],"exits":[{"to":494,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":492,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":580,"exit":"go","move":"go white house"}]},
  {"id":494,"x":-62,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Processional Way","descriptions":["The soft sounds of water from the fountain to the north create a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere as you saunter down this grand boulevard.  Lovely trees line the street almost creating an arch overhead and providing shelter from the elements, allowing a pleasant stroll at any hour of the day or night."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":493,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":495,"x":-62,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, The Great Waymeet","descriptions":["Many roads converge here, north of Processional Way, the great route leading to the palace.  A large fountain rises at the center of the roads, and it serves as a gathering spot for all classes and races, a place where one can pause and enjoy the calming sounds of flowing waters and enjoy the marvelous aspect of the grand palace to the south."],"exits":[{"to":510,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":496,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":494,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":518,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":511,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":496,"x":-2,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The road passes along the heavy, almost stolid flank of one of the city's many banks.  High leaded windows, set with stout bars, show glimpses of an elegant ceiling within.  City guards keep careful watch on the premises night and day."],"exits":[{"to":497,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":495,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":497,"x":58,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The stately entrance to the Imperial Palm Inn graces this stretch of roadway.  Pink stone walls surround this haven of charm and taste, frequented by the better classes of Rathan society as well as the discerning traveler with the coins to match his taste."],"exits":[{"to":499,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":498,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":496,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":634,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwork arch"}]},
  {"id":498,"x":138,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Golden Scale Road","descriptions":["The tall, cool walls of the Imperial Palm Inn rise along the north side of the road.  Yards of shell-pink plaster cover the cold stone behind which twin towers, tiled in dark red, rise above the other lower buildings."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":497,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":499,"x":158,"y":-759,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater District","descriptions":["The red brick street runs eastward towards the prosperous theater which is one of the favorite entertainments of Ratha's upper class.  Colorful lamps, strung from pole to pole and kept burning around the clock, line the road."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":497,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":564,"exit":"go","move":"go jewelry shop"}]},
  {"id":500,"x":198,"y":-759,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater District","descriptions":["Made of bleached granite, the Hotagi'rath theater is a renovated temple of sweeping arches and architectural flair.  Colorful pennants hang from every available outcrop on the building."],"exits":[{"to":503,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":501,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":499,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":565,"exit":"go","move":"go granite building"},{"to":576,"exit":"go","move":"go small workshop"}]},
  {"id":501,"x":218,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater District","descriptions":["A large drainpipe, running up the side of the theater, connects to the roof's gutters.  The pipes empty out into mildew stained rain barrels that are placed conveniently beneath."],"exits":[{"to":502,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":500,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":579,"exit":"climb","move":"climb drainpipe"}]},
  {"id":502,"x":238,"y":-759,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater District","descriptions":["The back of the theater looks to be in need of a bit of upkeep, with the bleached granite fading to its natural grey in many places.  The street is cluttered with debris.  Torn remnants of pennants, defaced by both the weather and vandals, hang on the building in need of replacement."],"exits":[{"to":501,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":503,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":504,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow alley"}]},
  {"id":503,"x":218,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater District","descriptions":["The brick street circles around the side of the Hotagi'rath theater.  Flower beds skirt the building, with a blaze of color and scents.  Benches amidst the small gardens provide a peaceful place to rest and contemplate."],"exits":[{"to":502,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":500,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":504,"x":258,"y":-759,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley","descriptions":["Littered with the forgotten remanent of former treasures, this brick pathway winds past some of the more fashionable parts of town.  Light flickers from lanterns above unmarked doorways as it battles against the darkness that forces it to remain a mere pool of warmth at the doorsteps.  Ominous shadows seem to lurk within every nook from the depth of the cold night."],"exits":[{"to":505,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":502,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":505,"x":258,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley","descriptions":["The sounds of the city are muffled from the high walls that parallel the alleyway.  A sense of movement and soft whispers are imagined from deep within the dark shadows.  Warm light from the windows above fail to win over the powers of the night to illuminate the alley."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":506,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":506,"x":258,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley","descriptions":["Weak pale blades of grass and weeds fight to break through portions of the red brick that have become cracked and broken along the alley's path.  Formerly a soft pink color, the granite walls have become faded to a grayish-pink from rain and lack of care."],"exits":[{"to":505,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":507,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":638,"exit":"go","move":"go back door"}]},
  {"id":507,"x":278,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley","descriptions":["The walls close in upon the alley rendering dark foreboding shadows even at the peak of the day.  Empty barrels and crates choke the passage to a mere trail through a forest of debris and refuse.   A small pool of muddy and scum covered water has become the final resting spot for the drainage of a broken gutter above.  Slow thick concentric ripples slowly radiate outward from the center of the pond with each drip of water."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":506,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":508,"x":298,"y":-679,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Narrow Alley","descriptions":["Years of neglect have rended this former bricked alley to a rutted dirt path with scattered embedded shards of broken brick.  Stacks of broken crates lean precariously against a rain streaked granite wall.  A couple of cracked stone steps lead down to a shadowed alcove."],"exits":[{"to":507,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":509,"exit":"go","move":"go stone steps"},{"to":880,"exit":"go","move":"go slouchy lean-to"}]},
  {"id":509,"x":315,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Narrow Alley, Alcove","descriptions":["An unmarked door is set within this dark alcove along the grey granite wall.  To the left of the door, a small dingy window hints of a brightly colored curtain on the inside.   A set of stone steps lead back up to the alley."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"go","move":"go stone steps"}]},
  {"id":510,"x":-42,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Angels' Flight","descriptions":["A silver-trimmed lift carries its loads with quiet elegance.  Even the chains have been tinted a silver color in keeping with the many elegant personages who choose to ride it."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":633,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-edged lift"}]},
  {"id":511,"x":-82,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Angels' Flight","descriptions":["A gold-trimmed lift carries its loads with quiet elegance.  Even the chains have been tinted a gold color in keeping with the high-ranking passengers who ride it."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":632,"exit":"go","move":"go gold-trimmed lift"}]},
  {"id":512,"x":-187,"y":-484,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Western Promenade","descriptions":["Travelers move quickly along the weathered cobblestone road which bridges the palace district and the temple district.  The lush greenery and trees found to the north and east fall back to a more open-air route of grass and small bushes.  An occasional glimpse of the elegant temple gardens to the north is possible through the ivy covered fences.  A large, ornate ironwork facade decorated with the image of a panther marks the entrance to Damaris' Temple."],"exits":[{"to":481,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":513,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":557,"exit":"go","move":"go temple"}]},
  {"id":513,"x":-202,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Western Promenade","descriptions":["A favorite place for the clergy to gather, this section of the Promenade widens on the north side where it encroaches onto the temple grounds and provides a beautiful garden setting to sit and relax along one's journey, or to just find some quiet place for personal meditation.  Several small statues of local deities line the fence as if to bless those who pass."],"exits":[{"to":512,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":514,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":514,"x":-242,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Western Promenade","descriptions":["Promenade Way opens to the east where it skirts the southern border of the Temple district and provides easy access for commoners, the elite and the clergy.  Well traveled by foot, as well as caravan, the cobblestone street is replete with ruts and holes desperately in need of repair.  The grass along the fenced edges, however, is well maintained and allows for easy foot access to the temple grounds to the east and north."],"exits":[{"to":515,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":513,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":515,"x":-242,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greensward Lane","descriptions":["A small, red tile-roofed shop sits deep within the shadows of a nearby grove of small trees.  A curious air pervades the tiny store, as if there were unseen comings and goings on some higher plane than normal senses could perceive.","A miniscule red tile-roofed shop sits alongside a small patch of greenery in this stone-bound city.  A curious sense of withdrawal surrounds the otherwise mundane little building, as if it were somehow removed from the ordinary world about it."],"exits":[{"to":516,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":514,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":530,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":559,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":516,"x":-222,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greensward Lane","descriptions":["A few straggly patches of grass seem to be the only reason for the somewhat pompous name given to this patch of road.  Rough gravel strangles the grass and what little grows here is scraggly and drear.  Somewhere though, the cheerful sound of birdsong resonates and there is just the faintest whiff of true greenery."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":515,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":517,"x":-162,"y":-679,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Z'hutoya Way","descriptions":["Fluted stone towers rise towards the heavens, their surfaces engraved with images of twining snakes.  On the northern side of the street, a large wooden gate is bracketed by two defensive towers.  Engraved on the gate is the crest of the Warrior Mage Guild."],"exits":[{"to":518,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":516,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":560,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":518,"x":-122,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Bitter Angle Road","descriptions":["Tucked between the pretentious facade of the Warrior Mage Guild and the great Waymeet, this tiny angle of road holds little charm.  Throngs of people hurry this way and that, regardless of the hour, ready to trample the idler.  Meanwhile, horse- and mule-borne cargoes stand poised to crush the less agile or those who may take a moment to pause and observe the rush of daily life."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":517,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":519,"x":-222,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Palace Drive","descriptions":["The drive is hushed now, as the business of the day is left behind in exchange for the peace of the evening hours.  Pilgrims are often seen huddled in groups just off the drive, silent and seeking warmth as they wait for the dawn of a new day and the missions they've come to complete.","In hushed reverence, pilgrims make their way down the beautiful avenue toward temples and shrines to their various deities.  Here to repent for sins untold, or seek the teaching of a great master, they come from all corners of Elanthia.  Just ahead, the great palace towers above Regents Circle and the lush gardens beyond."],"exits":[{"to":480,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":520,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":520,"x":-242,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Palace Drive","descriptions":["Great iron poles line the drive on either side, supporting brightly glowing lanterns.  The stately carriages and regal equines that traverse the drive during the day are now tucked safely into their stalls as even Ratha's royalty sleeps the night away.","Great iron poles line the drive on either side, supporting colorful banners with royal insignias and coats of arms that wave in the constant breeze.  Great stately carriages, pulled by perfectly matched equines, regularly make their way to and from the palace.  Through the fencing, children peer expectantly, waiting for a glimpse of some visiting dignitary or member of Ratha's ruling class."],"exits":[{"to":519,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":521,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":521,"x":-302,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, West Palace Drive","descriptions":["Wide and expansive, this elegant drive parades east toward Regents Circle and the magnificent Ratha Palace beyond.  Down the center of the avenue, a lantern lined median channels carriage traffic east and west in an orderly flow.  All along the regal boulevard, handsome wrought-iron fencing and sculptured topiaries create a formal garden-like atmosphere, as administrators and clergy mingle with Ratha's upper class citizenry along the wide plazas on either side of the street.","Wide and expansive, this elegant drive parades east toward Regents Circle and the magnificent Ratha Palace beyond.  Down the center of the avenue, a tree lined median channels carriage traffic east and west in an orderly flow.  All along the regal boulevard, handsome wrought-iron fencing and sculptured topiaries create a formal garden-like atmosphere, as administrators and clergy mingle with Ratha's upper class citizenry along the wide plazas on either side of the street."],"exits":[{"to":522,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":520,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":523,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":522,"x":-302,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Everild's Temple, Outside","descriptions":["A simple building is designated as the temple to Everild by the threshold stone at the entrance.  Two carvings stand guard at the doorway, one of a centaur, the other of a wolverine."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":555,"exit":"go","move":"go temple"}]},
  {"id":523,"x":-322,"y":-419,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Oakbow Road","descriptions":["Temples to the gods meet temples to paperwork where the districts of each coalesce.  Three roads converge in a small crossing among the stone and wooden buildings.  Far off, the sound of the sea echoes dimly and the bell of some ship rings faintly as it rocks at anchor.","Temples to the gods meet temples to paperwork where the districts of each coalesce.  Three roads converge in a small crossing among the stone and wooden buildings.  To one side, an enterprising scribe has set a portable desk where she sits cross-legged, writing letters and drawing up contracts and various papers for those who have such need."],"exits":[{"to":526,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":521,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":524,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":524,"x":-342,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Oakbow Road","descriptions":["Government offices rise cheek by jowl, poking out above the road as their teetering upper stories lean toward each other for mutual support.  Somewhere nearby can be heard the heavy clanking of lift chains as uniformed couriers race by, each carrying some tiny bit of paper to add the ever-growing piles needed by any bureaucracy."],"exits":[{"to":523,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":525,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":525,"x":-342,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Oakbow Road","descriptions":["The great oaken lift wends its way up and down, hauling people and cargo all the hours of the day and night.  Being closest to the government quarter, all manner of petty officials, couriers, hangers-on and an endless stream of petitioners make their way here, each wrapped in his or her concerns and heedless of the bustle all about."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":629,"exit":"go","move":"go oak lift"}]},
  {"id":526,"x":-322,"y":-439,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Guardian Naga Way","descriptions":["A narrow alley runs among the temples, providing service access for deliveries and such.  Even the gods need their trash hauled, it would seem.  Rats and such skitter amongst small piles of debris while rag-clad scavengers of the two-legged sort pick over scraps of food and stubs of candles that can be resold in the lower tiers."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":523,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":527,"x":-322,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Guardian Naga Way","descriptions":["A small patch of open land among the drab backsides of nearby buildings offers a welcome bit of space.  A few straggly plants have found a way through the hard-packed, rocky soil, their tattered leaves making curious shadows against the darker background.","A small patch of open space among the drab backsides of nearby buildings offers a welcome bit of sun.  A few straggly plants have forced their way through the hard-packed, rocky soil and several bear oddly bright flowers among the grey stone and drab earth."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":526,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":531,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":528,"x":-302,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Guardian Naga Way","descriptions":["A rare bit of open land among the crowded tiers, this patch of sandy soil has been taken over by someone trying to grow herbs and such.  The ground is hard and rocky, the crop sparse and the return poor.  However, for some it may mean the difference between poverty and starvation on the one hand, and survival on the other."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":527,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":548,"exit":"go","move":"go sandy path"}]},
  {"id":529,"x":-282,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Guardian Naga Way","descriptions":["A few torches glimmer from a small park nearby.  The scent of growing foliage is rich in the moist sea air, a welcome change from the dusty air in the more crowded sections of town.","The path winds across a sandy patch of space past a startlingly green oasis in this rocky city.  A few people stroll about, enjoying the breeze and the scent of the nearby greenery."],"exits":[{"to":530,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":528,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":530,"x":-262,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Greensward Lane","descriptions":["From a small garden surrounding a curiously-shaped building comes the muted song of many birds.  A pleasant change from the omnipresent cry of gulls, it has a strangely soothing effect.  Cares and troubles seem to fade and a warm sense of security and warmth pervades the air."],"exits":[{"to":515,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":538,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":529,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":531,"x":-342,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"A Winding Path","descriptions":["A narrow path begins a winding descent from the streets down the western cliffs of the city.  Saltbrush and stiff grasses block the view to the south and the climb down takes some careful foot-placing.  The main avenues of the city lie further to the east."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":532,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":532,"x":-362,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"A Winding Path","descriptions":["Below a steep section of the cliff, the path winds around some large bushes that glisten palely with white salt crystals on their thick leaves.  The city lies upwards over the cliff rocks, which rain a splattering of loose gravel with every movement over them."],"exits":[{"to":533,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":531,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":533,"x":-372,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"A Winding Path","descriptions":["A slick, steep incline of shale is slippery with sand that has blown across the path, though a break of bushes gives some handholds for steadying.  A clatter of rocks from above frightens a rabbit hiding beneath the brush."],"exits":[{"to":532,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":534,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":534,"x":-372,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Approach","descriptions":["A tall, dark wooden building lies ahead through an avenue of cedars.  The approach is a mown grassy field bordered with white Ratha cliff thistles.  The wind blows through the trees, creating a rush of soft sound."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":533,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":535,"x":-372,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, North Entrance","descriptions":["A six-tiered temple, still under construction, faces the bay to the south.  Made of wood, instead of stone, it resembles a large sailing ship, with its wooden timbers and tall crow's nest perched high above.  Each dormer of the roof holds a carved wooden raven, wings outspread, that appears to both guard the entrances and to catch the ocean winds and nearly bear the whole structure aloft.  The flag of the Nadamian family flaps briskly from the the highest mast."],"exits":[{"to":534,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":536,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":537,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":543,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"}]},
  {"id":536,"x":-362,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, East Entrance","descriptions":["A six-tiered temple, still under construction, faces the bay to the south.  Made of wood, instead of stone, it resembles a large sailing ship, with its wooden timbers and tall crow's nest perched high above.  Each dormer of the roof holds a carved wooden raven, wings outspread, that appears to both guard the entrances and to catch the ocean winds and nearly bear the whole structure aloft.  The flag of the Nadamian family flaps briskly from the the highest mast."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":545,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"}]},
  {"id":537,"x":-382,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, West Entrance","descriptions":["A six-tiered temple, still under construction, faces the bay to the south.  Made of wood, instead of stone, it resembles a large sailing ship, with its wooden timbers and tall crow's nest perched high above.  Each dormer of the roof holds a carved wooden raven, wings outspread, that appears to both guard the entrances and to catch the ocean winds and nearly bear the whole structure aloft.  The flag of the Nadamian family flaps briskly from the the highest mast."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":541,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"}]},
  {"id":538,"x":-262,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Faenella's Shrine, A Small Park","descriptions":["A wooded area shielded by a hedge of firethorn shrubs surrounds a tall barrel-shaped building.  A bench huddles beneath a low bough of a small tree heavily laden with bright red berries.  Many different kinds of songbirds flutter through the dense shrubs, snatching from the tree's feast."],"exits":[{"to":530,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"},{"to":539,"exit":"go","move":"go round building"},{"to":530,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":539,"x":-262,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Faenella's Temple, Sanctum","descriptions":["Smooth, dark wooden walls curve around this tall narrow room.  The only window is a skylight above a pale statue of Faenella, sculpted kneeling before a basin of water placed in the center of the space.  One half of the room is strung with golden wires that run from the floor to the ceiling, and sound in the chamber vibrates them to a pleasing tone.","Smooth, dark wooden walls curve around this tall narrow room.  A skylight from above brightens the pale statue of Faenella kneeling before a basin of water placed in the center of the space.  One half of the room is strung with golden wires that run from the floor to ceiling, and sound in the chamber vibrates them to a pleasing tone."],"exits":[{"to":540,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":538,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-05","Faenella"]},
  {"id":540,"x":-282,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Faenella's Temple, Priest's Quarters","descriptions":["This cluttered room is filled with rolls of sheet music and instruments.  A S'Kra Mur priest, his black scales painted with silver wrens, sits beside a large harp, humming a hymn to his goddess."],"exits":[{"to":539,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Priest's Quarters","Charisma training"]},
  {"id":541,"x":-382,"y":-489,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, West Transept","descriptions":["The ceiling of the west transept is painted with the image of a young Dwarf holding a mining hammer and discovering a large vein of silver ore.  A silver-plated door leads out of the temple.  Lanterns of polished silver hang from the walls which are painted with other scenes from the long life of Tarteran Nadamian."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":537,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":542,"x":-372,"y":-489,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Center","descriptions":["The center of the temple allows a good view of the galleries above and the timbered ceiling.  Painters have not completed the ceiling artwork, but the basic outlines of a large raven in flight is roughly painted in."],"exits":[{"to":543,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":545,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":544,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":541,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":543,"x":-372,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Interior","descriptions":["Here at the northern end of the temple, an aisle stretches forward to the altar at the south.  Every inch of the wooden walls is covered with painted images of the history of the island and the various representations of the aspects of the gods in their role in the universe.  Wooden columns support narrow galleries above and clerestory windows of leaded glass reflect candle light to a frosty white.","Here at the northern end of the temple, an aisle stretches forward to the altar at the south.  Every inch of the wooden walls is covered with painted images of the history of the island and the various representations of the aspects of the gods in their role in the universe.  Wooden columns support narrow galleries above and clerestory windows of leaded glass filter light to flood the temple."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":535,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":544,"x":-372,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Apse","descriptions":["Although there are no pews for worshippers to rest on, here at the front of the temple are several long wooden benches.  A curved railing shaped much like the bow of a ship encloses the altar, protecting and framing it splendidly."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-10","Kertigen"]},
  {"id":545,"x":-362,"y":-489,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, East Transept","descriptions":["The ceiling of the east transept is painted with an eternal battle.  A small welkin, the symbol of Divyaush struggles with a raving raccoon, the manisfestation of Zachriedek.  A stormy sea scene frames their conflict, as waves of foam-crested spume fling up the walls toward the supporting ceiling beams."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":536,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":546,"x":-372,"y":-469,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Winding Stair","descriptions":["Filigree iron stairs spiral around a large wooden pole reminsicent of a ship's mast.  A polished deobar railing is carved with images of ravens and raccoons which intertwine around anchors, mining picks and the crest of the Nadamian family.  Dark aged oak carved into the shape of a leaping welkin forms the newel post to anchor the railing to the steps at the bottom and top of each section."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":544,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":547,"x":-372,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Temple, Meditation Chamber","descriptions":["The pinpoint brilliance of a candle flame is the only light within the chamber.  Rustling movements and whispered chants are the only sounds to fill the blackness.  A flight of wooden steps leads to the main section of temple above."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Discipline"]},
  {"id":548,"x":-322,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"A Sandy Pathway","descriptions":["This pathway leads off towards the western cliffs and the sea beyond, and back towards the main streets of the city.  Sandlilies line the trail, their deep blue blossoms waving in the fresh sea air.  A gull cries in the distance, and the wind puffs in drafts blowing the sand in little clouds."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":549,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":549,"x":-342,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Pathway","descriptions":["The path ends at a low building made of sandstone bricks, and the cliffs behind it fall off to the western sea below.  The temple's gently-sloping roof is made of slate tiles arranged in a fish-scale pattern.  A triangular-arched doorway, just tall enough for the tallest mortal to enter is capped with a splendid carving of a life-sized albatross.   Steps inside the doorway lead down into a cool, dark passageway."],"exits":[{"to":548,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":550,"exit":"go","move":"go small hut"},{"to":551,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":550,"x":-302,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Fish Seller's Hut, Interior","descriptions":["The small hut smells overwhelmingly of fish.  Stinks might even be a better description.  A young lean S'Kra Mur fellow leans against a large barrel full of water and small silvery fish."],"exits":[{"to":549,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Fish Seller's Hut"]},
  {"id":551,"x":-362,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Entry Hall","descriptions":["The limestone floor, inset with various shells to create a mosaic border with images of cresting waves and swirling currents, is an unusual feature of this entry hall.  The walls are painted with elaborate murals of the sea, each a vision of a calm, clear ocean.  Nothing suggestive of disaster or misfortune exists here."],"exits":[{"to":552,"exit":"go","move":"go shell-lined archway"},{"to":549,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}],"aliases":["Eluned's Temple"]},
  {"id":552,"x":-362,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Devotion Pool","descriptions":["The main portion of the temple is a large pool surrounded by a border of smooth raked sand.  On the western wall, a waterfall tumbles merrily into the pool and splashes clear water that foams and froths gently on the surface."],"exits":[{"to":551,"exit":"go","move":"go shell-lined archway"},{"to":553,"exit":"go","move":"go pool"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Eluned","shrine"]},
  {"id":553,"x":-372,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Pool","descriptions":["The water is cold and salty, and deep.  The waterfall gently froths the water and lulls with a rhythmic splashing sound."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":552,"exit":"climb","move":"climb edge"}]},
  {"id":554,"x":-372,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Pool","descriptions":["Some light filters down from above, but beneath the water looks dark and deep.  What may lurk there is anyone's guess."],"exits":[{"to":553,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"},{"to":627,"exit":"down","move":"swim down"}],"color":"#0080FF"},
  {"id":555,"x":-302,"y":-469,"z":0,"title":"Everild's Temple, Interior","descriptions":["This circular temple contains one mammoth-sized boulder with a small cave hollowed on one side.  A boar statue rests inside the cave, with one eye open, watching."],"exits":[{"to":522,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":556,"exit":"go","move":"go cave"}]},
  {"id":556,"x":-312,"y":-469,"z":0,"title":"Everild's Temple, Inside the Cave","descriptions":["The small cave provides a rustic setting for the boar statue, which is made of cold bronze.  Although poised as if sleeping, its body is tense and a single open eye appears to watch every movement."],"exits":[{"to":555,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-06","Everild"]},
  {"id":557,"x":-162,"y":-489,"z":0,"title":"Damaris' Temple, Altar Hall","descriptions":["A long narrow hall focuses attention on an altar at the western end.  The only ornament is the floor, an image of an elongated panther created from black marble floor tiles set against white shimmering stone.  The paws of the panther embrace the altar, and its tail curves around to the door leading outside the temple."],"exits":[{"to":558,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":512,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-07","Damaris"]},
  {"id":558,"x":-162,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Damaris' Temple, Dream Hall","descriptions":["Three walls of the inner sanctum are hung with soft, black velvet drapes that muffle sound and still the air.  A silver floor reflects soft images of worshipers like a wavering mirror.  A rectangular shallow pool covers half the area, the silvery bottom sparkling beneath the water's ripples.  Black silk pillows are placed in perfect symmetry at the edge of the pool, facing the fourth blank, black wall."],"exits":[{"to":557,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":559,"x":-242,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Kalazashi's House of Majik","descriptions":["The darkened shop is lit by a pair of oil lamps which sit upon a mahogany counter.  Their light does little to dispel the gloom of the interior, but seems instead merely to accentuate the shadows which gather in the corners.  Rare gems, precious metals, chunks of cambrinth and runestones all mingle in an unorganized pile on the tray beside the shopkeeper, near at hand as he works to create the magical jewelry for which the shop is known."],"exits":[{"to":515,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Kalazashi's House of Majik","magic shop","Majik Shop"]},
  {"id":560,"x":-212,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Courtyard","descriptions":["Dark grey cobblestones line the earth between the imposing stone walls of the courtyard.  Bracketed by defensive towers, a large wooden gate leads out into Ratha's third tier.  Opposite the gate, columns of carved ivory flank an ebonwood door which leads into the guildhall."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"},{"to":561,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":562,"exit":"go","move":"go granite archway"}]},
  {"id":561,"x":-232,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Salle","descriptions":["White oak floorboards and walls are scarred by generations of weapons practice.  Several wooden dummies are spaced about the floor, targets for novices to test their skills against.  A stone ramp towards the back of the salle leads deeper into the Guildhall."],"exits":[{"to":562,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":560,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":876,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ramp"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Warrior Mage","Guildleader Tyrsan","Tyrsan"]},
  {"id":562,"x":-252,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Testing Chamber","descriptions":["This long hallway within the courtyard walls is filled with people working on various ways to increase their stamina for combat.  A ladder at the far end of the hall leads up to one of the defensive towers."],"exits":[{"to":561,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":560,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":563,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Testing Chamber","Stamina training"]},
  {"id":563,"x":-252,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Tower","descriptions":["The opulent beauty of Z'hutoya Way lies spread out below.  The northern guard tower is manned by a S'Kra sentry who never takes her eyes off of the street's occupants.  A curved snrhhti horn hangs from a nail in the tower's roof, its surface engraved with ancient sigils."],"exits":[{"to":562,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"}]},
  {"id":564,"x":158,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Svra'an's Fine Jewelry","descriptions":["A glass display case lined with deep blue velvet runs the length of the room.  Carefully arranged on the velvet are precious gems and metals fashioned by the skill of the gemsmith into delicate circlets, sparkling rings and polished ru'at bracelets.  On top of the case, a tooled leather catalog embossed in gold lists the various items offered for sale."],"exits":[{"to":499,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Svra'an's Fine Jewelry","jewelry shop"]},
  {"id":565,"x":178,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Lobby","descriptions":["Tall, fluted columns are spaced along each wall, framing carved niches hung with copper lanterns that keep the lobby brightly lit at all hours.  Breaking up the long expanse of pale stone, an artfully draped crimson curtain adds a dramatic background to the small refreshment stand, which tempts theater-goers during intermission with an aroma of ale and hot popped corn.  Greeting patrons as they enter the building, a decorative marquee hangs near the door waiting to announce the next performance."],"exits":[{"to":566,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":567,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Hotagi'rath Theater","Theater"]},
  {"id":566,"x":188,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Performance Hall","descriptions":["Long, tiered rows of cushioned benches cascade down to surround the stage in a semicircle, designed so that patrons from all walks of life will have a good view.  Softly glowing lamps are positioned low on the walls, allowing them to be easily shaded into total darkness during a performance so that sounds from the brightly lit stage seem to magnify outward like magic.  One aisle, surrounded by a red velvet rope, leads to a staircase accentuated by an arch that is decorated with a large, golden lyre."],"exits":[{"to":565,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":574,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go rows"}],"aliases":["Performance Hall"]},
  {"id":567,"x":168,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Hallway","descriptions":["Littered with a few discarded playbills, the long, darkened hallway continues towards the rear of the theater.  Yards of heavy fabric do little to muffle the jumble of melodies periodically drifting from a curtained arch, drawing the attention of performers as they pass by it on their way to the brightly lit backstage door.  Hung low on one wall is a nondescript service vent used by in-house staff during their daily routine of caring for the building."],"exits":[{"to":565,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":568,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":569,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":568,"x":158,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Rehearsal Hall","descriptions":[" Heavily quilted pads strategically blanket each wall, aiding the area's overall acoustics and muting from the rest of the theater any disruptive off-key notes created by practicing musicians.  Donated by the Rathan High Council of Nine to encourage fledgling talents, a walnut harpsichord facing a padded bench, an ebonwood cello leaning against a straight-backed chair and some tall island drums hiding a bamboo stool are situated in front of shelves stacked with replacement tools needed to play them."],"exits":[{"to":567,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Rehearsal Hall"]},
  {"id":569,"x":168,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Backstage","descriptions":["Always being prepared for the next rehearsal or performance, this room constantly bustles with activity as performers, stagehands, scenery designers, prop handlers, costumers, wig and make-up artists rush to and fro, each with their own agenda.  Benches await those times when directors call everything to a halt for a meeting to track their production's progress.  Hung near the backstage door, a shelf is provided for those wishing to donate props to less fortunate entertainers in the chorus."],"exits":[{"to":570,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":571,"exit":"go","move":"go metal door"},{"to":567,"exit":"go","move":"go backstage door"}],"aliases":["Backstage"]},
  {"id":570,"x":158,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Dressing Room","descriptions":["On each side of the room, wooden partitions form individual cubicles complete with privacy curtains, allowing featured male and female performers to be attended to by their own assistants while collecting their thoughts before curtain call.  Bit players are relegated to the far wall where a mirror stands ready above the long counter cluttered with makeup cases and various other accessories that may be needed.  Tall chairs await entertainers to take a seat as dressers and hairdressers work their magic."],"exits":[{"to":569,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Dressing Room"]},
  {"id":571,"x":168,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Wings","descriptions":["Dark curtains obscure the performer's view of the audience while still allowing them a clear-cut view of the stage as they practice their lines or wait for cues during rehearsals and performances.  Carpenters, painters, builders and designers work off to one side making sure that scenery, set decor, tableaus and backdrops are maintained.  A metal door keeps out those who would disrupt productions by climbing a flimsy ladder leading up to the catwalk or running down the stairs to the orchestra pit."],"exits":[{"to":572,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":573,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":569,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":569,"exit":"go","move":"go metal door"}],"aliases":["Wings"]},
  {"id":572,"x":178,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Stage","descriptions":["Dark crimson curtains frame the long opening that looks out into the performance hall.  Oak plank flooring has been polished to a mirror like finish, reflecting the bright candlelight from a row of copper lanterns edging the semi-circular stage."],"exits":[{"to":571,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Stage"]},
  {"id":573,"x":158,"y":-719,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Catwalk","descriptions":["Hung high above the stage this catwalk consists of intersecting metal girders, allowing set designers, production crews and theater staff behind the scenes access to several props and lighting setups.  Not for the faint of heart, a flimsy ladder leads down to the wings so as not to disturb any rehearsals or performances that may be going on.  Due to the number of accidents that have occurred in the past, signs have been hung to remind the over confident of the dangers involved in working at this height."],"exits":[{"to":571,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}],"aliases":["Catwalk"]},
  {"id":574,"x":198,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Hotagi'rath Theater, Golden Lyre Club","descriptions":["Welcoming citizens as they enter the club is a mahogany bar, stocked with a variety of complimentary libations to encourage a social mood.  Thick, crimson carpets and heavy draperies help silence noise from the bustling city outside, their colors enhanced by the dim lighting emanating from a black iron chandelier hung from the paneled ceiling.  Grouped around low, circular tables to invite conversation, overstuffed leather armchairs are placed to take advantage of the warmth a limestone fireplace provides."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":566,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"aliases":["Golden Lyre Club"]},
  {"id":575,"x":198,"y":-739,"z":0,"title":"Golden Lyre Club, Balcony Dining","descriptions":["The balcony's scalloped rim juts out over the performance hall, giving diners a bird's-eye view of the stage.  Positioned so that no view is hampered, a row of curved booths is generously padded in an attempt to add comfort during the lengthiest of concerts.  Vents, cleverly hidden by decorative sago palms, allow a cool, refreshing breeze to circulate through the spacious room, carrying the aroma of the dishes laid out for the enjoyment of citizens down to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go booths"}],"aliases":["Balcony Dining"]},
  {"id":576,"x":178,"y":-809,"z":0,"title":"Lileyew's Workshop, Main Room","descriptions":["The thick scent of sawdust and varnish permeates every corner of the workshop.  Long wooden shelves, illuminated by copper wall lamps, line each wall and organize carefully stacked piles of broken and neglected instruments.  A child's music box, its gears and cogs exposed by whatever accident befell it, sits waiting forlornly on a small table in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":578,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":577,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Bards' Guild"]},
  {"id":577,"x":188,"y":-809,"z":0,"title":"Lileyew's Workshop, Office","descriptions":["A broom, its bristles frayed with use, leans crookedly against the corner of a battered pine desk.  A handful of oil paintings vie for wall space with a curious array of antique instruments and an oddly-shaped carved wooden mask."],"exits":[{"to":576,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Bard","Guildleader Lileyew","Lileyew"]},
  {"id":578,"x":178,"y":-819,"z":0,"title":"Lileyew's Workshop, Parlor","descriptions":["Decorated for comfort rather than style, this appears to be the owner's place to entertain guests.  Goosedown pillows and thick rugs scattered around the gleaming floor create plenty of lounging space, and a copper kettle hoots and hisses over a charcoal brazier.  Framed parchments covered by musical notations are hung around the walls and, on a small table, a metronome gently ticks away time."],"exits":[{"to":576,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":579,"x":218,"y":-758,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Theater Roof","descriptions":["The view from here is breathtaking.  Both the city below and the lifts that lead above can be seen.  Ships of all sorts fill the harbor, their masts pointing at the sky like a giant finger.  The streets look almost alive with the flickering of lights and the movement of Ratha's citizens."],"exits":[{"to":501,"exit":"climb","move":"climb drainpipe"}],"aliases":["Theater Roof"]},
  {"id":580,"x":-82,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Small House","descriptions":["An aging female S'Kra rests in a nest of pillows beside a small fire.  In her scaled hand, she holds a copy of Moliko the Balance's treatise on justice.  Above the fire, a small portrait of the woman as a young girl gleams in the light."],"exits":[{"to":493,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Wisdom training"]},
  {"id":581,"x":-82,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Office of the Malk'smo","descriptions":["An expansive walnut desk neatly divides the constable's workspace from the rest of the room.  Visitors walk across a polished granite floor, but the Malk'smo's chair rests on the plush carpet behind the desk.  A gold plated door leads to the holding cell where the Malk'smo entertain their more serious visitors.","A gaethzen stand-lamp hovers over the large walnut desk which divides the constable's area from the rest of the room.  A rich carpet covers the polished granite floor, but only behind the desk.  A gold plated door leads to the holding cell where the Malk'smo entertain their more serious visitors."],"exits":[{"to":491,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Malk'smo","Guard House"]},
  {"id":582,"x":-42,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["The constant drone of giant pulleys is almost lost amidst the pleasant breeze that blows atop the terrace.  Carts and carriages exchange places on the lift either returning to the terrace with supplies or headed for the great gates of Ratha and distant points beyond.","The occasional drone of giant pulleys is heard over the howl of the evening breeze.  Even in the wee hours of the morning, carts and wagons wearily enter or depart the lift heading toward the ports or the city gates to the north."],"exits":[{"to":583,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":609,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":633,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-trimmed lift"}]},
  {"id":583,"x":-22,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["Large pots of flowers dot the perfect promenade.  Along the elegant balustrades, passersby stop to enjoy the view of the ocean far beyond and the bustling palace district below.","Large pots of flowers that are vibrant by day, cast long elegant shadows on the perfect brickwork of the walkway by night.  Beyond the marble balustrades, the lights of the palace and gardens present a luminous spectacle beyond measure."],"exits":[{"to":584,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":582,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":584,"x":-2,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["Elegant willows drape comforting arms over the pristine walkway.  Lending a hand to stir a cooling breeze or protect from the biting sun, the ancient trees enhance the loveliness of the promenade.","Elegant willows drape comforting arms over the pristine walkway.  Lending a hand to stir a cooling breeze or filter the sparkling moonlight, the ancient trees enhance the loveliness of the promenade."],"exits":[{"to":585,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":583,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":585,"x":18,"y":-849,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["Beautiful topiaries adorn the expansive walkway, in striking contrast to the simple beauty of the sparkling sea.  Large wagons laden with provisions traverse the cobbled avenue, drivers anxious to make deliveries on time to any one of several large estates in the vicinity.","Beautiful topiaries by day take on strange, almost monstrous shapes by night.  Far beyond the elaborate balustrades and the sheer cliffs, the velvet sea shimmers with tiny points of reflected light."],"exits":[{"to":586,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":584,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":586,"x":38,"y":-869,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["The rows of windswept willows and stately ironwood shade the walkways along the promenade.  Tantalizing smells wend their way toward appreciative bystanders and fade into the salt-sea air and the city beyond."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":585,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":587,"x":58,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["Several lovely homes are set back from the road, framed in a backdrop of rolling green acres and towering trees.  The views from this vantage point are breathtaking, whether it be the lovely terrace itself or the sparkling ocean beyond."],"exits":[{"to":588,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":586,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":626,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":588,"x":58,"y":-904,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade East","descriptions":["An expansive drive veers off toward the west and the lovely surroundings of a towering mansion.  The elaborate gate is manned by a uniformed servant who allows only those people with business on the property to gain entrance."],"exits":[{"to":589,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":587,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":589,"x":58,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Por'oson Drive","descriptions":["Swirls of smoke drift upwards from the stone chimney atop an odd open air building.  Several people gather around a blazing cook fire tending two large spits.  Turning slowly over the coals the glorious contents sizzle and roast sending splendid aromas airborne.","Swirls of smoke drift upwards from the stone chimney of an odd open air building.  As the cook fires are banked for the night, the site often attracts weary travelers who stop to warm themselves by the fire and partake of a steaming mug of coffee."],"exits":[{"to":588,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":590,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":590,"x":38,"y":-939,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Por'oson Drive","descriptions":["A low ivy covered wall brings the expansive greenery of the terrace into view as the drive skirts the northeast border of the lovely Deversham park.  Toward the southwest the beauty of the ocean catches the eye of all who traverse this section of town."],"exits":[{"to":589,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":591,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":591,"x":18,"y":-959,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Por'oson Drive","descriptions":["Bleached timbers and stone form the retaining wall that channels a constant flow of travelers to and from the great city gates."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":592,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":592,"x":-2,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Por'oson Drive","descriptions":["The pace of traffic is chaotic at times as the drive approaches the Por'oson Gate.  Travelers mill about asking directions to their destinations or seeking transportation to the distant locales beyond the city limits."],"exits":[{"to":591,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":593,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":593,"x":-22,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Por'oson Gate","descriptions":["The great wall culminates here with the large and stately Por'oson Gate.  Day and night, streams of travelers find paths through the gate to the agricultural lands and great forests to the northeast, or find access to the ports of the city below.  A pair of wary guards watches the comings and goings here, constantly alert to potential trouble."],"exits":[{"to":592,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":594,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":662,"exit":"go","move":"go por'oson gate"}]},
  {"id":594,"x":-42,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Gateway Drive","descriptions":["Workers laden with baskets and carts head toward the Por'oson gate and the agricultural fields beyond.  Children mingle among the throng of travelers and it is a wonder that more are not lost in the shuffle.","The drive is quiet this time of night, an occasional traveller wearily plodding down the drive toward the lower reaches of the city and the comforts of home.  Soft lamplight radiates from the polished lanterns burning along the great wall."],"exits":[{"to":593,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":595,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":595,"x":-62,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Gateway Drive","descriptions":["Chaos and confusion is typical at this intersection between the main gates to the city.  A large sign directs the traveler to one of two possible exits.  Nadamian Avenue to the south is the main thoroughfare leading to the lifts and the city below."],"exits":[{"to":594,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":614,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":596,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":596,"x":-82,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Gateway Drive","descriptions":["A handsome stone and timber kiosk stands back from the road, the crossed swords identifying it as the guard station.  Wagonloads of goods arrive in a steady stream heading toward the Sur'oson gate and the distant towns beyond."],"exits":[{"to":595,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":597,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":597,"x":-102,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Sur'oson Gate","descriptions":["Tall timbers and rough-hewn stone form a giant gate in the great wall.  Standing open for the streams of wagon and foot traffic to pass through, the entrance to Ratha is carefully guarded by observant sentinels who watch every passerby with trained eyes."],"exits":[{"to":596,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":598,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":663,"exit":"go","move":"go sur'oson gate"}]},
  {"id":598,"x":-122,"y":-979,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Sur'oson Drive","descriptions":["Traffic is kept to a minimum along the drive as guards siphon the majority of travelers through to Nadamian Road.  The large wall opens up to the east allowing an expansive view of the lush greenery of the terrace."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":599,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":599,"x":-142,"y":-959,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Sur'oson Drive","descriptions":["The low half wall is replaced by a high, stone and timber wall which serves as a barrier to the great wilderness beyond the city limits.  To the east, views of regal drives and sumptuous acres greet the visitor or passerby.","The low half wall is replaced by a high, stone and timber wall which serves as a barrier to the great wilderness beyond the city limits.  To the east, the regal drives are darkened, and soft lights dot the expansive acreage as the community slumbers."],"exits":[{"to":598,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":600,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":600,"x":-162,"y":-939,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Sur'oson Drive","descriptions":["Shining tiled roofs, lush topiary gardens and manicured grounds present the onlooker with a beautiful view.  As gorgeous as the surrounding neighborhoods are, they all pale in comparison to the timeless beauty of the ocean to the west."],"exits":[{"to":599,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":601,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":601,"x":-182,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Sur'oson Drive","descriptions":["A stiff breeze blows here constantly, on the windward side of the terrace.  A gentle slope rises from the road toward the east covered with softly waving grasses and wild flowers.  An old stone bench allows travelers a chance to sit and enjoy the view."],"exits":[{"to":600,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":602,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":602,"x":-182,"y":-904,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["Fine marble arches of the promenade loom to the south, their polished surfaces glinting with reflected light.  Families often stroll here, taking in the crisp air and the remarkable sights.  Several exquisite homes are nestled back from the road amid lush, manicured lawns."],"exits":[{"to":601,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":603,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":603,"x":-182,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["A tree lined drive winds up the manicured hillside toward a magnificent estate.  A quaint carriage house sits just back from the road, enclosed by elegant iron fencing.","A pair of stone nagas rise to either side of the great lifts that lead to the upper tiers.  The constant drone of the lift is only intermittent now during the quiet hours of night, and guards in nearby posts doze sporadically.  Sailors and merchants frequent the bazaar at this time of night, seeking trinkets for the lovely ladies that catch their fancy."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":621,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":604,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":604,"x":-162,"y":-869,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["Swirling winds howl through the marble arches as the walkway turns toward the northeast.  Shielded from much of the wind, families stroll comfortably along the walk enjoying the dramatic views.","Large marble arches shelter the walkway from the brisk evening breezes.  Crystal highlights glance off the ocean to the west lending an almost dreamlike quality to this section of the promenade."],"exits":[{"to":605,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":603,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":605,"x":-142,"y":-849,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["The expansive facade of a large columnar building overshadows the elegance of the walkway.  Commanding a sweeping view of the eastern ocean and the bustling palace below, the building is set back from the roadway atop a small knoll.  Ornate fencing surrounds the property and a large gate, emblazoned with a royal coat of arms, marks the entrance to graceful driveway."],"exits":[{"to":606,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":604,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":606,"x":-122,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["The marble of the balustrade is used to create a series of arches that offer a bit of protection from the constant breeze.  Elegant rose vines climb their marbled surfaces and paint a pretty picture against the azure of the sea beyond."],"exits":[{"to":607,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":605,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":607,"x":-102,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["Perfectly polished walkways and matching marble balustrades reflect just a portion of the incredible finery found on this tier.  Liveried carriages roll past conveying their occupants toward the sumptuous estates on the eastern side of the terrace."],"exits":[{"to":608,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":606,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":608,"x":-82,"y":-829,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Promenade West","descriptions":["The tinkle of music and chimes intermingle with a pleasant breeze upon which floats the smell of something incredibly delicious.  Exclusive shops and artisans offer services to the privileged residents of the Shh'o'kumu Terrace."],"exits":[{"to":609,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":607,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":632,"exit":"go","move":"gold-trimmed lift"}]},
  {"id":609,"x":-62,"y":-849,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["The wondrous smells of a nearby kitchen mingle with a refreshing light breeze, tantalizing all who pass by.  Roving musicians are often seen along the avenue lending a festive environment to the otherwise busy thoroughfare."],"exits":[{"to":610,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":582,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":608,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":610,"x":-62,"y":-869,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["The walkways here become expansive plazas lined with potted trees and assorted floral finery.  Exclusive merchants are often seen setting up impromptu shops on this spot, offering strolling residents and servants a chance to partake of their delightful offerings.","The walkways here become expansive plazas lined with potted trees and assorted floral finery.  All is quiet now, an occasional sweep sauntering by intent on ridding the area of unsightly refuse."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":609,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":691,"exit":"go","move":"go polished grate","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Fourth Tier"]},
  {"id":611,"x":-62,"y":-884,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["Perfectly patterned brickwork adorns this wide avenue that pierces the heart of the terrace.  Tall, gold trimmed lamp posts display large, colorful hanging baskets filled with sumptuous flowers and variegated ivy."],"exits":[{"to":612,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":610,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":612,"x":-62,"y":-899,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["The neatly trimmed hedges and arboreal canopy frame the wide avenue that channels the majority of traffic north and south.  This is a favorite spot of neighborhood ruffians who enjoy sneaking away from their rigorous studies and nosy nannies to throw rocks at passing wagons."],"exits":[{"to":613,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":615,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":611,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":616,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":613,"x":-62,"y":-924,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["Ivy draped walls rise to contain the clamorous traffic along the avenue, protecting nearby property from the sights and sounds of one of Ratha's busiest thoroughfares."],"exits":[{"to":614,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":612,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":614,"x":-62,"y":-939,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["Brisk wagon traffic and streams of people move north and south along this wide avenue.  Bordered with tall silverwillow trees and low sculpted hedges, the avenue is pleasing to the eye, yet extremely functional.","The bustle and chaos of the day is now only a distant memory.  Traffic continues along this stretch of avenue all through the night, but the pace is more relaxed."],"exits":[{"to":595,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":615,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":613,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":616,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":615,"x":-42,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Deversham Place","descriptions":["The lane takes a turn downward to give clearance to the main roadway above.  This spot is a busy byway for local nannies who take their charges to the lovely Deversham park to the east.","Lovely brass lanterns light this portion of the lane, near the beloved park that is now a likely subject of many a child's dream."],"exits":[{"to":622,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":612,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":614,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":616,"exit":"go","move":"go ivy-draped underpass"}]},
  {"id":616,"x":-82,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["The lane dips here slightly to pass under the main arterial above.  Thick boxwood, ironwood, and ivy completely hide the wagon and foot traffic from view, helping to preserve the quiet, peaceful atmosphere of the area.","The lane dips here to pass under the main arterial above.  Brass lanterns cast a warming glow that completely illuminates the lane, casting long shadows on cascades of draping foliage."],"exits":[{"to":614,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":612,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":617,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":615,"exit":"go","move":"go ivy-draped underpass"}]},
  {"id":617,"x":-102,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["A jewel encrusted escutcheon adorns a large gate leading into the Zsikiel estate.  Jade and lapis have been crushed and inlaid into the stone walkway, forming a colorful sea-green mosaic.  The Zsikiel family plays host to hundreds of visitors a year, the elegant walks and grand entrance a showcase for Ratha's sterling upper class."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":618,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":618,"x":-112,"y":-909,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["Delicious smells of roasting meats, spices and freshly baked bread waft past on a luscious breeze.  Somewhere closeby, the kitchen staff of a nearby estate prepares a sumptuous meal for the family and their guests.","Lingering smells of the evenings repast waft through the air, the scent of cinnamon and coffee still strong.  Somewhere closeby, warming fires and relaxed conversation enfold the hard-working staff of any of the nearby estates, as they relax a bit and focus on their own families."],"exits":[{"to":617,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":619,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":619,"x":-102,"y":-899,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["The soft tinkle of chimes and the scent of roses mingles on a breeze.  Alongside the lane, a low white fence marks the sumptuous boundary of a formal garden.  A series of elaborate fountains punctuates the sculpted greenery as it spans east toward some incredibly beautiful homes."],"exits":[{"to":620,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":618,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":620,"x":-112,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["Stone steps lead up a neatly trimmed hillock toward a stone manse.  Ancient bentwood pines flank the walkway with polished brass lanterns prepared to light the way in the dark of night.","Stone steps lead up a neatly trimmed hillock toward a stone manse.  Ancient bentwood pines flank the walkway with polished brass lanterns lighting the way."],"exits":[{"to":619,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":621,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":621,"x":-147,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Zsikiel Lane","descriptions":["A delightful lane is paved in perfectly matched cobbles, and bordered by low whitewashed fencing and sculpted hedges.  Draping willows form an arch over the roadway."],"exits":[{"to":620,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":603,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":622,"x":-22,"y":-919,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Deversham Place","descriptions":["Brightly colored pennants on polished brass poles herald the entrance to the much loved Deversham Park.  During the day, the park is filled with delighted children and their guardians who enjoy the festive accoutrements, and roving artisans.  In the evening hours it is a popular spot for romantic picnics by the pond."],"exits":[{"to":623,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":615,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":623,"x":-12,"y":-909,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Deversham Place","descriptions":["A broad plaza, framed by manicured lawns forms the central portion of the park.  Three brightly festooned gazebos serve as showplaces for a variety of wandering artists and performers who come here regularly to entertain the privileged children of the terrace.","A broad plaza, framed by manicured lawns forms the central portion of the park.  Three brightly lit gazebos serve as showplaces for a variety of wandering artists and performers who come here nightly to entertain the privileged children of the terrace."],"exits":[{"to":624,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":622,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":624,"x":-22,"y":-899,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Pantel Estate","descriptions":["The neatly trimmed lawns of Deversham park blend seamlessly with the sprawling grounds of a large estate.  A long drive, bordered by sprawling diamondwood trees, leads to a house of magnificent proportions.  The Pantel family is familiar with sprawling real estate, owning nearly all the agricultural land outside the city gates to the north."],"exits":[{"to":623,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":625,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":625,"x":-12,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Cherrywood Lane","descriptions":["Several lovely homes are set back from the lane.  Large cherrywood trees span the lane creating a cathedral-like effect, hence the lane's name.  The driveways, landscaping and finishing touches of every home in the area speak of the tremendous wealth found in this privileged community."],"exits":[{"to":626,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":624,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Alamhif","shrine"]},
  {"id":626,"x":23,"y":-889,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Cherrywood Lane","descriptions":["A simple fountain commands the center of the lane emitting an intermittent geyser of sparkling water that spills cheerfully into a pool below.  Smooth cobbles lend a feeling of quaint simplicity to an otherwise elegant neighborhood.  Stone benches have been placed around the fountain on each side of the lane offering the passerby a chance to sit and enjoy.","A simple fountain commands the center of the lane emitting an intermittent geyser of sparkling water that catches and reflects the moonlight.  Stone benches placed around the fountain are often occupied by happy couples out for a romantic stroll."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":625,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":627,"x":-372,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Temple, Pool","descriptions":["A rock protrudes, but it does not appear to be the bottom of the pool.  The cold water swirls in a strong current here."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"}],"color":"#0000A0","aliases":["Pool"]},
  {"id":629,"x":-342,"y":-359,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["The polished oak floor is marred by the travel of wheeled carts and inconsiderate animal owners.  Despite the poor behavior of some travelers the lift is well-maintained and operates nearly flawlessly."],"exits":[{"to":525,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":630,"x":318,"y":-359,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["The fine polished oak floor is scarred by the travel of cloven hooves and careless weaponmasters.  Despite the brutishness of some travelers the lift is well-maintained and operates near flawlessly."],"exits":[{"to":389,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":631,"x":-102,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"Malk'smo Holding Cell","descriptions":["The polished dark granite floor yields seamlessly to slick granite walls leaving not the slightest crevice to begin scratching an escape.  Polished steel bars cover a small vent high on one wall.  Dark rich grain in the highly polished granite serves only to emphasize the depth and quality of the stone.  There is no escape from this cell, only release."],"exits":[],"aliases":["Jail"]},
  {"id":632,"x":-82,"y":-809,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["The gold-plated wooden planks of this lift make the floor difficult to walk on but very tempting to pry up.  Such a display of style over substance reminds travelers that they are close to the wealthiest citizens in all of Qi."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":633,"x":-42,"y":-809,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lift","descriptions":["The silver-plated wooden planks of this lift make the floor difficult to walk on and even harder to look at during sunshine filled days.  Such a display of style over substance reminds travelers that they are close to the wealthiest citizens in all of Qi."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":634,"x":142,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Carriage Walk","descriptions":["Brightly illuminated lanterns hang from tall iron poles forming pools of warm amber light along the sandstone path.  The crystal dome of the inn glows against the black velvet night sky.","Pale grey sandstone bricks create a smooth passage toward an elegant inn to the northeast.  Travelers casually rest upon cool white marble benches beneath the towering palm trees throughout the lush terraced gardens.  Shell-pink granite walls rise above the trees to the red clay tiled roof of the building."],"exits":[{"to":637,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":635,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":497,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwork arch"}]},
  {"id":635,"x":162,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Emerald Gardens","descriptions":["Moths flitter at globe-like lanterns that sit nestled along the gravel paths creating small pools of flickering light.  The sweet scent of wisteria wafts through the night air on the slightest breeze.  Among the dim shadows, the outline of a small structure appears to sit in the center of a mirror image of the starry velvet sky.","A walk through this shady garden can be a rewarding side trip.  Stately trees form green walls along winding gravel paths that bisect the gardens from large expanses of manicured green lawns.  At the crossroads is a white gazebo surrounded by three symmetrical reflecting pools.  Standing on a small moss covered mound, the little structure seems to blush in the sunlight.  Stepping stones create a path through the clear pools to the small marble structure."],"exits":[{"to":636,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":634,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":637,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":636,"x":182,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Carriage Passage","descriptions":["Infinitesimal crystal grains in the stonework sparkle beneath the moonlit night.  Standing lanterns along the drive light the underside of the tall palm's graceful fonds giving them the appearance of glowing umbrellas as they shelter the pathway.","Majestic palms line this sandstone drive.  A large crystal dome sparkles with the colors of a rainbow as it rises serenely amidst the red barrel tile roof of the inn.  Tall open archways of the building's facade can partially be seen through lush gardens that cover the face of the inn."],"exits":[{"to":635,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":637,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":411,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwork arch"}]},
  {"id":637,"x":158,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Carriage Portico","descriptions":["Rough-hewned granite walls that form two-story arches create a sheltered walkway for this grand inn.  The ornately carved mahogany double doors hang heavily from highly polished brass hinges and bear the inn's crest.  Tall potted ferns line the walkway beneath the towering arches."],"exits":[{"to":636,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":634,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":635,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"},{"to":642,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":638,"x":158,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Kitchen","descriptions":["The aroma of roasting meats and simmering soups wafts through the tiled area.  The sound of whistling tea kettles from atop an iron stove mingles with the barking orders of a chef to a line of lads as they chop vegetables upon scarred wooden tables.  Frazzled looking waiters scurry through the room carrying large platters full of filled plates to waiting guests."],"exits":[{"to":639,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":506,"exit":"go","move":"go back door"}]},
  {"id":639,"x":158,"y":-679,"z":0,"title":"Kitchen, Service Pantry","descriptions":["The oak floor has become worn down the center of the pantry to a dull luster from the constant traffic of waiters running through.  Tiled pantry shelves line one wall, filled with the inn's custom china and various baked goods.  On the opposing wall, a wine rack holds myriad beverages."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":640,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":640,"x":158,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Dining Room","descriptions":["The lime-washed carved oak walls and an intricately inlaid oak parquet floor create an inviting atmosphere.  An oak footbridge beneath the wide arches to the east and glassed doors to the west create an outdoor feel within these walls.  Composed waiters dressed in deep blue velvet livery move silently around a blue silk tapestry screen that stands near a dark oak sideboard.  Ferns separate the area to provide quiet corners and secluded tables for those private dining moments."],"exits":[{"to":642,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":641,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded arch"},{"to":647,"exit":"go","move":"go oak footbridge"}]},
  {"id":641,"x":178,"y":-679,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Grand Ballroom","descriptions":["This room is aglow with candlelight from the gold chandeliers that hang at measured intervals from the beamed ceiling.  Silk brocade drapes cascade gracefully down the back wall to pool upon the gold-veined white marble tiles of the floor.  Soft music seems to float all around the room from a small lattice window.  A low marble footbridge crosses a tiled streambed into the atrium to the south."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":640,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded arch"},{"to":648,"exit":"go","move":"go marble footbridge"}]},
  {"id":642,"x":178,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Lobby","descriptions":["Tall palms in ornate brass pots stand before two-story arched windows that illuminate this grand lobby.  Rich burgundy tapestries hang from pale beige painted walls that have been polished to a porcelain lustre.  This immense room is dominated by a bronze sculpture in the center.  Muffled voices can be heard from a dark arch to the west.  A small teak footbridge crosses a narrow stream that surrounds an atrium at the center of the inn."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":643,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":640,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":637,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":649,"exit":"go","move":"go teak footbridge"}]},
  {"id":643,"x":138,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Wayfarer's Tankard, Tap Room","descriptions":["Thick redwood beams frame the rough white plastered walls of the pub.  Heads of various creatures and weapons are mounted on the walls for display.  Near the door a gleaming suit of armor stands with blazing shield in one hand, a greatsword in the other.  Booths line the interior walls while redwood trestle tables surrounded by padded leather barrel chairs are scattered throughout the tavern.  The heady scent of ale mingles with the musty smell of oak burning in the stone fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":642,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":645,"exit":"go","move":"go dark booth"},{"to":646,"exit":"go","move":"go fireside table"}]},
  {"id":644,"x":198,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Lobby","descriptions":["A thick burgundy carpeted runner climbs the beige marble steps of a grand divided staircase.  Magnificient crystal candelabras on brass stands line the staircase rendering bright illumination on every step.  Large bouquets of vibrant pink lilies stand as sentinels at the base of the stairs in white halfling-size porcelain vases.  A small teak footbridge crosses into the domed atrium."],"exits":[{"to":642,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":641,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":650,"exit":"go","move":"go teak footbridge"},{"to":652,"exit":"go","move":"go marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":645,"x":118,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Tap Room, Dark Booth","descriptions":["A single bronze sconce is mounted on the wall rendering a warm glow upon the redwood burl table.  A stuffed grendel is mounted on the wall high above the table and bench.  Hushed voices can be heard from nearby tables and booths."],"exits":[{"to":643,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":646,"x":138,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Tap Room, Fireside Table","descriptions":["The heat radiating from the stone fireplace warms this section of the tap room nicely.  The light from the brass lantern on this rough-hewn redwood trestle table competes with the amber glow from the fire.  Barrels chairs line either side of the table to provide seating for many friends."],"exits":[{"to":643,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":647,"x":168,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Courtyard, Topaz Gardens","descriptions":["The soft sounds of clinking crystal glasses and muted voices can be heard from the dining room that lies across a footbridge to the west.  Soft light from the dining room strays into the garden lighting the nearest foliage before fading into the shadows.","Surrounded by lush ferns and tall palms from the nearby gardens, this western portion is alive with the colors of a sunset.  Raised stone flowerbeds of bright marigolds, daffodils, tulips, and anemone cozy up behind stone benches.  The scent of the blooms blends harmoniously with the aromas from the dining room that lies across a footbridge to the west.  A gem-colored tiled fountain can be clearly seen over low shrubs and flowers at the end of a sandy path.  "],"exits":[{"to":648,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":651,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":649,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":640,"exit":"go","move":"go oak footbridge"}]},
  {"id":648,"x":178,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Courtyard, Jade Gardens","descriptions":["The sweet scent of alyssum wafts gently through the room.  A single lantern sits near a stone bench rendering a softly illuminated resting spot amidst the lush tropical atrium.  Soft music and gay voices can be heard from the ballroom across a low white marble footbridge."],"exits":[{"to":650,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":651,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":647,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":641,"exit":"go","move":"go marble footbridge"}]},
  {"id":649,"x":178,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Courtyard, Garnet Gardens","descriptions":["Tall torches planted among the foliage create a blazing glow around this section of the garden.  Shadows cast from the light upon the plants waltz slowly across the leaves and paths as if to music only they can hear."],"exits":[{"to":651,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":650,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":647,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":642,"exit":"go","move":"go teak footbridge"}]},
  {"id":650,"x":188,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Courtyard, Sapphire Gardens","descriptions":["Sleepy flowers nod lazily among the shrubbery.  Light from the lobby's chandeliers silently inch into the garden creating flickering shadows along the path.  A blue mirror ball seems to glow from the lanterned light as it reflects its surroundings, nestled within the flowers and shrubs."],"exits":[{"to":649,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":651,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":648,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":644,"exit":"go","move":"go teak footbridge"}]},
  {"id":651,"x":178,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Courtyard, Fountain","descriptions":["Within a sea of lush plants and sandy path reefs is an oasis of cool inviting water that bubbles musically from a stone fountain.  Large delicate pink water lily blossoms rise above platter-shaped leaves and float undisturbed upon the crystal clear water of the sparkling tiled basin at the fountain's base.  A stone statue rises from the center of the basin beneath a misty spray."],"exits":[{"to":648,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":650,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":649,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":647,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":652,"x":178,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Grand Suites Gallery","descriptions":["Tall palms rise to tickle the base of this balustraded balcony that encircles the inn's lush center courtyard.  Crystal and brass chandeliers enhance the lighting from the stained-glass dome above.  Highly polished carved doors line the gallery, each inlaid with a gold design.  The grand divided staircase continues its climb toward the towers."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":655,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":644,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":658,"exit":"go","move":"go other door"}]},
  {"id":653,"x":208,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Grand Suites Gallery","descriptions":["Tall palms rise to tickle the base of this balustraded balcony that encircles the inn's lush center courtyard.  Crystal and brass chandeliers enhance the lighting from the stained-glass dome above.  Highly polished carved doors line the gallery, each inlaid with a gold design."],"exits":[{"to":652,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":654,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":656,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":657,"exit":"go","move":"go second door"}]},
  {"id":654,"x":178,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Grand Suites Gallery","descriptions":["Tall palms rise to tickle the base of this balustraded balcony that encircles the inn's lush center courtyard.  Crystal and brass chandeliers enhance the lighting from the stained-glass dome above.  Highly polished carved doors line the gallery, each inlaid with a gold design."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":655,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":660,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":661,"exit":"go","move":"go second door"}]},
  {"id":655,"x":148,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Grand Suites Gallery","descriptions":["Tall palms rise to tickle the base of this balustraded balcony that encircles the inn's lush center courtyard.  Crystal and brass chandeliers enhance the lighting from the stained-glass dome above.  Highly polished carved doors line the gallery, each inlaid with a gold design."],"exits":[{"to":654,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":652,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":659,"exit":"go","move":"go second door"}]},
  {"id":656,"x":218,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Peony Suite","descriptions":["An oval-framed painting hangs upon the butternut colored walls above the simple oak mantled fireplace.  Smoothly sanded unfinished oak floors are covered with a scattering of soft pastel rugs.  Large splashes of bright pink peonies are embroidered across a cream colored coverlet upon an oak sleigh bed.  A crochet throw drapes casually across one of the small over-stuffed chairs that snuggle close to the fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":657,"x":218,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Wisteria Suite","descriptions":["A plush deep forest green rug embroidered with wisteria blossom covers the mahogany parquet floor.  An ivory satin comforter lays beneath matching pillows stitched with a fern design which, in turn, lean elegantly upon the elaborately carved headboard of a large feather bed.  A royal purple velvet divan sits at the foot of the bed."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":658,"x":178,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Gardenia Suite","descriptions":["This room with its polished walnut wood floors, ivory walls and wide window creates light and open spaces throughout.  Crystal and brass sconces hang upon the wall above the intricately carved walnut mantle surrounding a warm white marble fireplace.  A walnut canopy bed is draped with white velvet curtains that are tied back to each post with a gold tasseled rope.  Plush white velvet chairs with matching footstools are trimmed with gold velvet trim at the seams."],"exits":[{"to":652,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":659,"x":138,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Willow Suite","descriptions":["Pale mint-green walls greet a cream-colored ceiling with a molding of carved willow.  The bent willow furniture throughout the room is accented with celadon green and grey cotton cushions.  An unfinished willow canopy bed is draped with cream gauze across the top of the frame then secured at each post with a raffia tie."],"exits":[{"to":655,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":660,"x":168,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Rose Suite","descriptions":["Soft apple green painted walls provide a fresh bright background for a mix of rose reds, strawberry pinks and milky whites.  The red and white floral print drapes match the panels and duvet on the simple pine canopy bed.  White wicker chairs with their pink rose patterned chintz cushions create a cozy nook for conversations."],"exits":[{"to":654,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":661,"x":188,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Imperial Palm Inn, Iris Suite","descriptions":["White beaded board walls and floors are accented in pale blues and lavenders with just a whisper of grey.  Two short stout columns, parallel the floor-to-ceiling window, hold securely in their grasp a pale blue canvas hammock.  Two deck chairs made of driftwood sit to one side of the room."],"exits":[{"to":654,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":662,"x":-22,"y":-999,"z":0,"title":"Reshalia, Coastal Road","descriptions":["The heavy wooden Por'oson Gate stands open even at night, but the guards keep a close eye on anyone passing through, occasionally stopping a suspicious-looking traveler to ask his business.  Torches flaring in heavy iron sconces provide bright illumination, although the shadows that remain seem even blacker by contrast.","The heavy wooden Por'oson Gate stands open day and night, and the guards keep an eye on everyone passing through, occasionally stopping a suspicious-looking traveler to ask his business.  Most of those going in and out are local farmers bringing in loads of grain or other crops in huge, heaped wooden farm wagons, and the guards' most careful scrutiny is reserved for the few strangers who pass by."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":593,"exit":"go","move":"go por'oson gate"}],"aliases":["NE Gate","Por'oson Gate"],"linksTo":"Map95_Ratha_NE.xml"},
  {"id":663,"x":-102,"y":-999,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Outside Sur'oson Gate","descriptions":["Cloaked travelers slip in and out of the gate, wrapped up against the chill of the night and carrying torches and lanterns to light their way.  Although there are relatively few folk passing through at this hour, the gate guards seem particularly alert as they assess each person, keeping one eye on the shadows.","All manner of travelers mill about the gate, either waiting their turn to enter or pushing through the crowds in the opposite direction if they're leaving.  Farmers pass through with wagonloads of produce and grain, fishermen with their catches, and rangers with bundles of hides.  The gate guards look on, watching everyone."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":597,"exit":"go","move":"go sur'oson gate"}],"aliases":["NW Gate","Sur'oson Gate"],"linksTo":"Map92_Ratha_NW.xml"},
  {"id":664,"x":338,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Urrem'tier's Temple, Interior","descriptions":["One single candle lights the way in the interior room of the temple.  The light flickers as an unnerving cool breeze that seems to come from nowhere chills the air.  Reflections can be seen on the walls made of black glasslike material that is polished to a high shine.  Unfamiliar scraping and hissing noises leave the hair at the nape of the neck standing on end."],"exits":[{"to":665,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":451,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":666,"exit":"go","move":"go darkened archway"}]},
  {"id":665,"x":318,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Urrem'tier's Temple, Room of Death","descriptions":["Two acolytes stand guard over a cold black marble altar, while others drag the deceased and pull them on top in offering to Urrem'tier.  The darkness is broken by the lone torch that stands next to the altar, casting a glow on the black glass walls."],"exits":[{"to":664,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":666,"x":358,"y":-579,"z":0,"title":"Urrem'tier's Temple, Dark Alcove","descriptions":["Snickering noises echo in the alcove, or maybe it is the unknown breeze that chills the air even colder here than in the outer room.  Shadows dance on the walls yet there is no light source visible to cause them.  A larger than life onyx scorpion statue stands menacingly in the middle of the room."],"exits":[{"to":664,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":0,"exit":"none","move":"script automoveenterdobeks"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-04","Urrem'tier"]},
  {"id":667,"x":398,"y":-599,"z":0,"title":"Urrem'tier's Temple, Under the Interior","descriptions":["The scraping noises are louder now and seem to come from all around.  An arched doorway is cut into the black rock that leads off into an endless tunnel.  Torches are placed over the doorway to help light the way through the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":668,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":668,"x":398,"y":-619,"z":0,"title":"Under the Temple, Urrem'tier's Tunnel","descriptions":["Darkness permeates the cave with the only light coming from some source to the north of the tunnel.  Trickling noises seem to come from behind the walls as well as an unfamiliar hissing sound coming from somewhere within."],"exits":[{"to":669,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":669,"x":398,"y":-639,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":683,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":670,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":668,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":674,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Dobek Moruryn","Scorpions"]},
  {"id":670,"x":428,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":671,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":686,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":669,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":672,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":671,"x":458,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":672,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":686,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":670,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":672,"x":478,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":673,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":670,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":671,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":673,"x":508,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":675,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":669,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":672,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":674,"x":368,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":676,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":676,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":669,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":675,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":675,"x":348,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":674,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":684,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":673,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":676,"x":368,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["Formations of marbled white and black glass make up the interior of the grotto.  Less eerie here, light seems to filter in from cracks in the ceiling, giving an indication the exit is near.  The tunnel narrows down to an entrance leading north back towards safety."],"exits":[{"to":677,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":674,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":677,"x":368,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["An almost eerie quiet fills this part of the cavern.  No sounds seem to filter through except for the occasional echo of a footstep nearby.  Carved images in the cavern walls depict scenes of death in a more natural state."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":676,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":678,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":678,"x":348,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["An almost eerie quiet fills this part of the cavern.  No sounds seem to filter through except for the occasional echo of a footstep nearby.  Carved images in the cavern walls depict scenes of death in a more natural state."],"exits":[{"to":677,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":679,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":679,"x":328,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["An almost eerie quiet fills this part of the cavern.  No sounds seem to filter through except for the occasional echo of a footstep nearby.  Carved images in the cavern walls depict scenes of death in a more natural state."],"exits":[{"to":680,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":678,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":677,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":680,"x":348,"y":-749,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["An almost eerie quiet fills this part of the cavern.  No sounds seem to filter through except for the occasional echo of a footstep nearby.  Carved images in the cavern walls depict scenes of death in a more natural state."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":681,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":681,"x":328,"y":-769,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Eylhaar's Grotto","descriptions":["An almost eerie quiet fills this part of the cavern.  No sounds seem to filter through except for the occasional echo of a footstep nearby.  Carved images in the cavern walls depict scenes of death in a more natural state."],"exits":[{"to":680,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":682,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":682,"x":308,"y":-769,"z":0,"title":"Cavern of Glass, Shrine to Eylhaar","descriptions":["The obvious end of the tunnel is a shrine to the goddess Eylhaar.  A featureless statue, somewhat feminine in nature but with a hint of masculinity, stands next to a gnarled doorway.  The feeling of death hangs in the air, but is one of a more peaceful, natural death.  The walls themselves are etched with memorials of those who have died and may be buried here."],"exits":[{"to":681,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":666,"exit":"go","move":"go gnarled doorway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":683,"x":398,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":684,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":673,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":669,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":688,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":684,"x":398,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":685,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":683,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":669,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":685,"x":398,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":676,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":684,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":686,"x":398,"y":-729,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":687,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":671,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":685,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":670,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":687,"x":398,"y":-749,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":688,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":674,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":686,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":688,"x":398,"y":-779,"z":0,"title":"Aldauth's Lair, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["Shadows flicker on every wall possibly coming from the torches reflecting off of the black crystal walls.  Tunnels branch off in many directions and show no signs of ending.  An unfamiliar sound, possibly hissing, is enough to make hair stand on end."],"exits":[{"to":676,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":683,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":687,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":669,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":676,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":689,"x":278,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Narrow Pipe","descriptions":["Water flows in from the north, falling into a hole in the floor leading straight down.  Iron rungs have been fastened to one wall of the dark pit, forming a slippery ladder.  The constant moisture has ensured that the rungs are well-rusted, in some places pulling out from the wall."],"exits":[{"to":690,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":692,"exit":"climb","move":"climb hole"}]},
  {"id":690,"x":278,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Narrow Pipe","descriptions":["The walls are narrowly within a dagger stroke to either side, curving seamlessly into the ceiling and barely giving enough room to stand upright.  Along the center of the floor a stream of dark water flows south."],"exits":[{"to":691,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":689,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":691,"x":278,"y":-299,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Grate","descriptions":["A fitful light filters through the bars of the grate overhead, and the air is unpleasant with odors probably best not identified.  The walls and floor of the cramped space are built out of tightly fitted stone.  A thin sheet of water flows southward down its center into a large pipe, just big enough to squeeze into."],"exits":[{"to":690,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow pipe"},{"to":610,"exit":"go","move":"go polished grate","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":692,"x":278,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["A chill wind brushes by, blowing softly past from the black-throated tunnels stretching off in several directions.  The rusted rungs of a ladder climb the north wall, disappearing into a narrow hole cut into the ceiling from which a constant stream of water falls to the floor.  From a distance can be heard soft rustlings and movements, but from which direction, or whether from all directions at once, is impossible to tell."],"exits":[{"to":694,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":695,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":693,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":689,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron ladder"}]},
  {"id":693,"x":258,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["Water falling from a line of pipes along the wall echoes unbearably loudly in the almost total darkness.  The noise and lack of light make it difficult to either see or hear anything approaching until it is virtually next to you."],"exits":[{"to":692,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":694,"x":298,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["The atmosphere is icy cold, and tendrils of chill air seem to reach under clothing as if seeking warm flesh to feed upon.  The light is very dim, and the walls of the tunnel are lost in shadowy darkness."],"exits":[{"to":692,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":695,"x":278,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["The tunnel walls have been built of a random mixture of brick and stone, as though the builders utilized whatever came to their hands at that moment.  A small heap of bricks, stone, and dirt has fallen from the ceiling in one place, exposing raw dirt.  The stability of the rest of the ceiling seems questionable."],"exits":[{"to":692,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":696,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":696,"x":278,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["A light flickers to the southwest, its beams reflecting off the damp stones of the passage.  Compared to the black tunnels, no long night's dawn could be more welcome than this faint glimmer."],"exits":[{"to":695,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":699,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":697,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":697,"x":259,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snailway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the east is flanked by flaring torches in bronze holders shaped like lions' heads.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":696,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":700,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":698,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":698,"x":278,"y":-161,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["A red glow flickers in the distance to the northwest.  Its light lends a sense of motion and distance, and dispels the oppressive feeling that the walls are closing in.  The light, obviously from flames, wavers -- growing brighter one moment, dimmer the next."],"exits":[{"to":699,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":697,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":699,"x":297,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":701,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":702,"exit":"none","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":700,"x":279,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Snail Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with red tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":697,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":707,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":701,"x":297,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":702,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":699,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":702,"x":318,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":699,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":701,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":703,"exit":"none","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":703,"x":318,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["A large circular opening -- curiously shaped like a big pipe -- dominates the ceiling of the room.  From the southeast comes the light of flickering torches, contrasting sharply with the darkness to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":704,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":706,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":702,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":704,"x":338,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":705,"x":358,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["The dim beams from the southwest, gleaming weakly on wet brick and rough walls, reveal three ominously dark entrances to the room.  They stand like the gaping mouths of monsters into whose gullet one would not willingly travel."],"exits":[{"to":706,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":715,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":714,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":704,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":706,"x":338,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferretway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the north is flanked by flaring torches in iron holders shaped like trolls' hands.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":707,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":705,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":703,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":707,"x":338,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Ferret Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with green tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":706,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":700,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":708,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":708,"x":298,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beetle Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with yellow tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":709,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":707,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":709,"x":278,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetleway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the east is flanked by flaring torches in brass holders shaped like trader logs.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":710,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":708,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":712,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":710,"x":298,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["The tunnel turns at odd angles and disturbing slants, as if it were avoiding rooms rather than connecting them.  A glimmer from the southwest promises clearer vision, but the shadows to the southeast might be nearer the reality of the Warren."],"exits":[{"to":711,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":709,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":711,"x":318,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":713,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":712,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":710,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":712,"x":298,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["The tunnel turns at odd angles and disturbing slants, a distorted mirror-image -- if stone can be called a mirror -- of the room to the north.  Torchlight flickers to the northwest, while the darkness waits at two other yawning entrances."],"exits":[{"to":711,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":713,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":709,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":713,"x":318,"y":-39,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":711,"exit":"none","move":"north"},{"to":712,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":714,"x":358,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":716,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":705,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":715,"x":378,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":705,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":718,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":733,"exit":"none","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":716,"x":378,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":717,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":719,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":714,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":733,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":717,"x":418,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":718,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":719,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":716,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":720,"exit":"none","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":718,"x":418,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":724,"exit":"go","move":"go obscure opening"},{"to":725,"exit":"none","move":"down"},{"to":719,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":715,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":717,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":719,"x":398,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":717,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":718,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":716,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":720,"x":418,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something silent brushing past or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":717,"exit":"none","move":"down"},{"to":721,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":721,"x":378,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":720,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":722,"exit":"none","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":722,"x":358,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":723,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":721,"exit":"none","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":723,"x":338,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Grating","descriptions":["A faint light from the grating above shows this small, tile-lined room, hardly more than a wide connection in the system of pipes that regulates the flow of water that cleanses and refreshes Ratha.  A big bronze valve is the only noteworthy feature in the place."],"exits":[{"to":722,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go sewer grating","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":724,"x":458,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Drain","descriptions":["Beneath the drain is a small, tile-lined room, part of the main sewer and water supply system, from the look of the big bronze valve that takes up most of one wall of the room."],"exits":[{"to":718,"exit":"go","move":"go obscure opening"},{"to":129,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded drain","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":725,"x":418,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":718,"exit":"none","move":"up"},{"to":726,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":727,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":718,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded drain"}]},
  {"id":726,"x":438,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":727,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":731,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":727,"x":438,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":726,"exit":"none","move":"north"},{"to":730,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":728,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":728,"x":458,"y":-59,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":727,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":729,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":729,"x":478,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":732,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow passage"},{"to":731,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":730,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":728,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":730,"x":458,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":727,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":729,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":731,"x":458,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":729,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":726,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":729,"exit":"go","move":"go broken grating"}]},
  {"id":732,"x":498,"y":-79,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Drain","descriptions":["The sewer drop under the grating is a small, tile-lined room.  Rainwater from the street above flows into it and exits through a big bronze valve that seems oversized for that purpose."],"exits":[{"to":729,"exit":"go","move":"go passage"},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go broken grating","hidden":true},{"to":734,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze valve","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":733,"x":338,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":716,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":704,"exit":"none","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":734,"x":398,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ehhrsk Highway","descriptions":["Green lichen growing on the walls glows with an eerie light, providing a small amount of illumination.  The darkness makes one part of the tunnels look the same as the rest.  A faint reek of sewage fills the air, but the area is clean of everything but a few cobwebs."],"exits":[{"to":745,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":743,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":735,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":735,"x":378,"y":61,"z":0,"title":"Ehhrsk Highway","descriptions":["Green lichen growing on the walls glows with an eerie light, providing a small amount of illumination.  The darkness makes one part of the tunnels look the same as the rest.  A faint reek of sewage fills the air, but the area is clean of everything but a few cobwebs."],"exits":[{"to":736,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":734,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":739,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
