  {"id":782,"x":278,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Ehhrsk Highway","descriptions":["Green lichen growing on the walls glows with an eerie light, providing a small amount of illumination.  The darkness makes one part of the tunnels look the same as the rest.  A faint reek of sewage fills the air, but the area is clean of everything but a few cobwebs."],"exits":[{"to":773,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":780,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":781,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":783,"x":162,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["From here the sounds of the warehouse beyond the steel door in the northern wall are fairly clear, though the specifics of things are hard to discern.  Neutral-colored low-pile carpeting runs the length of the hall, showing a distinct traffic pattern at both ends of the hallway as well as back into the reception area through the arch."],"exits":[{"to":785,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":784,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":786,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":784,"x":142,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["An ornate door dominates this end of the corridor, carvings upon its surface serving to enhance the inherent beauty of its wood.  A natural hush falls upon this end of the guild, as though the impressive architecture commanded such respect."],"exits":[{"to":783,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":833,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":785,"x":182,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["Bright artwork lines the cream-colored walls, splashes of design and color in an otherwise gloomy section of the hallway.  To the side is the lounge established specifically for the guild and its members."],"exits":[{"to":783,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":792,"exit":"go","move":"go lounge"}]},
  {"id":786,"x":142,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["Piled high in rows of freight, sturdy wooden crates mark the boundaries of walkways, orderly passages in which cargo trolleys are loaded and unloaded.  Every shipment is carefully labeled with various markings, denoting point of origin and destination."],"exits":[{"to":787,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":788,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":789,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":790,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":791,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":783,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}]},
  {"id":787,"x":142,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["The area opens up in a conscious effort to make room for larger amounts of foot traffic, the crates and shipping containers stacked tighter together than anywhere else in the warehouse.  The floor is worn smooth in spots, kept swept clean by the passage of so many over time."],"exits":[{"to":788,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":789,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":786,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":790,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":791,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":795,"exit":"go","move":"go crate"}]},
  {"id":788,"x":162,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["The warehouse ends in a dim corner, tall stacks of freight providing a modicum of privacy in this otherwise open-ended space.  Here the containers are stacked for long-term storage, in tidy rows for ease of storage as well as reclaimability."],"exits":[{"to":789,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":786,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":787,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":789,"x":162,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["The entry is wide enough to accomodate the largest cart, opening a small alley between the back facade of the office section of the guild and the seemingly endless rows of arranged shipments.  The atmosphere is one of barely contained frantic efficiency as guild clerks check and double-check shipments as they arrive and are sent out again.  A large door in the outer wall, nearly half the size of the entire outer wall itself, is stuck in the open position."],"exits":[{"to":788,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":786,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":787,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":805,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}]},
  {"id":790,"x":122,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["The warehouse begins where the offices leave off, the building's structure changing from whitewashed brick to steel and wood.  Set into the back of the offices is a large steel-framed window providing a view of the interior headquarters.  Cargo crates of all sizes dominate the floor space, making walls and corners of their own."],"exits":[{"to":791,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":787,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":786,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":791,"x":122,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Warehouse Floor","descriptions":["This back corner of the warehouse is where extra, old or misplaced commodities are left to be forgotten.  Tracks show through the light coating of dust, vermin by far the most common.  Stamped crests and dates are faded from time, leaving little information on what is being stored or what the original destination may have been."],"exits":[{"to":787,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":786,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":790,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":792,"x":202,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Lounge","descriptions":["Artwork adorns the walls of this otherwise utilitarian space.  Several circular tables fill the room with seating surrounding them.  A sideboard holds a delicate menu."],"exits":[{"to":785,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":793,"exit":"go","move":"go teak door"}]},
  {"id":793,"x":202,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Wholesale Outlet","descriptions":["Sumptuous cloth hangs from ceiling to floor, covering as much wall space as possible.  Underfoot, a plush and colorful rug softens the floor as well as masking distracting sounds.  Lanterns hang from the fabric canopy, casting a soft glow on all the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":794,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":792,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Trader Shop"]},
  {"id":794,"x":182,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Trader Shop, Side Room","descriptions":["Dark cherrywood panels on the walls are accented by tapestries that hang from ceiling to floor.  A thick burgundy carpet with gold tassels muffles most noise from the well-dressed traders that wander, speaking in undertones.  Tall crystal and platinum candelabras sit in each corner, giving a soft but luxuriant light to the wares being offered."],"exits":[{"to":793,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":795,"x":142,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Behind The Crate","descriptions":["Shipping containers, most of which look as though they haven't been moved in years, enclose a small open area to the rear of the warehouse, surrounding a large raised platform.  Occasionally sounds drift down from the dais, but conversation here does not disrupt any auctions that may be in progress."],"exits":[{"to":796,"exit":"go","move":"go plat"},{"to":787,"exit":"go","move":"go crates"}]},
  {"id":796,"x":162,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Raised Platform","descriptions":["Open floor space provides the necessary room for auctioneers, buyers, and sellers alike to peruse any items presented.  A piece of fine parchment and a waiting list rest near a small stand, ready for use.  Crates from the warehouse serve as walls, the height and depth ever-changing as stock is shipped in and out of the guild, and they contain the noise to the adjacent space, just off the platform."],"exits":[{"to":795,"exit":"go","move":"go plat"}]},
  {"id":797,"x":18,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Functional Furniture, Ratha Branch","descriptions":["A thin layer of red dust, blown in from the street outside, covers everything in the shop.  Half-faded brush marks in the dirt on the floor indicate that the owner tries his best to keep the elements out, without much success.  A single counter in the room holds items for sale, and a large sign hangs on the wall behind it."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Functional Furniture"]},
  {"id":798,"x":138,"y":371,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern, Attic Crawlspace","descriptions":["The stench of foul liquors and decaying wood is heavy, trapped and condensed in this cramped area as it wafts up from the bar rooms below.  Sprawled on one precarious-looking support beam are the bones of a dead rat, almost comedically flayed as if it had succumbed to the odor."],"exits":[{"to":799,"exit":"go","move":"search go wall panel"},{"to":249,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rotting ladder"}]},
  {"id":799,"x":148,"y":371,"z":0,"title":"Old Rat's Tavern, Attic Crawlspace","descriptions":["A simple cot has been roughly shoved where the roof gives the most ample headroom, allowing a sleepily unobservant soul to miss waking to a bump in the head.  Rusting nails and old boards have been put to good use, making for a functional spot to place sundries.  The pungent odors alone are enough to make one question what would make a person desperate enough to make residence here."],"exits":[{"to":798,"exit":"go","move":"go wall panel"}]},
  {"id":800,"x":298,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Drogor's Bite, Hiring Hall","descriptions":["Walls crafted from planks salvaged over the years from various ships give this office a distinctive feel -- much like the inside of a clubhouse.  A net hangs over a rickety desk, holding shark jaws as decoration.  Behind the desk is a doorway leading further into the building."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"go","move":"go dark doorway"},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":"go flimsy door"}],"aliases":["Drogor's Bite"]},
  {"id":801,"x":298,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Drogor's Bite, Hallway","descriptions":["Dark brown paint barely hides the crate-quality wood used to construct this hallway's walls and the plain packed dirt floor does little to improve the area's dingy coloration.  A cacophony of sounds penetrates from outside due to the shoddy construction."],"exits":[{"to":803,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":802,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":804,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":800,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}]},
  {"id":802,"x":318,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Drogor's Bite, Historical Storage","descriptions":["Rows of bookcases fill this room in no observable pattern, creating a maze of paths and trapping dust motes in the dull light.  Unrolled scrolls and maps drape off most of the overburdened shelves, making the narrow passages even tighter.  A huge selection of charts lie one atop the other, their fraying edges giving the filled bookcase a feathery appearance.  A weather-beaten buoy tilts against the far wall beneath a mounted harpoon."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":803,"x":298,"y":401,"z":0,"title":"Drogor's Bite, Caretaker's Room","descriptions":["So little light penetrates a filthy window above an equally filthy cot it is impossible to tell if it is day or night outside.  A wobbly wood chair, one slightly shorter leg unsuccessfully leveled by a small wood chip, tilts against the far wall.  A rain slicker and some tired-looking overalls hang from a rack."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":804,"x":278,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Drogor's Bite, Lounge","descriptions":["In keeping with the rough and ready atmosphere of its normal clientele, the three tables and assorted chairs that clutter this lounge all bear the scars of heavy usage.  Lying beneath one table is the splintered leg from an overturned chair while scattered across the tabletops are remnants of this room's last gathering."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":805,"x":182,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Staging Area","descriptions":["Nestled against the outside wall of the guild, a plain but sturdy structure has been erected comprised of a roof and two walls, the front open to allow even the largest freight through.  Drivers mill about as cargo is loaded and unloaded, crates borne on carts moving in and out of the guild through the door that has been rolled back out of the way.  Pack animals fidget and add to the cacophony with their loud cries, the overall effect creating the general controlled chaos in which the guild operates."],"exits":[{"to":806,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":17,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":789,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}]},
  {"id":806,"x":202,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Traders' Guild, Shipping Corner","descriptions":["A much smaller structure than the guild, but still a part of it, this squat building sits across the walkway from the main establishment.  Here special shipments between guild members are stored or shipped, according to their destinations.  Rich teak wainscoting lays against the painted brick walls and a dark carpet covers the floor."],"exits":[{"to":805,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Clerk"]},
  {"id":807,"x":148,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Glythtide's Shrine","descriptions":["The shrine room is shaped like a burrow, all corners rounded and smooth.  Mown grasses and meadowsweet stems cover the floor in a fragrant strewing, but the main focus of the shrine remains the statue honoring the god Glythtide."],"exits":[{"to":444,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#4080FF","aliases":["Shrine4-08","Glythtide"]},
  {"id":808,"x":-32,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Sshoi-sson Palace, Grand Provincial Bank, Vault","descriptions":["Away from the elegance of the bank's public areas, two burly guards with a no-nonsense air about them protect the iron-lined exchange vault.  Liveried tellers glide in and out, handing leather pouches to the guards, who in turn pass the coins through a flickering moongate at the far end of the room.  On one side, a languid S'Kra Mur Moon Mage reclines upon a plush quilted silk divan as she concentrates upon maintaining her part of the network of gates used by the bank."],"exits":[{"to":469,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["3Exchange","Premium Exchange"]},
  {"id":809,"x":458,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Chabalu's Exotics, Cellar","descriptions":["Crates are stacked all over this room.  Cobwebs choke the darkened corners of the cellar, and an inch of thick dust covers the floor."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":810,"exit":"go","move":"go tunnel"}]},
  {"id":810,"x":478,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Ehhrsk Hall","descriptions":["Originally a natural cavern, this chamber now serves as the center for Ratha's dominant criminal element.  Benches hewn from the walls serve the weary cutpurse.  Air vented in from the surface reeks of sewage and stagnant water.  A ladder carved into the stone of one wall leads up to a shallow niche that looks out over the whole hall."],"exits":[{"to":812,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":811,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":813,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":811,"x":458,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Leader's Alcove","descriptions":["This brightly lit office appears to belong to a bank clerk instead of Ratha's most powerful thief.  From the beautiful landscapes that hang from the wall to the plush imported carpeting, this room screams wealth.  Besides a large lock box in the corner, a wooden desk is the only piece of furniture in the room."],"exits":[{"to":810,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Thief"]},
  {"id":812,"x":478,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Ehhrsk Haven","descriptions":["Smoky oil lamps light this dug-out chamber that is meant to be used as a safe haven for all that belong to the guild.  Cots lined up along one wall are used by the more transient members.  Piles of rock make it easy to go up or down to shadowy ledges on either side of the room."],"exits":[{"to":810,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":815,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":814,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":816,"exit":"go","move":"go garbage chute"}]},
  {"id":813,"x":478,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Niche","descriptions":["Carved shallowly into the bedrock, this small room serves as a guard post in times of trouble.  Dark lichen grows on the walls and floor giving off a rotted stench."],"exits":[{"to":810,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":814,"x":458,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Dark Passage","descriptions":["Light coming from the Haven barely illuminates this room.  The air is heavy with moisture and thick with the smell of sewage.  Dark green lichen covers the walls."],"exits":[{"to":812,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":815,"x":498,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Dark Passage","descriptions":["Light coming from the Haven barely illuminates this room.  The air is heavy with moisture and thick with the smell of sewage.  Dark green lichen covers the walls."],"exits":[{"to":812,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":816,"x":478,"y":-539,"z":0,"title":"A Garbage Chute","descriptions":["The stench is almost overwhelming in this suffocatingly-small crawlspace.  A steel rung ladder, bolted securely to the wall, leads higher into the tunnel.  The little amount of light adds to the sense of claustrophobia."],"exits":[{"to":812,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":817,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steel-rung ladder"}]},
  {"id":817,"x":478,"y":-559,"z":0,"title":"A Garbage Chute","descriptions":["The stench is terrible in this suffocatingly-small crawlspace.  Street cleaners sweep refuse into the metal grates at the top of the tunnel.  A steel rung ladder, securely bolted to the wall, leads downward into the smelly depths."],"exits":[{"to":816,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steel-rung ladder"},{"to":502,"exit":"go","move":"go metal grate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":818,"x":-256,"y":377,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Bookstore","descriptions":["The shop is filled with the smell of raw metals, a smell so sharp that it clings to the teeth.  A large iron door stands at the back of the room, acting as a barricade between the forge and the front shop.  Sitting at a ticket counter is an elderly Elothean sales clerk, keeping the supply of books nice and orderly.","The shop is filled with the smell of raw metals, a smell so sharp that it clings to the teeth.  A large iron door stands at the back of the room, acting as a barricade between the forge and the front shop.  Sitting at a ticket counter is an elderly Elothean sales clerk, keeping the supply of books nice and orderly, while a series of three charts hangs on a nearby wall."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":819,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging books","books Forging"]},
  {"id":819,"x":-256,"y":388,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Tool Shop and Entryway","descriptions":["This passage acts as an entryway in and out of the forge.  Stifling heat marches up from a large hall to the south, nearly destroying a subtle cross-breeze heading east and west.  Sweat-soaked merchants offer assistance to crafters needing to resupply tools and materials.  To the north, a thick iron door protects the outside office from the smothering heat."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":825,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":829,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":818,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging Society","Forging tools","Forging clerk","clerk Forging","tools Forging"]},
  {"id":820,"x":-242,"y":388,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, East Passage","descriptions":["A gentle breeze stirs in this passage, adding a bit of relief to the blistering heat.  To the south is a break room, and to the east are various grinding rooms.  Even from here, the metal's wail can be heard."],"exits":[{"to":821,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":822,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":823,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":824,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":819,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":821,"x":-232,"y":378,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Grinding Room","descriptions":["The warm air is filled with the smell of heated metal.  Far from the sound of the hammers, the grindstones have been placed to allow for freedom of movement as journeyman smiths work to perfect their prized blades.  Curious apprentices hover about, hoping to learn a trick or two studying those that take a turn at the wheel."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Grinding1","1Grinding"]},
  {"id":822,"x":-232,"y":388,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Grinding Room","descriptions":["A large grated window set high on the east side of this room provides a steady stream of air from the outside world.  Set back from the rest of the forge, only the whining of grinding metals can be heard.  A large grindstone is here, accompanied by a moderately clean bucket of cool water."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Grinding2","2Grinding"]},
  {"id":823,"x":-232,"y":398,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Grinding Room","descriptions":["This is a small grinding room set apart from the others.  Conveniently located by the break room, it also tends to be the most used.  Young Gor'Tog lads, looking to earn a spare coin for their families, work to sweep up shavings and oil the stones."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Grinding3","3Grinding"]},
  {"id":824,"x":-242,"y":398,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Break Room","descriptions":["This is a small, simple room set up to act as a break room for people working in the forge.  Above, a small slitted window lets in some fresh air, helping to take a bite out of the heat.  A rickety table made from salt-stained planks lies in the center of the room, offering simple snacks.  Nearby on the floor is an open barrel with a tin ladle chained to it.  Several crates line the floor as well, acting as chairs."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Forging prestige","prestige Forging"]},
  {"id":825,"x":-256,"y":408,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Maker's Mark Hall","descriptions":["Soot-stained red brick makes up the walls and floor of this large hall.  Attendants offer maker's mark design services to eligible crafters here.  The sound of bubbling metal echoes through passageways further south."],"exits":[{"to":819,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":826,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":827,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":828,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Maker's Marks"]},
  {"id":826,"x":-246,"y":418,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["Eerie shadows dance on the walls across the smudged passageway that leads out of the foundry to the northwest.  A huge granite crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  Black dust fills the air, spiraling up in the heat as it blows off a pile of fuel."],"exits":[{"to":825,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Foundry1","1Foundry"]},
  {"id":827,"x":-256,"y":418,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["The floor slopes toward a circular firepit fed by a large pile of crushed coal.  A huge granite crucible hangs over the fire, suspended by heavy chains from a thick wooden beam.  The only exit is a blackened passageway to the north."],"exits":[{"to":825,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Foundry2","2Foundry"]},
  {"id":828,"x":-266,"y":418,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["A huge granite crucible sways from a blackened beam in the center of the foundry.  A large fire burns near the end of the crucible and an immense fuel pile is placed in convenient reach.  A sooty passage to the northeast leads back to the hall."],"exits":[{"to":825,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Foundry3","3Foundry"]},
  {"id":829,"x":-269,"y":388,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Western Passage and Supply Depot","descriptions":["This expanded passage offers some protection from the heat and contains pallets of materials for crafters to order.  Passages continue to the west, one streaked with oily handprints and two that have been haphazardly scrubbed down.  From the west you can hear the pounding of hammers upon metal."],"exits":[{"to":819,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":830,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":831,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":832,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":838,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging supplies","supplies Forging"]},
  {"id":830,"x":-279,"y":398,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["The ceiling of this forge has been cut away, leaving half the room under open sky.  The forge sits close to the inner wall under the shelter of the covered half while a rusty anvil lies further out, with limited protection.  Although this is a bit cramped compared to the other two forges, the constant airflow adds a great deal of relief from the heat."],"exits":[{"to":829,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Forge1","1Forge"]},
  {"id":831,"x":-279,"y":388,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["A sturdy anvil dominates the center of this small forging area.  Heat pours out from the glowing forge and permeates the room as a small ceiling shaft tries futilely to draw it outside.  A slack tub stands guard below the forge, waiting to cool off the anvil's bounty, be they broken pieces or masterpieces."],"exits":[{"to":829,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Forge2","2Forge"]},
  {"id":832,"x":-279,"y":378,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Blackened stone walls enclose this simple forge.  A great shaft lies in the slanted ceiling, breathing out fumes and smoke, yet not seeming to give any relief to the heat.  An old anvil scratched with time and neglect stands ready for use near the tempered forge, its hot coals giving an odd glow to the room."],"exits":[{"to":829,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Forge3","3Forge"]},
  {"id":833,"x":122,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Ratha's Traders' Guild, Office of the Guildleader","descriptions":["A low pile cream carpet complements the dark paneling of the walls without being too obtrusive.  With ample space for all the furniture, nothing appears cramped or haphazard here.  Plush leather chairs sit before and behind the desk while a few extra wait nearby for use.  A framed window in the northern wall provides a view of the warehouse floor."],"exits":[{"to":784,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Trader","Imaar"]},
  {"id":834,"x":382,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Shore Walk, Rocky Path","descriptions":["Giant boulders are scattered haphazardly about the ocean near the beach.  Curiously, smaller stones have been collected to form a rocky path atop the water -- wide enough for a pair of horses and long enough for at least ten.  The ocean's floor drops away to invisible depths at the pathway's midpoint, leaving little doubt that the end is quite deep indeed.  Tufts of soggy, seaweed-matted fur cling to the stones."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go beach"},{"to":835,"exit":"none","move":"join sea mammoth"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Fang Cove","Mammoth"]},
  {"id":835,"x":402,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Aboard the Mammoth, Platform","descriptions":["Thick, barnacle-encrusted ropes secure the platform to the mammoth's back.  The wooden planks follow the curve of the beast's neck, allowing the driver an elevated vantage point as he does his best to lead the sea creature to and fro across the vast ocean.  Birds' nests can be seen all around the platform and are woven intricately into the fur."],"exits":[{"to":834,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"linksTo":"Map150_Fang_Cove.xml"},
  {"id":836,"x":78,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Fang Cove, Fate's Fortune Lane","descriptions":["A towering marble archway opens a gap in the wall to the north and separates the ongoing construction and somewhat more refined completed structures of Fate's Fortune Lane from the crude structures and makeshift walkway along the beach.  The entrance to a squat, wide bungalow sits in opposition to the arch, and the sheltering cliffs of Fang's Peak rise up from behind it.  To either side of the arch, cobblestones of different shapes and sizes have been laid out to form the wide Fate's Fortune Lane."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":"go exit portal"}],"aliases":["Fang Cove","Fate's Fortune Lane"],"linksTo":"Map150_Fang_Cove.xml"},
  {"id":837,"x":-232,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Mask and Leatherworks, Embosser's Workshop","descriptions":["Hanging from a beam in the ceiling, a menu board sways gently in the breeze.  At the back of the alcove, a workbench cluttered with brushes, paints and other tools stands beside a mannequin.  The mannequin is currently adorned with a leather gambeson which is being decorated with the crest of the Pantel family."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":838,"x":-269,"y":398,"z":0,"title":"Forging Society, Bulk Materials","descriptions":["Tucked away in little more than a closet, this small space somehow manages to serve those who spend ample time in the nearby forges by supplying large quantities of the metals used.  A lone, red-eyed clerk is crammed behind a makeshift counter -- a door resting atop two differently sized barrels.  She coughs from time to time as the poorly ventilated area frequently fills with smoke."],"exits":[{"to":829,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging Bulk","Bulk Forging"]},
  {"id":839,"x":-112,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Reception","descriptions":["Creamy marble with a mirror-like finish spreads across the floor underfoot, while a variety of animal hides and shields are displayed at various points upon the surrounding walls.  A pair of brocade settees sit opposite each other at the center of the room, separated by a short oval table which is highlighted under the soft glow of the chandelier overhead.  A S'Kra Mur clerk stands behind a nearby counter, making notes in a small ledger."],"exits":[{"to":840,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":844,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":130,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany doors"}],"aliases":["Outfitting Society","Outfitting Clerk"]},
  {"id":840,"x":-102,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Office","descriptions":["Swathes of opulent silk sweep to each corner of the small office from a central point overhead, contrasting against the dark mahogany walls.  A broad desk and tufted leather chair rest along a far wall, facing an arched window that overlooks the bustling street beyond, while a wide corridor leads further north."],"exits":[{"to":841,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":839,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":841,"x":-102,"y":-269,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Tool Shop","descriptions":["A trio of gaethzen orbs hangs overhead, casting a soft glow over the area and a small counter along one wall.  The store's perimeter is lined with colorful wicker bins, each piled high with various waxes, tools and notions essential to the local craftsmen.  In a nearby corner, a large clay planter overflows with sweet-smelling, golden melilots, the redolent blossoms adding a pleasant touch to the otherwise utilitarian room."],"exits":[{"to":840,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":842,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Tools"]},
  {"id":842,"x":-112,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Corridor","descriptions":["Framed sketches dot the walls of the corridor beneath ornately jeweled sconces, each displaying a uniquely designed image.  Several artisans bustle back and forth through the area, each laden with sacks filled with a variety of goods."],"exits":[{"to":843,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":841,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":845,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":846,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":843,"x":-102,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Corridor","descriptions":["Framed sketches dot the walls of the corridor beneath ornately jeweled sconces, each displaying a uniquely designed image.  An ornately carved wooden bench rests against one wall, a quilted throw draped along the backrest, while a thick burgundy rug lies before archways of oak, maple, and walnut."],"exits":[{"to":842,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":850,"exit":"go","move":"go oak archway"},{"to":851,"exit":"go","move":"go maple archway"},{"to":852,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut archway"}]},
  {"id":844,"x":-122,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Jeweled brass lanterns overhead highlight a mural of a magnificent palace that decorates one wall of the small book store.  Flanked by broad potted palms, several shelves display a variety of books where patrons browse before making their purchases at the counter nestled in a nearby corner."],"exits":[{"to":845,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":839,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Books"]},
  {"id":845,"x":-122,"y":-269,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Supply Depot","descriptions":["A variety of animal hides decorate the walls of the small depot, a brass lantern overhead casting a soft glow over the area.  Long tables line the room, each piled high with padding supplies and various leather hides, while nearby baskets overflow with an assortment of fibers."],"exits":[{"to":842,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":844,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Supplies"]},
  {"id":846,"x":-122,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Corridor","descriptions":["Framed sketches dot the walls of the corridor beneath ornately jeweled sconces, each displaying a uniquely designed image.  An ornately carved wooden bench rests against one wall, a quilted throw draped along the backrest, while a thick burgundy rug lies before archways of oak, maple, and walnut."],"exits":[{"to":842,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":847,"exit":"go","move":"go oak archway"},{"to":848,"exit":"go","move":"go maple archway"},{"to":849,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut archway"}]},
  {"id":847,"x":-132,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Weaving Hall","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the painted azure walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the archway is a simple workbench and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink, and enjoy the fruits of one's labor."],"exits":[{"to":846,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Weaving1"]},
  {"id":848,"x":-132,"y":-289,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Weaving Hall","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the painted coral walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the archway is a simple workbench and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink, and enjoy the fruits of one's labor."],"exits":[{"to":846,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Weaving2"]},
  {"id":849,"x":-122,"y":-289,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Weaving Hall","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the painted turquoise walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the archway is a simple workbench and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink, and enjoy the fruits of one's labor."],"exits":[{"to":846,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Weaving3"]},
  {"id":850,"x":-92,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Spinning Parlor","descriptions":["A vast tapestry of nine golden stars sprinkled on a midnight blue background hangs upon one of the painted turquoise walls, while a soft woolen rug blankets the floor underfoot.  A large spinning wheel stands at the back of the parlor, while a large workbench and padded chair rest nearby, providing a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail."],"exits":[{"to":843,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Spinning1"]},
  {"id":851,"x":-92,"y":-289,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Spinning Parlor","descriptions":["A vast tapestry of majestic galleon on a stormy sea hangs upon one of the painted azure walls, while a soft woolen rug blankets the floor underfoot.  A large spinning wheel stands at the back of the parlor, while a large workbench and padded chair rest nearby, providing a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail."],"exits":[{"to":843,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Spinning2"]},
  {"id":852,"x":-102,"y":-289,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Outfitting Society, Spinning Parlor","descriptions":["A vast tapestry of hearty rose blossoms hangs upon one of the painted coral walls, while a soft woolen rug blankets the floor underfoot.  A large spinning wheel stands at the back of the parlor, while a large workbench and padded chair rest nearby, providing a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail."],"exits":[{"to":843,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Spinning3"]},
  {"id":853,"x":-309,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Main Hall","descriptions":["Whitewashed walls surround the hall, a series of nautical items hung at various points around the room.  Wide wooden planks underfoot creak under the weight of large stone slabs that stand nearby, each awaiting inspection, while smaller carts of bone and wood are pushed under tarps to protect them from the salty air.  A stern overseer keeps a close eye on things, barking at his associate when a new delivery arrives or needs moving.  A wide stairway leads downward, further into the society, while a large waste bucket rests nearby."],"exits":[{"to":855,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":854,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":856,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood doors"}],"aliases":["Engineering Deeds","Engineering Society"]},
  {"id":854,"x":-319,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Office","descriptions":["At the far end of the small office is a stately desk piled with parchments and several ledgers, a built-in bookcase beyond overflowing with rows of books and personal trinkets.  Hung beneath a pair of crossed, sun bleached oars, a large chalkboard details several of the society's stone shipments, while a trio of decorative pilings stands in a nearby corner."],"exits":[{"to":853,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":855,"x":-299,"y":141,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Repair and Storage","descriptions":["A heavy rope net drapes from the ceiling overhead, while a sweeping potted palm stands in a nearby corner of the brightly painted shop.  The discarded hull of a dingy has been shaped into a counter for the Dwarven attendant, where he busies himself with the task of repairing tools and tending to the stored goods on the shelves behind him."],"exits":[{"to":853,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Engineering Clerk"]},
  {"id":856,"x":-309,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Hallway","descriptions":["The long hallway echoes with a variety of clinks and clanks in the distance, while attendants bustle back and forth with deed orders.  Brass lanterns hung overhead provide a minimal amount light, enough to indicate entrances to the east and west, along with the stairs that lead up to the main floor of the society."],"exits":[{"to":859,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":858,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":857,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":853,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Engineering Prestige"]},
  {"id":857,"x":-319,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Depot","descriptions":["Several heavy blocks of marble and alabaster rest at various points along the painted brick walls, while additional shelves and tables hold a wide selection of bone and stone.  Several stout workmen grunt under the weight of the rough-hewn crates they heft through the busy shop to the backroom."],"exits":[{"to":856,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Supplies"]},
  {"id":858,"x":-299,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Crafting Supplies","descriptions":["An ornate stone pedestal at the center of the room displays a brass astrolabe and mistwood telescope, highlighted by a large brass lantern overhead.  Workers periodically wander in and out, restocking the items held by the many baskets and shelves along the surrounding walls, while a nearby attendant sees to the craftsmen who stop by in need of supplies."],"exits":[{"to":856,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Tools"]},
  {"id":859,"x":-309,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Artisans and attendants bustle throughout the area, the varied sounds of craftsmen echoing along the long hallway.  Brass lanterns overhead highlight the compass pattern in the brick floor underfoot, while a trio of doors lead into several workshops where many perfect their craft."],"exits":[{"to":856,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":860,"exit":"go","move":"go western door"},{"to":861,"exit":"go","move":"go northern door"},{"to":862,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Books"]},
  {"id":860,"x":-319,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["A vibrant mural detailing crashing waves upon a rocky shoreline surrounds the workshop, the brass lanterns overhead providing additional lighting during the evening hours.  Unfinished stone furniture, statues and more are spread across the surfaces of the dozens of reinforced tables that form neat rows along the length of the room.  Several artisans pour over their creations, while attendants haul away other pieces too large to carry with an overhead system of pulleys and chains, storing them for later retrieval."],"exits":[{"to":859,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":861,"x":-309,"y":111,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["A vibrant mural detailing several galleons of the Redthorne fleet surrounds the workshop, the brass lanterns overhead providing additional lighting during the evening hours.  Unfinished stone furniture, statues and more are spread across the surfaces of the dozens of reinforced tables that form neat rows along the length of the room.  Several artisans pour over their creations, while attendants haul away other pieces too large to carry with an overhead system of pulleys and chains, storing them for later retrieval."],"exits":[{"to":859,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":862,"x":-299,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["A vibrant nautical mural surrounds the workshop, the brass lanterns overhead providing additional lighting during the evening hours.  Unfinished stone furniture, statues and more are spread across the surfaces of the dozens of reinforced tables that form neat rows along the length of the room.  Several artisans pour over their creations, while attendants haul away other pieces too large to carry with an overhead system of pulleys and chains, storing them for later retrieval."],"exits":[{"to":859,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":863,"x":98,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Foyer","descriptions":["Vibrant silks drape the polished granite walls amid the many potted plants that decorate the broad foyer.  Marbled gaethzen orbs hang overhead, highlighting a pair of thickly-padded benches that surround a low table at the center of the room.  A busy clerk tends to the many artisans that visit the society from behind a sturdy counter with a small placard on it."],"exits":[{"to":865,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":864,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":866,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad stairway"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Society","Alchemy Prestige"]},
  {"id":864,"x":78,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Supply Shop","descriptions":["A vast array of colorful baskets and earthenware surround the shop, their essences mingling into a variety of sweet, musky scents.  Brass oil lamps dangling overhead cast a soft glow over the wide counter below as several society workers tend to restocking and taking care of the needs of crafters."],"exits":[{"to":863,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Supplies"]},
  {"id":865,"x":118,"y":121,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Tool Depot","descriptions":["Several decorative bamboo shelves line the polished granite walls of the small shop, each displaying a variety of alchemical tools.  Standing behind a broad counter, a young Elven lass greets the many crafters who stop to make their purchases."],"exits":[{"to":863,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Tools"]},
  {"id":866,"x":98,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Gathering Hall","descriptions":["Brass oil lamps overhead illuminate the surrounding polished granite, the walls spidered with clinging ivy that spills from planters cut into the dense stone near the ceiling.  Colorful woven mats decorate the floor amid the rattan chairs, providing a place where many of the crafters rest and share their ideas."],"exits":[{"to":869,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":868,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":867,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":863,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad stairway"}]},
  {"id":867,"x":78,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Book Store","descriptions":["A small shelf advertising available alchemical books sits below a chart on alchemical techniques on one side of the small enclosure, while the other side an exhausted clerk notes work order completions on a board."],"exits":[{"to":866,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Books"]},
  {"id":868,"x":118,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Office","descriptions":["Polished granite walls hung with clusters of dried herbs surround the small office, lit by a single brass lantern overhead.  A large desk and chair stand in one corner, overlooking a pair of perpendicular workbenches covered with various tools of the trade."],"exits":[{"to":866,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":869,"x":98,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Slender brass planters mounted near the ceiling overflow with a variety of ivy plants, a few of their long tendrils clinging to the brightly painted granite walls.  Framed specimens of pressed herbs dot the length of the corridor beneath ornately jeweled sconces, each displayed in an artful arrangement.  An alabaster statue stands in a nearby corner, the maiden's urn spilling over with rich purple shalyria blossoms that scent the long corridor."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":866,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":870,"x":118,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Slender brass planters mounted near the ceiling overflow with a variety of ivy plants, a few of their long tendrils clinging to the brightly painted granite walls.  A pair of ornately carved benches rest against the walls between the archways, their seats thinly padded and tossed with decorative pillows."],"exits":[{"to":869,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":872,"exit":"go","move":"go peregan archway"},{"to":873,"exit":"go","move":"go copperwood archway"},{"to":874,"exit":"go","move":"go tamarind archway"}]},
  {"id":871,"x":178,"y":461,"z":1,"title":"Ratha, Hidden Dock","descriptions":["Tucked behind one of the run-down warehouses, the dock seems to be mostly in disuse.  However, a few newer looking ropes and boxes stacked up at the end of the pier indicate that it's not entirely abandoned.  Sea waves lap against the wooden posts at the end of the dock in a constant back and forth."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go warehouse"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Hidden Dock","Basalt Isle"]},
  {"id":872,"x":138,"y":61,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["Carved out of dense granite, the laboratory holds a set of alchemical equipment scattered at various points about the room.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for deadly gasses to be released out of the area, while an archway out affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"out","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Dryer"]},
  {"id":873,"x":138,"y":81,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["Carved out of dense granite, the laboratory holds a set of alchemical equipment scattered at various points about the room.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for deadly gasses to be released out of the area, while an archway out affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"out","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Dryer"]},
  {"id":874,"x":138,"y":101,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["Carved out of dense granite, the laboratory holds a set of alchemical equipment scattered at various points about the room.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for deadly gasses to be released out of the area, while an archway out affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"out","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Dryer"]},
  {"id":875,"x":-3,"y":359,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rundmolen Post Office","descriptions":["Tucked away in a corner of the square is a wide stone counter set into the conical carousel beneath a wooden awning.  Spread across the awning's underside is a sweeping mural of a summer sky, with realistic white clouds set against a cerulean blue expanse.  Vast, countless rows of differently sized shelves are behind the counter, and complex Dwarven mechanisms can be heard as they rearrange the package-covered storage.  Clerks shuffle endlessly back and forth between the counters and shelving as they assist patrons with their packaging and mailing needs."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Post Office","mail"]},
  {"id":876,"x":-232,"y":-730,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Lounge","descriptions":["Thick stone walls muffle the sounds of the world outside of the guildhall, creating a sense of peace.  Thickly-cushioned chairs form a circle around a small oak table, its surface scarred by heated debates of the past.  An oak door in the south wall is carved with the havri'negh symbol."],"exits":[{"to":561,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":877,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":878,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["WM Lounge","havri'negh"]},
  {"id":877,"x":-232,"y":-740,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Library","descriptions":["Long tables and padded benches of dark rosewood fill the room, their surfaces polished smooth from years of use.  Two beveled-glass doors lead out onto a balcony which overlooks the tier's edge.  Strategically placed lamps cast a gentle glow on the rows of books lining the bookshelves."],"exits":[{"to":876,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":879,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["WM Library","WM Grimoire"]},
  {"id":878,"x":-242,"y":-730,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Targeting Range","descriptions":["Set above the salle, the targeting range was created to train Warrior Mages in the most effective ways to disable their opponents with magic.  The stone walls are scarred by blasts of fire and warped by lightning strikes.  A slightly singed banner hangs on one side of the room."],"exits":[{"to":876,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["WM Target Range"]},
  {"id":879,"x":-232,"y":-750,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Balcony","descriptions":["An elaborately carved stone balustrade is the only barrier between the guildhall and the sheer drop that separates the tiers.  Spreading out below is the vast expanse of the lower tiers, and the limitless depths of the ocean.  A pair of beveled-glass doors lead back into the guild proper."],"exits":[{"to":877,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":880,"x":278,"y":-659,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, The Rusted Tumbler","descriptions":["The rough-hewn wooden walls of the lean-to tilt at uneven angles, the packed dirt floor worn smooth in places and scuffed in others.  Daylight filters through gaps in the patched canvas roof, illuminating drifting dust motes.  A crooked, scratched table displays a rusted lantern and scattered metal bits, while the air carries the tang of salt and the ubiquitous stench of rotting rubbish."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"go","move":"go irregular opening"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Rusted Tumbler","lockpicks"]},
  {"id":881,"x":-382,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rocky Shore","descriptions":["Below the shadow of the rickety buildings and warehouses of the city, a steep, rugged shore leads down into the shallows.  Rocks jut out along the coastline, while ocean waves rush past with frothy white peaks to crash along the cliffs.  Off in the distance, caught on the sharp crags is an abandoned ship, lying partially on its side.  The shallows themselves seem traversable between the rocks and the bluffs, the obstacles helping to keep the undertow in check."],"exits":[{"to":882,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":96,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow gap"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":882,"x":-422,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rocky Shallows","descriptions":["Waves rush by on their way to the shore, randomly pushing through as much as thigh-deep on a Human, pulling back to just covering the ankles.  The smell of brine and fish is heavy here, and the steady sea breeze feels soft from all the salt in the air.  The faint, sometimes ghostly light of the nighttime sky skips along the water, leaving patches of sparkle on the otherwise dark and rolling surface.","Waves rush by on their way to the shore, randomly pushing through as much as thigh-deep on a Human, pulling back to just covering the ankles.  The smell of brine and fish is heavy here, and the steady sea breeze feels soft from all the salt in the air.  Seagulls dive across the waves in the distance, sometimes braking to light on the rocks and look out towards the sea."],"exits":[{"to":881,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":883,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":887,"exit":"go","move":"go sea cave"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":883,"x":-442,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rocky Shallows","descriptions":["Tiny eddies form behind the spiked rocks, swirling pools of murky water within the constant movement of the ocean.  In the distance is the ominous shadow of a wrecked ship, a disturbing reminder of the perils of sea travel.  Above, alongside the cliffs towards the east are the ramshackle warehouses that mark the edge of the city, a gloomy enough sight in itself."],"exits":[{"to":882,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":884,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":884,"x":-462,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rocky Shallows","descriptions":["Off in the distance beyond the rolling waves that crash against the coast, the remains of the ship once known as the Seerah cast a ghost-like shadow against the waters.  Sharp narrow crags line the shallows, causing a treacherous path for any boat unlucky enough to travel too close to the shoreline.  The strong current pulls back and forth against one's feet, rushing to shore with an energy all of its own.","Off in the distance beyond the rolling waves that crash against the coast, the remains of the ship once known as the Seerah bleach from the constant battering of the waves and the elements.  Knife-like crags line the shallows, causing a treacherous path for any boat unlucky enough to travel too close to the shoreline.  The strong current pulls back and forth against one's feet, rushing to shore with an energy all of its own."],"exits":[{"to":883,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":885,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"},{"to":900,"exit":"go","move":"go sea cave"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":885,"x":-482,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Rocky Shallows","descriptions":["The sea winds whip across the cliffs, helping to push the waves against the crowns of the jagged rocks, launching bursts of water that spray out into stinging, salty ocean air.  To the west lies the shadow of a large ship, impaled upon the rocks as if being displayed as a trophy of Drogor's wrath."],"exits":[{"to":884,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":886,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":886,"x":-522,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Wreck of the Seerah","descriptions":["Snagged upon the large jagged rocks of the ironbound coast, the remnants of a past glory lie within the bowels of the ship once known as the Seerah.  Ocean waves slap along the sides as they race towards the cliff-lined shores, the craft unbudging from its impaled position.  The doomed vessel has been beached at a steep angle with its foremast lying between the boulders, the rotting wood slippery with moss.  No other masts seem to have survived the perilous last voyage."],"exits":[{"to":885,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":904,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cliff opening"},{"to":905,"exit":"climb","move":"climb foremast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":887,"x":-422,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Like the inside of a shell, the sounds of the sea and the air move through the drafty cave and create strange, hollow echoes in the natural corridors under the cliff.  Water laps in from the opening, but a thick sediment has built up from higher tides, a haphazard barrier that helps to keep the waves in check."],"exits":[{"to":888,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":898,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":882,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}]},
  {"id":888,"x":-402,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Smells of brine, sand and silt saturate the curving passage, so strongly it clings to the lips with bitter flavor.  Occasionally a heavy ocean breeze drafts in from the west, vibrating along with the waves in the tight confines of the cave."],"exits":[{"to":889,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":887,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":889,"x":-402,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Fine, dry sand covers the floor of the cave in a thick blanket, curiously fresh and unpacked, as if it had been laid there on purpose.  A weakened breeze draws through the cave from the south, brushing the sand and whisking away any marks that might have been left behind by intruders."],"exits":[{"to":890,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":888,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":897,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":890,"x":-402,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Granite walls smoothed over by sand-filled breezes encase this niche, providing reassuring support under the weight of the imposing cliffs.  Soft echoes chime through the area from the caverns beyond, whispering the secrets of the sea."],"exits":[{"to":889,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":891,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":891,"x":-422,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Piles of limestone and sandstone rubble lie along the northern and eastern walls of this damp cavern, left behind from the collapsed southern wall and pushed aside in an attempt to clear a passage from the west to the southeast.  White, slightly damp sand blankets the ground, barely visible in the dim light coming from the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":890,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":896,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":892,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":892,"x":-462,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Packed wet sand fills the floor of the corridor, sticking to the granite walls like clumps of moss.  Water seeps in from a small crack along the bottom of the southern wall, bubbling out rank, filthy seawater that is slurped up by the sand."],"exits":[{"to":891,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":893,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":893,"x":-502,"y":421,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["The sand here is unusually dry and loose compared to the rest of the cavern, sparkling with unnatural light.  The sand seems extremely deep and is difficult to walk on, but somehow manages to hold the weight enough so that anyone attempting to traverse it doesn't sink any further down than their ankles.  To the southeast, the ground dips down slightly and disappears into a cavern of murky water."],"exits":[{"to":892,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":894,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":894,"x":-482,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Shallow sandy water fills the cavern as it dips slightly below the water table, filling the area with the nauseatingly strong smell of brine.  Gentle breezes enter from the northwest but do little to relieve the stench from the stagnant air."],"exits":[{"to":895,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":893,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":895,"x":-462,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Shallow sandy water fills the cavern as it dips slightly below the water table, filling the area with the nauseatingly strong smell of brine.  To the north, the ground rises slightly into a wet, sandy cavern, while the other two directions promise little relief from the stench."],"exits":[{"to":896,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":894,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"},{"to":909,"exit":"go","move":"go sandy cavern"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":896,"x":-442,"y":441,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Shallow sandy water fills the cavern as it dips slightly below the water table, filling the area with the nauseatingly strong smell of brine.  Gentle breezes enter from the northeast but do little to relieve the stagnant air."],"exits":[{"to":891,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":895,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":897,"x":-422,"y":461,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Narrow and jagged, this small natural alcove is covered with odd, deformed stalactites and stalagmites, thin needles that hang from above and lumps that poke up out of the sand below.  The cracked ceiling is extremely damp, and water condenses into little beaded droplets that slide down the mineral formations, dropping off and hitting the stalagmites with a maddening, resonating, drip, drip, dripping sound."],"exits":[{"to":889,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":898,"x":-442,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["A brisk breeze twists around the echoing caverns, carrying the smell of fish and brine away with the wind.  Cloaked with an eroding wall of sandstone, a thick layer of granite is exposed behind the large, damp fissures that mar the surface of the cave."],"exits":[{"to":887,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":899,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":899,"x":-442,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["The sound of slowly dripping water reverberates through the cave, an elusive but persistent noise that can be easily heard over the murmuring waves and the moan of the wind through the tunnels.  The ceiling dips down slightly in the center of the passage, making it difficult for the taller races to walk through comfortably."],"exits":[{"to":898,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":900,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":900,"x":-462,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Salt water moves through the opening with the tides, making tiny pools in the natural crevices in the floor of the cave.  Strange voices resound within the hollow shelter beneath the cliffs, speaking in a melodic language that matches the rhythm of the waves."],"exits":[{"to":899,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":901,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":884,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}]},
  {"id":901,"x":-482,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Rushing echoes, louder than standing under a waterfall, boom through the room on a mad course as the natural acoustics of this room give added dimension to the ear-splitting crashing of the waves.  Dim light filters in from a flue-like passage leading upward, causing the sandstone walls to glint and sparkle as if encrusted with gems."],"exits":[{"to":900,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":902,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":903,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":902,"x":-502,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Nestled away from the rest of the cavern system, this low, rounded cubbyhole is relatively quiet, with only the soft whispers of the wind and sea filtering through the room from the east.  Delicate sea mosses cling to the rocky walls, blanketing fissures opened by small trickles of seawater that seep in as waves crash against the outside of the cave."],"exits":[{"to":901,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":903,"x":-482,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Strong wind, light and sounds of the waves surge through the cramped tunnel, heading down the slope into the caverns.  To the west, the tunnel opens up into a cavern that looks over the sea."],"exits":[{"to":904,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":901,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":904,"x":-522,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Taph'botuk","descriptions":["Blossoming out into a fantastic vista of the sea, a large opening looks out into the night, acting as a natural balcony.  Scorched driftwood lies on darkened sand in the center of the cave, as if someone had tried to camp here and left in a hurry.","Blossoming out into a fantastic vista of the sea, a large opening looks out into the daylight, acting as a natural balcony.  Scorched driftwood lies on darkened sand in the center of the cave, as if someone had tried to camp here and left in a hurry."],"exits":[{"to":903,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":886,"exit":"climb","move":"climb natural opening"}]},
  {"id":905,"x":-562,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Foredeck","descriptions":["Rusted chains, frayed rope, and fragments of wood litter the foredeck, the debris scattered across the slanting ship.  With its weight crushing the sea-torn starboard rails, the giant foremast provides a bridge between the ship and the shallows, its upper portion now partly wedged in the rocks like a toothpick between the teeth.  Occasionally a fierce wave crashes against the creaking vessel, spraying it with water but doing little to move the ship from its impaled position."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":907,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":886,"exit":"climb","move":"climb foremast"},{"to":910,"exit":"climb","move":"climb leaning steps"}]},
  {"id":906,"x":-562,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Prow","descriptions":["Heavily pitched mahogany rails along the foredeck of the ship converge on the pulpit just above the headless figurehead.  Rusted chains and debris litter the area, most piled upon the lower eastern end of the prow.  Occasional spray slickens the deck, making it slightly hazardous.  Nestled between the rails is a small shrine, constructed from sea stones and hardened sand."],"exits":[{"to":905,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":907,"x":-562,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Main Deck","descriptions":["Securely nailed, a row of small tables lines the port side main deck, slanting in unison with the angle of the ship as if their battered surfaces were bowing to the cliff-lined coast.  Large sections of greying planks show through chipped white paint, and disturbingly large cracks cross the wood from the stress of the crash.  In the center, the remains of the main mast stick out like a jagged spike."],"exits":[{"to":905,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":908,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":908,"x":-562,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Quarterdeck","descriptions":["Splitting through the deck like a giant tree stump are the remains of the mizzenmast.  Its once proud sails have long since disappeared, leaving only rusted rings, wood splinters, and rope fragments to remember them by.  A narrow, steep stairs matches the deck's angle, making them a little trickier to navigate."],"exits":[{"to":907,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":913,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sideways steps"},{"to":915,"exit":"climb","move":"climb angled stairs"}]},
  {"id":909,"x":-482,"y":481,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Lower Taph'botuk, Quicksand Pit","descriptions":["The circular cavern is filled with waterlogged sand causing anything that touches it to immediately start sinking into its ravenous depths.  Light seems to fail here, as if a deep foreboding has permanently settled in the room, strangling any hope of ever leaving the cavern alive."],"exits":[{"to":895,"exit":"go","move":"go shallow water"}],"color":"#FFFF00"},
  {"id":910,"x":-602,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Joined to the veranda-like upper deck, the heavily sloped bulkhead supports the frame of the foredeck above.  Large empty casks stained with wine are lashed together with frayed rope to either side of a large door leading into the forward rooms.  Flanking it on either side are oddly leaning steps, offering a precarious way up."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":905,"exit":"climb","move":"climb leaning steps"},{"to":927,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}]},
  {"id":911,"x":-602,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["The stump of the main mast pushes up from the deck, marking the amidships point of the vessel.  Large rusting rotting winches wait with little purpose now for the sails of the vessel that will never be raised again."],"exits":[{"to":910,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":912,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":917,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":914,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":912,"x":-602,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["To the north, forward on the ship, the remains of the main mast stick up through the deck like the back side of a nail, its splintered timber blasted by the forces of nature.  A narrow doorway leads into a small officers' quarters, the unnatural tilt to the ship making it a little difficult to walk through."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":915,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":913,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":920,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"}]},
  {"id":913,"x":-582,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Salty ocean spray saturates the deck as waves bank off the rock that holds the ship.  More effective than any anchor, the dark rock clings to the vessel like the pincer of a crab, holding it firmly in a timeless grasp.  Warped pin rails angle toward the coast, the damaged brass trim coating them with an unwholesome green tinge."],"exits":[{"to":914,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":912,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":908,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sideways steps"}]},
  {"id":914,"x":-582,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Tossed and tangled ropes and line are strewn about the deck near the starboard gunwale, mixed with rusting equipment tossed out of several overturned buckets.  To the east a circular hole provides a view of the rocky shoreline."],"exits":[{"to":913,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":911,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":915,"x":-622,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Encased in pitched mahogany is a series of rooms with rusty yet detailed ironwork that betrays the former elegance of this bleak deck.  Streaks of green stain the wood and coat the pin rails along the bulkhead."],"exits":[{"to":916,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":912,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":918,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":908,"exit":"climb","move":"climb angled stairs"}]},
  {"id":916,"x":-622,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Splintering benches are nailed to the deck, looking out and up towards the sky.  Some of the benches have lost planks, and one has lost a leg, long since reclaimed by the sea."],"exits":[{"to":917,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":915,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":917,"x":-622,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck","descriptions":["Ocean spray splashes into the air as waves crash against the hull -- only the steep angle of the ship protects the port gunwale from a constant drenching.  Pin rails line the deck, some of them tied with the unraveled remains of rope and lines, bleached and tangled like an old crone's hair."],"exits":[{"to":916,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":911,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":921,"exit":"go","move":"go cargo hatch"}]},
  {"id":918,"x":-642,"y":701,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck, Captain's Quarters","descriptions":["This anteroom has obviously seen better days, its once stylish layout and expensive furniture tossed and battered.  Several moldy books remain strapped in place on a dully-veneered bookshelf clinging to the port wall.  A folded punee is latched to the wall on the other side, while a small side table with a broken leg rests near an aft-facing porthole."],"exits":[{"to":919,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":915,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":919,"x":-622,"y":701,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck, Captain's Quarters","descriptions":["Darkened and shredded fabric covers the walls of this devastated dining suite.  The round top of the halmik dining table has been snapped in two by a small writing desk, lying overturned between the sundered pieces as if thrown by some extreme force.  Scorch marks scuff the floors below a smattering of shards made up of pottery and glass.  Only the quality of the wood and elegance of the rotting fabrics betrays a once proud and ornate interior."],"exits":[{"to":918,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":920,"x":-602,"y":701,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck, Officers' Quarters","descriptions":["Smeared moldy charts and maps litter the floor as a trickle of water seeps over them, leaking from a crack in the seal around a small porthole.  The angle of the deck has caused the beds and chairs to slide to the lower eastern side, and only a large footlocker remains against the upper wall.  Strange creaks and groans echo through the room making it feel like the boat will split at any moment."],"exits":[{"to":912,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"}]},
  {"id":921,"x":-662,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Submerged Roi Deck, Forward Cargo","descriptions":["Filtered light streams down from the top of a submerged stairway, dimly illuminating the flooded cargo hold.  Strange echoes sound in the water throughout the huge hold, and in the water it's entirely impossible to tell where the sounds are coming from.  Cables and nets still cling to the moss covered sides and ceiling, carrying cargo that has long passed the point of being identifiable."],"exits":[{"to":922,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":917,"exit":"go","move":"go submerged stair"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":922,"x":-662,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Submerged Roi Deck, Steerage","descriptions":["Smack in the belly of the ship, the steerage compartment is built around the still intact base of the main mast.  The frames of several bunks line the bulkheads below a series of iron shelves, seriously corroded in the salty water.  The light is extremely dim, the ghostly illumination entering from the forward hold.  Debris covers the floor, coated with a blanket of sea moss that thrives in the somewhat protected environment."],"exits":[{"to":921,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":923,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":923,"x":-662,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Submerged Roi Deck, Corridor","descriptions":["The corridor is dark and eerie as the hollow, underwater sounds travel through the passage.  Doorways lead up on the northern side and down on the southern side, into even darker waters."],"exits":[{"to":922,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":924,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"},{"to":925,"exit":"down","move":"swim down"}],"color":"#000080"},
  {"id":924,"x":-642,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Roi Deck, Aft Storage","descriptions":["Large cargo nets float in the water, attached to pivots near the ceiling.  Along the floor, coils of rope are strewn out below a blanket of moss, resembling snakes under a furry carpet."],"exits":[{"to":923,"exit":"down","move":"swim down"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":925,"x":-662,"y":701,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Submerged Roi Deck, Brig","descriptions":["This small room was once used as the brig, its cell in the lower portion of the room.  The cell door has been slung open, its iron bars white and corroded.  Tiny spores float in the dark water and collect on the inside walls of the compartment."],"exits":[{"to":923,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"},{"to":926,"exit":"down","move":"swim down"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":926,"x":-662,"y":721,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Roi Deck, Brig Cell","descriptions":["A section of rock has erupted through the aft side of the cell, making the cramped space even tighter than before the crash.  Spawning in the tiny yet secure area, a hungry-looking bed of fang oysters spreads out over the floor, helping to keep the water in the area relatively clear."],"exits":[{"to":925,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"}],"color":"#000080","aliases":["Oyster Room"]},
  {"id":927,"x":-622,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Zo Deck, Galley","descriptions":["A large room punctuated by the stem of the foremast is filled with overturned tables and benches, covered with broken pottery and flatware.  Burnt-out hurricane lamps hang on hooks fastened close to the ceiling, away from two large portholes on either side of the room.  The walls are marred with scratches and holes, and a couple of telltale forks are stuck deep in the wall."],"exits":[{"to":910,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":910,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"},{"to":928,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stairs"}]},
  {"id":928,"x":-702,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Corridor","descriptions":["The amidships corridor stretches on in darkness, flanked by a succession of broken lanterns.  All the cabins on the lower starboard side of the ship are heavily flooded, and the stench of the sea is prevalent through the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":929,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":933,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":934,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":927,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stairs"},{"to":941,"exit":"go","move":"go flooded stairwell"}]},
  {"id":929,"x":-702,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Corridor","descriptions":["The amidships corridor stretches on in darkness, flanked by a succession of broken lanterns.  All the cabins on the lower starboard side of the ship are heavily flooded, and the stench of the sea is prevalent through the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":928,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":930,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":935,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":936,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":930,"x":-702,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Corridor","descriptions":["The amidships corridor stretches on in darkness, flanked by a succession of broken lanterns.  All the cabins on the lower starboard side of the ship are heavily flooded, and the stench of the sea is prevalent through the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":929,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":931,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":937,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":938,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":931,"x":-702,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Corridor","descriptions":["The amidships corridor stretches on in darkness, flanked by a succession of broken lanterns.  All the cabins on the lower starboard side of the ship are heavily flooded, and the stench of the sea is prevalent through the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":930,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":932,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":939,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":940,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":932,"x":-702,"y":701,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Recreation Room","descriptions":["Surrounding the post of the mizzenmast, this large room is damp and dreary.  Scattered on the floor amidst broken tables are ruined cards, darts, paper and games.  A small warped stage is covered with ripped charts and scrolls, tossed out of low bookshelves nailed to the starboard wall."],"exits":[{"to":931,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":933,"x":-682,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Slanted Cabin","descriptions":["The simple furniture of a bed and overturned chair have slid down to lean on the lower wall, and only a small table, securely nailed to the floor, remains in place.  Other than the debris of broken lanterns and tossed plain linens from the tiny bed, the room is free from damage."],"exits":[{"to":928,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":934,"x":-722,"y":621,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Flooded Cabin","descriptions":["Originally meant to provide some comfort and privacy for guests aboard, this dark and tiny cabin has turned into an example of the dangers of the sea.  Rotten wood floats in the murky water standing in the eastern half of the room, and the air is filled with the stench of mold, soured linens and brackish water."],"exits":[{"to":928,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":935,"x":-682,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Slanted Cabin","descriptions":["The simple furniture of a bed and overturned chair have slid down to lean on the lower wall, and only a small table, securely nailed to the floor, remains in place.  Other than the debris of broken lanterns and tossed plain linens from the tiny bed, the room is free from damage."],"exits":[{"to":929,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":936,"x":-722,"y":641,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Flooded Cabin","descriptions":["Originally meant to provide some comfort and privacy for guests aboard, this dark and tiny cabin has turned into an example of the dangers of the sea.  Rotten wood floats in the murky water standing in the eastern half of the room, and the air is filled with the stench of mold, soured linens and brackish water."],"exits":[{"to":929,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":937,"x":-682,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Slanted Cabin","descriptions":["The simple furniture of a bed and overturned chair have slid down to lean on the lower wall, and only a small table, securely nailed to the floor, remains in place.  Other than the debris of broken lanterns and tossed plain linens from the tiny bed, the room is free from damage."],"exits":[{"to":930,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":938,"x":-722,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Flooded Cabin","descriptions":["Originally meant to provide some comfort and privacy for guests aboard, this dark and tiny cabin has turned into an example of the dangers of the sea.  Rotten wood floats in the murky water standing in the eastern half of the room, and the air is filled with the stench of mold, soured linens and brackish water."],"exits":[{"to":930,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":939,"x":-682,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Slanted Cabin","descriptions":["The simple furniture of a bed and overturned chair have slid down to lean on the lower wall, and only a small table, securely nailed to the floor, remains in place.  Other than the debris of broken lanterns and tossed plain linens from the tiny bed, the room is free from damage."],"exits":[{"to":931,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":940,"x":-722,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Do Deck, Flooded Cabin","descriptions":["Originally meant to provide some comfort and privacy for guests aboard, this dark and tiny cabin has turned into an example of the dangers of the sea.  Rotten wood floats in the murky water standing in the eastern half of the room, and the air is filled with the stench of mold, soured linens and brackish water."],"exits":[{"to":931,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":941,"x":-722,"y":601,"z":0,"title":"The Seerah, Roi Deck, Submerged Galley Storage","descriptions":["The water here is extremely murky, filled with barrels that float near the ceiling of the room.  Dim light filters in from above, glinting off of glass and rusting pots and pans and utensils once used to feed hungry sailors."],"exits":[{"to":928,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":942,"x":-562,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandsprite Lair","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","Mounds of dry white sand fill the expansive cavern, fashioned into small burrows.  Neatly groomed paths split off in opposite directions, heading further into the sand mounds.  Above, the ceiling looks strangely unstable, its sandy surface moving in waves as if held back by an unseen force.  Chilling breezes drift through the cavern, slightly bitter with the smell of brine."],"exits":[{"to":943,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":949,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FFFF00"},
  {"id":943,"x":-542,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandsprite Lair","descriptions":["Mosses and sand-loving grasses fill a large portion of the cavern, fed by a trickle of water that seeps from the northern wall and trickles into the sandy ground below.  Carefully raked sand provides a path around the garden.  A tall dune has been built to partially block off the southwestern cavern, as if attempting to protect the crop of mosses from whatever lies beyond its border."],"exits":[{"to":944,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":942,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":944,"x":-562,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandcrab Lair","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","Large, half-filled holes of wet sand have been burrowed into the ground around the rocky cavern.  Groomed sand paths stretch through the area beside long ditches of irrigating water.  Strange clicking noises can be heard from every direction, betraying the presence of the crabs that are apparently being corralled here."],"exits":[{"to":943,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":945,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":945,"x":-542,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandcrab Lair","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","A large rock formation stands in the center of the room, encircled by a groomed sandy path.  Warm air drifts in from the east, while from the south comes the stench of brine.  Several sand-burrowed holes litter the floor, some of them coming up to the very edge of the pathways."],"exits":[{"to":946,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":947,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":944,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":946,"x":-522,"y":541,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandcrab Hatchery","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","Tiny energetic baby crabs skitter across the floor of this small cavern, some of them swimming in a small pool of water in the center of the room.  Fresh algae and underground plants cling to the sides of the room and along the bottom of the pool, giving the newly hatched crabs plenty of fresh food.  A detailed sand sculpture stands in front of the cavern entrance in the shape of a sand sprite holding out her hands."],"exits":[{"to":945,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":947,"x":-542,"y":561,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandcrab Lair","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","Cold, damp air wafts in from the southwest, settling over the clumped wet sand and glistening over rubble fallen from the rocky walls.  Dainty footprints crisscross over the wet sand, accompanied by the much smaller, prong-like prints of sand crabs."],"exits":[{"to":945,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":948,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":948,"x":-562,"y":581,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandcrab Lair","descriptions":["A large pool of water takes up most of the cavern, filled with tiny fish and plants, providing a comfortable feeding area for the sand crabs.  The room is filled with the smell of the sea, and a dull hollow sound seems to echo from behind the thick granite walls."],"exits":[{"to":947,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":949,"x":-582,"y":521,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandsprite Lair","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","Dry white sand sifts onto the path from great mounds along the western wall, marring its neatly smoothed appearance.  Fragrant mosses cling to the walls, helping to freshen the heavy cavern air."],"exits":[{"to":950,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":942,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":952,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":950,"x":-562,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandsprite Lair","descriptions":["Mounds of sand lie to either side of a freshly groomed path.  Along the walls, lush algae and moss thrive in the cool, damp cavern, helping to keep the air clean.  Fresh spring water seeps from the walls beneath the algae, filling a small shell basin that has been cleverly designed to capture it."],"exits":[{"to":951,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":949,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":951,"x":-542,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sandsprite Lair","descriptions":["Shells and coral have been stacked into piles here, along with freshly gathered seaweed.  The small, chilly cavern is apparently being used as a community storage room, filled with sand-crafted bowls of live fish, gathered mosses and other supplies."],"exits":[{"to":950,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":952,"x":-602,"y":501,"z":0,"title":"Lower Taph'botuk, Sand Pile","descriptions":["It's pitch dark and you can't see a thing!","The cavern is filled with a large cone of fresh sand that reaches the ceiling, making the cylindrical room feel like the bottom of an hourglass.  Curiously, the ceiling of sand seems suspended in place by some unknown force, sometimes weakening enough to release a light dusting of sand to rain down, adding to the pile below."],"exits":[{"to":949,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":893,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sand pile"}]},
  {"id":953,"x":598,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["From above, the swirling vortex of tile is incredibly lifelike, threatening to pull observers from the narrow walkway.  The thin ledge of shell has a slightly unnerving resiliency that belies its strength.  Just before dropping off into the eye of the whirlpool, it turns up through a natural opening in the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":954,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":955,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":954,"x":598,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["A slender spiraled horn of iridescence rises from the top of the guildhall to meet the sky.  Below, the island spreads out to the south and the lagoon is no more than a small puddle splashed upon the shore.  A narrow railing of brass guards the careless observer."],"exits":[{"to":953,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Erekinzil","Shard","Ways","Grazhir"]},
  {"id":955,"x":598,"y":-349,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["The flood of blue and white spirals into the chamber and a mosaic whirlpool threatens to engulf those seeking knowledge as they cross the hall to the lectern of Guildmaster.  A natural curl of the shell curves up around the outer wall to an opening far above."],"exits":[{"to":956,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":953,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Moon Mage","Lomtaun","RS Moon Mage"]},
  {"id":956,"x":598,"y":-329,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["The wash of water closes in overhead and begins to turn in a dizzying funnel of waves.  Tiny fish of silver and gold are swept along with the maelstrom as it pours into a central chamber."],"exits":[{"to":955,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":957,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":957,"x":658,"y":-349,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["Waves of azure rise up along the walls, threatening to engulf the passage as it funnels further into the heights of the guildhall.  Flecks of silver upon the blue, sparkle like tiny grains of sand caught in the fury of the rushing water."],"exits":[{"to":956,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":958,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":958,"x":638,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["The glistening mosaic of tiles begins to rise on either side of the passage, covering the lower section of wall with whitecaps.  The passage glides upward and around another turn in the spiral of the shell to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":957,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":959,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":959,"x":618,"y":-349,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["The salt-scented breeze along the corridor picks up as the grade of the climb increases, adding a slight chill to the air.  The walk passes another sweeping arch into the heart of the guild that has been boarded over."],"exits":[{"to":958,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":960,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":960,"x":638,"y":-329,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["Overlooking the high bluffs along the western coast of the isle, a tall window whispers sea songs to passersby.  The corridor narrows even further as it ascends, but still not quite enough to make two-way foot traffic a problem."],"exits":[{"to":961,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":959,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":961,"x":718,"y":-329,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["A small section of the outer wall has been carved away here, leading to a narrow terrace.  A brisk breeze blows through the opening and down along the passageway to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":984,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":962,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":960,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":962,"x":718,"y":-309,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Terrace","descriptions":["This narrow terrace, protected from the weather by a long overhang of horned shell, offers a breathtaking panorama of the island and the shimmering waters beyond.  Windswept grassy hillocks roll away from the guildhouse, and beyond it, a sailing ship glides slowly across the crystal waves.  A brass telescope has been mounted at the edge of the deck offering an enhanced view of the sea and sky."],"exits":[{"to":961,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":963,"x":718,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["A low corridor snakes off southwest between two ridges of gleaming shell.  The main passage begins to narrow and the walk steepens slightly as it continues to wind clockwise toward the spire."],"exits":[{"to":985,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":964,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":989,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":964,"x":698,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["A tall narrow window, very nearly like an arrow slit, overlooks the western arm of Crescent Cove.  An ocean breeze whispers along the opening, producing a faint melody.  In less convivial surroundings, the wind song would be haunting."],"exits":[{"to":963,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":965,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":965,"x":678,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["Another inner chamber is accessed here through a sweeping arch with a lintel of silverwood.  Faint lights glow beyond the doorway, but little else is visible in the subdued lighting of the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":964,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":966,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":993,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":966,"x":678,"y":-339,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["The Walk of the Winds slopes upward gently as it winds clockwise through the interior of the guild.  Gleaming waves, created with an intricate pattern of blue and white tile on the floor, sweep toward the spire.  A soft breeze blows along the corridor from somewhere above carrying the scent of the sea and some faint musical tones."],"exits":[{"to":965,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":967,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":967,"x":698,"y":-319,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Entryway","descriptions":["Dim light passes through the shell, bathing the guild entrance in a soft glow.  Sounds of guild activity echo from farther along the broad corridor that curves out of sight to the northwest.  Two towering glassine doors lead out of the guildhall.","Smokeless burning torches emit a soft light, accompanied by a heady herbal scent, bathing the guild entrance in a soft glow.  Sounds of guild activity echo from farther along the broad corridor that curves out of sight to the northwest.  Two towering glassine doors lead out of the guildhall."],"exits":[{"to":966,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":968,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":969,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":968,"x":698,"y":-299,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Reception Hall","descriptions":["This enormous chamber is a gathering spot for visitors and general meetings of guild interest.  Natural seating is formed by a low ridge of pearlescent shell that runs around the edge of the hall.  Glowing spheres in ornate sconces, set high along the walls, illuminate the azure carpet like sunlight on the island shoals."],"exits":[{"to":967,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":969,"x":678,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["Approaching the building, its true nature becomes apparent -- it is the horned shell of some enormous sea creature.  Dotted with windows and narrow terraces, the central portion of the shell spirals into the sky.  Towering glassine doors lead through the mouth of the deserted husk."],"exits":[{"to":970,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":973,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":981,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":967,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":970,"x":678,"y":-479,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Crescent Cove","descriptions":["This sheltered cove, bordered by a narrow stretch of white sand, offers an egress to the island for smaller sailing vessels.  To the northwest, at the tip of one of the lagoon's protective arms, lies a small outbuilding.  Southward, the spire of a conical building dominates the sky."],"exits":[{"to":969,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":971,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":995,"exit":"go","move":"go lagoon"}]},
  {"id":971,"x":658,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Crescent Cove, Marble Shrine","descriptions":["An austere shrine of blue-veined marble stands at the edge of the lagoon's mouth.  Concentric rings of willow spread out from its circular base, the scent of spiced incense drifting from within.  To either side of the cove's entrance, jagged teeth of dark grey stone rise up to guard the northern shore."],"exits":[{"to":970,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":972,"exit":"go","move":"go shrine"}]},
  {"id":972,"x":678,"y":-519,"z":0,"title":"Crescent Cove, Shrine to Phelim","descriptions":["Open to the sky above, this quiet enclosure is dedicated to Phelim, Lord of Dreams.  Odd sigils adorn the arches forming the shrine and a raised pedestal at the center of the shrine supports a Halfling-high statue of the deity.  Though no censers are apparent, the scent of sandalwood permeates the air."],"exits":[{"to":971,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go moongate"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["shrine"]},
  {"id":973,"x":738,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["At the crest of the hill, an odd structure is visible beside a narrow stretch of beach.  The white sand is stark against the deep blue of a small lagoon.  Southward, the trail wanders back along the shoreline."],"exits":[{"to":974,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":969,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":974,"x":798,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["Crushed stone grates softly underfoot as the path ascends a small hillock dotted with willow and brambles.  White-winged birds flit through the sky overhead, while gentle breezes whisper from offshore.  From somewhere out of sight, the faint sounds of a violin drift in the salty air."],"exits":[{"to":975,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":976,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":973,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":975,"x":818,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Sheltered Docks","descriptions":["There are several boats harbored here, all festooned with dangling bells, glass and gaethzen lamps, wooden figureheads, and assortments of colored cloth and canvas.  The uptempo strains of a violin drift across the salty air, rising and falling in conjunction with the sloshing waves.  Strands of smoke drift up from the brightly painted fleet of vessels, no doubt the origin of the potent scent of spiced meals cooking."],"exits":[{"to":974,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["gypsy"]},
  {"id":976,"x":798,"y":-359,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["This pebbled trail winds roughly south and north, beside a high bamboo fence that stretches along the eastern shore.  Unseen woodland creatures scurry through the thick underbrush toward the west."],"exits":[{"to":974,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":977,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":977,"x":798,"y":-319,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Eastern Gates","descriptions":["Manicured trails lined with small dark stones wind along the coastline of the small island.  Wide bamboo gates set in a matching fence to the east permit access to the sailing docks."],"exits":[{"to":976,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":978,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":986,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":978,"x":738,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["The walkway winds through a small grove of willows and the sea glimmers through the foliage to the south.  The soft murmur of the ocean against the shore is muted by their trailing branches."],"exits":[{"to":977,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":979,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":979,"x":618,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["A particularly tall spire of granite rises from the waves at this corner of the isle like a frozen sentinel.  Thick coats of dark lichen over the weathered stone provide testimony to its age.  Smaller jagged teeth of grey rock along the shore prevent a suitable landing for any ocean travellers."],"exits":[{"to":978,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":982,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":980,"x":558,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["A small stand of trees lines the inland side of the pathway with a wall of tightly knit branches.  The ocean view is quite startling, with the sea spread like a thick azure carpet to the horizon."],"exits":[{"to":981,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":982,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1015,"exit":"go","move":"go bamboo hut"}]},
  {"id":981,"x":618,"y":-459,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["The island trail rises from the east to turn and follow the coastline southwest just before plummeting into the sea.  A rocky cliff looks over the ocean toward the main continent, far from view."],"exits":[{"to":969,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":980,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":982,"x":558,"y":-319,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Pebbled Trail","descriptions":["The trail is divided here, leading east toward the island's interior and continuing along the barren coastline.  Grey seabirds wheel against the heavens with faint screeching cries carried on a salt-tainted breeze."],"exits":[{"to":980,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":983,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":979,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":983,"x":578,"y":-319,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Grove of the Obelisk","descriptions":["A translucent obelisk, the small island's namesake, dominates the center of this silent grove.  Oddly, no sounds of wildlife penetrate the thick foliage surrounding the small meadow.  A slab of reddish-brown stone lies to one side of the obelisk."],"exits":[{"to":982,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":996,"exit":"go","move":"go slab stone"}]},
  {"id":984,"x":738,"y":-349,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["One of the guild's tall windows sings softly along the corridor.  Just opposite, a particularly wide arch opens onto another central room.  The smells of fresh-baked bread drift from within."],"exits":[{"to":985,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":961,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":988,"exit":"go","move":"go arc"},{"to":988,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":985,"x":738,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Walk of the Winds","descriptions":["Waves of blue and white tile race along the hallway as it winds out of sight to the south.  The intricate floor mosaic gives the illusion of increased speed as the passage narrows, with gleaming white-capped waves bordered by rushing patterns of foam."],"exits":[{"to":984,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":963,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":986,"x":828,"y":-319,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath, Docks","descriptions":["A long dock, lined with pillars made from delicately carved cherry wood, stretches along the eastern shoreline.  Surmounted by a sign lettered in silver script, a wide pair of bamboo gates stands open to visitors."],"exits":[{"to":987,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":977,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["dock"]},
  {"id":987,"x":828,"y":-299,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Docks, Night Sky Landing","descriptions":["Seabirds screech and dive into the waves at the end of the dock.  Grasping shellfish from the shoals, they rise high above the rocky shoreline to release their unfortunate prey.","The celestial light of the heavens sparkles across the ocean waves even on the darkest of nights.  Seabirds occasionally wheel across the skies with a screech."],"exits":[{"to":986,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1016,"exit":"go","move":"go night"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Night Sky"]},
  {"id":988,"x":758,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Dining Hall","descriptions":["Lined with long communal tables made from dark-stained cherry wood, the exotic scents of spiced meat and herbal concoctions fill this luxurious dining hall.  No kitchens are in sight, the builders having gone to some trouble to conceal any evidence of the mundane.  Nonetheless, servants periodically bustle in and out with heaping trays of food or empty dishes, coming and going through doorways that vanish from sight the moment they're closed."],"exits":[{"to":984,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":989,"x":708,"y":-379,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Service Hallway","descriptions":["Dank and gloomy, a smoking torch lights the way along the cramped service passages at the very heart of the guild.  Corridors wander off drunkenly in various directions, following the natural contours of the shell's structure.  Most areas are blocked by low doorways, shaped to fit the irregular openings and sounds of activity drift in from the main hallway."],"exits":[{"to":990,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":992,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":992,"exit":"go","move":"go circular door"},{"to":963,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":990,"x":708,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Guard Room","descriptions":["A particularly unusual room somewhere in the center of the guild.  It is almost perfectly circular and the floor is covered with a complex pattern of lines.  A short pearly stairway winds up to the passages above.","Located somewhere near the center of the shell, the chamber is almost nearly circular and the floor is covered with a complex pattern of lines.  Perfectly centered within the pattern is a large cube crafted from semi-opaque crystal.  A low teak table sits near one wall, and a short pearly stairway winds up to the passages above."],"exits":[{"to":989,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["guard"]},
  {"id":991,"x":718,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Cleaning Closet","descriptions":["Nothing holds interest in this room beyond a bucket of dirty mop water and a filthy dust rag.  The scents of wax and antiseptic cleaners are strong in the air."],"exits":[{"to":989,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":992,"x":698,"y":-369,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Chamber of Justice","descriptions":["A magistrate shuffles through papers behind a long table, occasionally pausing to sign this one or stamp that one with his personal seal.  A harried clerk bustles back and forth between the table and a row of cabinets along one wall, in the age old dance of bureaucracy."],"exits":[{"to":989,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["justice"]},
  {"id":993,"x":658,"y":-389,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Library","descriptions":["Light chases away the darkness of the room from highly polished niches along the walls.  An occasional rustling from among the rows of high bookcases betrays the presence of at least one researcher.  With every footstep, the scents of dust and moldering paper fill the air."],"exits":[{"to":994,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":965,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Library"]},
  {"id":994,"x":658,"y":-409,"z":0,"title":"Taisgath Guildhouse, Contemplation Chamber","descriptions":["Windowless and dimly lit, a few scattered cushions provide seating for those who come to meditate and collate information they've gathered.  Incense slowly burns in hanging sconces, filling the dusky chamber with the soothing scent of sandalwood and a faint sheen of wispy grey smoke."],"exits":[{"to":993,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":995,"x":678,"y":-499,"z":0,"title":"Crescent Cove, Lagoon","descriptions":["Bordered by a beach of silver-white sand, the small lagoon is just large enough for a relaxing swim to the edge of the open sea.  Currently guarded by a coarse bamboo gate, the lagoon provides safe harbor for smaller seacraft tied along one side of the shore."],"exits":[{"to":970,"exit":"go","move":"go beach"}]},
  {"id":996,"x":558,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"Beneath Taisgath Island, Subterranean Depths","descriptions":["Dense fog rolls its way up to the makeshift ceiling of crumbling basalt, riding cold blasts of chilling air rising from the inky darkness far below.  Faint illumination filters through fissures in the jet-black stonework, giving life to the deepening shadows as the light reflects off the swirling mist and vapor-moistened walls.  A soft whisper rises in volume to a cacophonous howl as cold wind rushes quickly up from the depths, only to be followed by a haunting stillness."],"exits":[{"to":997,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":983,"exit":"go","move":"go wide fissure"}]},
  {"id":997,"x":558,"y":-259,"z":0,"title":"Beneath Taisgath Island, Subterranean Depths","descriptions":["Slick from the cold moisture-ridden air and loose crumbling rock that layers the floor, passage through the dark narrowing tunnel becomes treacherous and daunting.  Deep cuts and slashes trail the length of the pitted basalt walls, as though something extremely sharp had been dragged unwillingly into the murky depths of shadow and stone."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":996,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":998,"x":598,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["Water seeps slowly through the dark basalt of the walls, spattering loudly in shallow pools dotting the floor.  Dense shadows creep in silence along every surface, occasionally disturbed by the flickering of faint illumination as it reflects off the rippling puddles.  Just breaking through the surface of the strata above is a faint line of translucent material forming a straight edge along the ceiling border."],"exits":[{"to":999,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":997,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":999,"x":618,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["Steeply inclined and damp from the surrounding moisture, the flooring becomes quite treacherous as the path continues on its way deeper into the darkness.  A soft glow barely perceptible in the gloom illuminates a small crack in the cavern wall, the fissure heaving outward as though something had been pushing through the heavy black rock and finally given up its attempt, or merely stopped to rest before trying again."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1000,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1000,"x":558,"y":-239,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["Deepening shadows and echoing footfalls flow eerily behind each step around the curvature of the narrowing cavern walls.  A distant roar rises upon the still air filling the tunnel then lessens steadily into silence before crashing once again far below.  With each thunderous rush, dense mist fills the air momentarily, causing the smooth rock underfoot to become even more hazardous than before."],"exits":[{"to":999,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1001,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1001,"x":538,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["Hushed whispers echo softly through the tunnel, a multitude of muted voices chanting in discordant rhythms of incongruous verse.  Droplets of inky-black moisture trickle down the face of the rough sandstone walls, coming together in a shallow pool of rippling shadowy fluid, barren of any reflective qualities save for a faintly glowing image that appears to hover on the surface of the murky puddle."],"exits":[{"to":1000,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1003,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1002,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1002,"x":518,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["The tunnel comes to an abrupt end, though it takes several moments of staring at a featureless wall that is as black as space to realize this.  The air, chill and stale, seems to grow heavier with each passing moment.  The only sounds come from the faint dripping of some black liquid down the walls and a soft, sibilant whisper from the surrounding darkness."],"exits":[{"to":1001,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":1003,"x":538,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Limestone Strata","descriptions":["The sound of dripping water carries in faintly from the north, though curiously flat in tone.  The tunnel here seems to have a strange acoustic quality, making it easy to blame the most ordinary of sounds for that of something breathing, watching just outside the field of vision.  It is, however, harder to dismiss the darker patches of gloom that seem to move along the walls as any natural phenomena."],"exits":[{"to":1001,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1004,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":1004,"x":538,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Bedrock Strata","descriptions":["Walls glisten with condensation, and the echoing sounds of dripping grow ever louder as the tunnel widens.  A faint glimmer comes from the near east, but this does not banish the flickering dark shapes that linger along the slick walls.  A soft, sibilant murmur reaches all travelers' ears, washing against them like the cold touch of Aldauth."],"exits":[{"to":1005,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1003,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":1005,"x":578,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Bedrock Strata","descriptions":["Malevolent shadows linger here, unbanished even by the odd brightness of this area, and from those shadows come the soft, rhythmic sounds of something breathing.  Water drips from all around the sound of its impact against the cold stone floor is curiously flat.  The source of the unnatural, flickering light is a hefty wall of translucent material that would humble even the tallest of people."],"exits":[{"to":1006,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1004,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1006,"x":598,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Bedrock Strata","descriptions":["Curving around a set of great translucent shards, the cavern slopes like a great spiral ramp.  The dim light of the shards reflects from the slick stone walls and casts long shadows that reach far into the branching corridors.  From the depths below, the irregular beat of dripping water echoes faintly."],"exits":[{"to":1007,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1005,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1008,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1007,"x":618,"y":-219,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Bedrock Strata","descriptions":["The blank, curving stone walls of this dead end magnify any sound in the deathlike silence of these tunnels.  The rustle of fabric becomes a stormy sea, and the tinkling of the persistent drops of black water becomes a slow, maddening drumbeat.  From all around comes the whisper of breath, creating a damp air that clings to flesh and stone alike."],"exits":[{"to":1006,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1008,"x":578,"y":-199,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Bedrock Strata","descriptions":["Glistening like faint stars on the dank floor, translucent shards of strange material stick out in a curve along the walls.  There is a constant puff of moving air, unusual in this place where all seems still and dead, yet shadows continue to linger close as if unwilling to let through any trespass."],"exits":[{"to":1006,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1009,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":1009,"x":598,"y":-179,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Scarred Tunnels","descriptions":["Jagged scars line the walls.  Older gashes, deep and smoothed by time, are overlaid with sharp jagged scrapes from a much more recent time.  Water trickles along them, creating glistening highlights along the ragged edges.  In blind rage or as a warning, something has marked this place.  Small fragments yet remain of translucent shards, leading northwest in a continuing curve."],"exits":[{"to":1010,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1008,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1010,"x":578,"y":-159,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Scarred Tunnels","descriptions":["To the northeast, the corridor narrows to become barely passable and, along with the sharp downward slope, effectively isolates this area from the surrounding tunnels.  From the rocky ceiling, large fans of some luminescent fungus dispel the darkness, making this place less attractive to the shadowy creatures that roam the cavern.  Despite the reassuring glow, however, the sounds of breathing are never far away and act as a constant reminder of what waits beyond this small sanctuary."],"exits":[{"to":1009,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1011,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":1011,"x":578,"y":-139,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Flooded Cavern","descriptions":["Vicious scars mar the dank, dark walls of the cavern.  Between the cold, black water that floods here and the sharp stalactites and stalagmites that fill the room, easy movement is but a faint hope.  Barely a glimmer of light can survive here, with the floodwater as dark as the stones themselves."],"exits":[{"to":1012,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":1010,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1012,"x":558,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Flooded Cavern","descriptions":["Crisscrossing claw marks rake the walls, the graffiti of vengeance and victory.  Water drips down the length of limestone pillars and from the fang-like stalactites still reaching to pierce the surface of the water.  Beneath the waterline, the hidden floor of the cavern is far from smooth.  Small holes and jutting arms of stone hinder progress, especially toward the west where the path becomes narrower."],"exits":[{"to":1011,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":1014,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":1013,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1013,"x":538,"y":-119,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Flooded Cavern","descriptions":["The water here pools like a silent onyx lake, broken only by the sounds of the incessant dripping that reverberate hollowly around the chamber.  At the western edge, a series of worn stone steps lead up from the water's surface to a carved archway bearing three colored stones."],"exits":[{"to":1012,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":0,"exit":"none","move":"carved archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1014,"x":578,"y":-99,"z":0,"title":"Subterranean Depths, Flooded Cavern","descriptions":["The stone walls spread from each other here, then come together at the far end of the watery cavern, forming a wide circle.  Drops of water disturb the still surface of the small underground lake and cast distorted reflections of the ubiquitous claw marks upon the walls.  Large fragments of shattered stone rise from the water's depths, their jagged edges slowly smoothing as the dripping water endlessly reshapes the rock."],"exits":[{"to":1012,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1015,"x":538,"y":-399,"z":0,"title":"Tokka Painter's Hut, Front Room","descriptions":["Heavy draperies line the inner walls of this bamboo and thatch hut, intended to please the eye and shield the interior of the dwelling from any inclement weather.  Lambent illumination, thrown by the wavering flame of a box lantern suspended from the ceiling, struggles to fill the chamber.  A thick curtain divides the space, hiding a portion of the room from sight."],"exits":[{"to":980,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tokka Shop"]},
  {"id":1016,"x":828,"y":-279,"z":0,"title":"The Night Sky, Main Deck","descriptions":["The salt-stained sail rises high above, emblazoned with the form of a tall pyramid.  The captain barks orders to a meager crew of two, who don't appear in any great hurry to complete their assigned tasks.  Rigging lines and stray coils of rope create a hazardous path across the deck."],"exits":[{"to":987,"exit":"go","move":"go taisgath docks"}]}
 ],
